are Hammers (Bare Bones x Just Hammers)","Just hammers but in the bare bones style","this resource pack combines the just hammers mod with the bare bones style. (my update some textures in teh future idk yet)","2025-07-29T08:30:02.366874Z","2025-07-29T08:33:53.774288Z","2025-08-03T20:45:34.012061Z","2025-07-29T08:41:43.912346Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved",195,[15,194,268],[],[377],[30027],"5WEtjs5g","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/c7bcf0b851f2f29f7f748e0f9100cf98c394636f.png",[],[30031,30036,30041,30046,30051],{"url":30032,"raw_url":30033,"featured":439,"title":30034,"description":3571,"created":30035,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/images/65bc9255027c014fdee854226c66a62a1f4f57fb_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/images/65bc9255027c014fdee854226c66a62a1f4f57fb.png","hammers without the pack","2025-07-29T08:40:16.761723Z",{"url":30037,"raw_url":30038,"featured":439,"title":30039,"description":3571,"created":30040,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/images/a2f179e3f558cb2dfab82673f7e6b92fd92e42a5_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/images/a2f179e3f558cb2dfab82673f7e6b92fd92e42a5.png","upgrades with pack","2025-07-29T08:39:32.401740Z",{"url":30042,"raw_url":30043,"featured":439,"title":30044,"description":3571,"created":30045,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/images/b4ac143be825738b07b326f66c593f6c6ffcfaee_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/images/b4ac143be825738b07b326f66c593f6c6ffcfaee.png","hammers with the pack","2025-07-29T08:40:03.099316Z",{"url":30047,"raw_url":30048,"featured":439,"title":30049,"description":3571,"created":30050,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/images/b6d368bdcb0441c9da236316970f6fbbf4e4e162_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/images/b6d368bdcb0441c9da236316970f6fbbf4e4e162.png","upgrades without pack","2025-07-29T08:39:07.006244Z",{"url":30052,"raw_url":30052,"featured":439,"title":30053,"description":3571,"created":30054,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s324iQVe/images/c7bcf0b851f2f29f7f748e0f9100cf98c394636f.png","logo","2025-07-29T08:40:28.639729Z",9528631,"ug2MpCiI",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30058,"id":30059,"slug":30060,"project_type":31,"team":30061,"organization":3571,"title":30062,"description":30063,"body":30064,"body_url":3571,"published":30065,"updated":30066,"approved":30067,"queued":30068,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30069,"downloads":30072,"followers":30073,"categories":30074,"additional_categories":30075,"loaders":30076,"versions":30077,"icon_url":30097,"issues_url":30098,"source_url":30099,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":30100,"donation_urls":30101,"gallery":30104,"color":30124,"thread_id":30059,"monetization_status":30006},[2066],"s32LssQX","universal-tweaks","STtSCljZ","Universal Tweaks","A community project to consolidate various bugfixes and tweaks into a single solution for Minecraft 1.12.2","![Available for MC 1.12.2](https://img.shields.io/badge/Available%20for-MC%201.12.2-3498db.svg?labelColor=34495e&style=for-the-badge)\n![License LGPL-3.0](https://img.shields.io/github/license/ACGaming/UniversalTweaks?labelColor=34495e&color=3498db&style=for-the-badge)\n[![Stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/ACGaming/UniversalTweaks?labelColor=34495e&color=3498db&style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/ACGaming/UniversalTweaks/stargazers)\n\n# UNIVERSAL TWEAKS\n\n### A one-stop-shop for all bugfixing and tweaking needs\n\nUniversal Tweaks consolidates various bugfixes and tweaks into a single solution for Minecraft 1.12.2.\n\nAll changes are toggleable via config files.\n\n[![Requires MixinBooter](https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-MixinBooter-3498db.svg?labelColor=34495e&style=for-the-badge)](https://modrinth.com/mod/mixinbooter)\n[![Requires ConfigAnytime](https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-ConfigAnytime-3498db.svg?labelColor=34495e&style=for-the-badge)](https://modrinth.com/mod/configanytime)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/1EmHZlb.png)\n\n### **✨ Interested in best practices for your modpack? PackCompanion got you covered!**\n\n[**PackCompanion**](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packcompanion) is the ultimate sentinel mod for 1.12.2 designed to perform a runtime check for modpack stability. It automatically identifies mods that are outdated, problematic, or superseded by modern alternatives.\n\n### **📦 Want a premade modpack that does the boring work for you? Check out BareBones Template!**\n\n**BareBones** is a template modpack for Minecraft 1.12.2 that aims to create a minimalistic standardized mod list that can be used as a base for new modpacks or a means of updating old modpacks to the new standards.\n\nAvailable in flavors [**Cleanroom**](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/barebones-template-cleanroom) and [**Forge**](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/barebones-template-forge).\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/1EmHZlb.png)\n\n### **🐞 BUGFIXES**\n\n* **Accurate Smooth Lighting:** Improves the accuracy of smooth lighting by checking for suffocation and light opacity\n* **Anvil Repairable Check:** Fixes anvils allowing to repair irreparable items\n* **Attack Radius:** Improves the attack radius of hostile mobs by checking the line of sight with raytracing\n* **Banner Bounding Box:** Fixes rendering issues with banners by correctly sizing their render bounding boxes\n* **Block Fire:** Prevents fire projectiles burning entities when blocking with shields\n* **Block Overlay:** Fixes x-ray when standing in non-suffocating blocks\n* **Block Selection Box Offset:** Fixes the offset of mouseover selection boxes for blocks\n* **Boat Breaking Fall Height:** Sets the required fall height in blocks for boats to break\n* **Boat Riding Offset:** Fixes entities glitching through the bottom of boats\n* **Chunk Saving:** Fixes loading of outdated chunks to prevent duplications, deletions and data corruption\n* **Comparator Timing:** Fixes inconsistent delays of comparators to prevent redstone timing issues\n* **Concurrent Entity AI Tasks:** Replaces linked entity AI task sets with concurrent sets to avoid mod exception concerning entity AI\n* **Crafted Item Statistics:** Fixes crafted item statistics not increasing correctly when items are crafted with shift-click or drop methods\n* **Death Time:** Fixes corrupted entities exceeding the allowed death time\n* **Depth Mask:** Fixes entity and particle rendering issues by enabling depth buffer writing\n* **Destroy Entity Packets:** Fixes lag caused by dead entities by sending additional packets when the player is not alive\n* **Difficulty Consistency:** Fixes mismatching difficulty settings if a mod loads new dimensions before the world is loaded on client side\n* **Dimension Change Player States:** Fixes missing player states when changing dimensions by sending additional packets\n* **Disconnect Dupe:** Fixes item dupes when players are dropping items and disconnecting\n* **Double Food Consumption:** Fixes consuming a food item having a chance of also consuming a second item without any animation\n* **Donkey/Mule Dupe:** Fixes a duplication exploit connected to the inventories of donkeys and mules\n* **Elytra Deployment & Landing:** Relocate elytra deployment and landing to client side to prevent issues with high latencies\n* **Enchantment Level Visibility:** Fixes enchantments displaying unlocalized levels\n* **Entity Bounding Boxes:** Saves entity bounding boxes to tags to prevent breakouts and suffocation\n* **Entity Desync:** Fixes entity motion desyncs most notable with arrows and thrown items\n* **Entity ID:** Fixes non-functional elytra firework boosting and guardian targeting if the entity ID is 0\n* **Entity Lists**\n    * **Chunk Updates:** Fixes chunk entity lists often not getting updated correctly\n    * **World Additions:** Fixes client-side memory leak where some entity ids are not set before being added to the world's entity list\n* **Entity NaN:** Prevents corruption of entities caused by invalid health or damage values\n* **Entity Suffocation:** Pushes entities out of blocks when growing up to prevent suffocation\n* **Entity Tracker:** Fixes entity tracker to prevent client-sided desyncs when teleporting or changing dimensions\n* **Entity UUID:** Changes UUIDs of loaded entities in case their UUIDs are already assigned (and removes log spam)\n* **Exhaustion:** Fixes saturation depleting in peaceful mode\n* **Extend Item Durability Range:** Changes the durability storing to use ints instead of shorts, eliminating many issues with high-durability items (I.E. TiC tools)\n* **Falling Block End Portal Dupe:** Prevents duplication of falling blocks through end portals\n* **Falling Block Entity Damage:** Only damage living entities hit by falling blocks, prevents killing items and XP\n* **Faster Background Startup:** Fixes slow background startup edge case caused by checking tooltips during the loading process\n* **Fixes Invisible Player when Flying with Elytra:** Fixes the player model occasionally disappearing when flying with elytra in a straight line in third-person mode\n* **Frustum Culling:** Fixes invisible chunks in edge cases (small enclosed rooms at chunk borders)\n* **Help:** Replaces the help command, sorts and reports broken commands\n* **Hopper Bounding Box:** Slims down the hopper bounding box for easier access of nearby blocks\n* **Hopper Insert Safety Check:** Prevents crashes when the destination tile entity becomes unavailable during the item insert process\n* **Horse Falling:** Modifies falling logic of horses, listening to LivingFallEvent and taking jump boost into account\n* **Item Frame Void:** Prevents voiding held items when right + left-clicking on an item frame simultaneously\n* **Ladder Flying Slowdown:** Disables climbing movement when flying\n* **Locale:** Prevents various crashes with Turkish locale\n* **Max Health:** Corrects maximum player health on joining by setting the last saved health value\n* **Minecart AI:** Fixes non-player entities being able to control minecarts\n* **Mining Glitch:** Prevents ghost blocks by sending an additional block change packet\n* **Mobs Crossing Rails:** Fixes mobs being unable to cross rails during pathfinding\n* **Mount Desync:** Fixes mounts and boats sometimes disappearing after dismounting\n* **Occlusion Culling Threshold:** Determines the required amount of opaque blocks in the chunk to enable occlusion culling\n* **Ocelot Biome Spawn List:** Fixes ocelots being incorrectly included in biome monster spawn lists\n* **Overlay Message Fade Out:** Fixes Forge's overlay message (action bar) fade out regression\n* **Packet Size:** Increases the packet size limit to account for large packets in modded environments\n* **Particle Spawning:** Fixes various particle types not showing up on the client\n* **Piston Progress:** Properly saves the last state of pistons to tags\n* **Piston Retraction:** Improves retraction behavior on double piston extenders\n* **Portal Location Link:** Lets Nether portals link to the player's overworld entry portal if within the configured search distance\n* **Portal Traveling Dupe:** Fixes duplication issues that can occur when entities travel through portals\n* **Potion Amplifier Visibility:** Fixes potion effects not displaying their level above 'IV'\n* **Shear Mooshroom Dupe:** Fixes a duplication exploit connected to shearing mooshrooms\n* **Skeleton Aim:** Fixes skeletons not looking at their targets when strafing\n* **Sleep Resets Weather:** Fixes sleeping always resetting rain and thunder times\n* **Spectator Menu:** Fixes the spectator menu not showing player skins\n* **Third Person Camera Orientation:** Fixes a raytracing bug which causes third person camera tilting to be slightly asymmetric\n* **Tile Entity Map:** Replaces the chunk position data table to prevent tile entity related issues\n* **Untipped Arrow Particles:** Fixes untipped arrows emitting blue tipped arrow particles upon reloading a world\n* **Village Component Parts:** Always builds village structures with biome-specific blocks, improves compatibility with mods such as BiomeTweaker\n* **Villager Mantle:** Returns missing hoods to villager mantles\n* **Witch Huts:** Fixes witch hut structure data not accounting for the height it is generated at\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/1EmHZlb.png)\n\n### **🔧 TWEAKS**\n\n* **Accurate Potion Duration:** Always displays the actual potion duration instead of `**:**`\n* **Advancement Screenshot:** Silently takes a screenshot every time an advancement is achieved\n* **Advancement GUI**\n    * Allows increasing the Advancement GUI to scale with the screen size\n    * Moves the page buttons to in-line with the rest of the GUI instead of hovering significantly\n    * Hides page switching buttons when at the maximum/minimum page count\n    * Disables the background fading when hovering over an advancement\n    * Adds Advancement Page Title text to the Advancement GUI header\n* **Adaptive XP Drops:** Scales dropped experience from entities based on their health\n* **Always Eat:** Allows the consumption of food at any time, regardless of the hunger bar\n* **Always Return to Main Menu:** Always returns the player to the main menu when quitting the game\n* **Anvil XP Level Cap:** Sets the experience level cap for anvil recipes\n* **Armed Armor Stands:** Enables arms for armor stands by default\n* **Armor Curve:** Adjusts the armor scaling and degradation formulae for mobs and players\n* **Armor Swap:** Enable the ability to swap equipped armor when right-clicking armor, instead of only being able to equip armor when the slot is empty. Also applies to Elytra\n* **Arrow Layers:** Reintroduces rendering of hit arrows on mobs from Beta versions of Minecraft\n* **Attributes:** Sets custom ranges for entity attributes\n* **Attribute Keeper:** Specify attributes that will persist through player death\n* **Auto Jump Replacement:** Replaces auto jump with an increased step height (singleplayer only)\n* **Auto Save Interval:** Configurable interval in ticks between world auto saves\n* **Auto Switch Tools:** Switches the selected hotbar slot to a proper tool if required\n* **Bed Obstruction Replacement:** Replaces bed obstruction checks with an improved version\n* **Better Burning**\n    * Fixes some edge cases where fire damage sources won't cause mobs to drop their cooked items\n    * Allows skeletons to shoot flaming arrows when on fire (30% chance * regional difficulty)\n    * If entities have fire resistance, they get extinguished right away when on fire\n    * Allows fire to spread from entity to entity (30% chance * regional difficulty)\n    * Prevents the fire animation overlay from being displayed when the player is immune to fire\n* **Better Harvest:** Prevents breaking lower parts of sugar cane and cacti as well as unripe crops, unless sneaking\n* **Better Ignition:** Enables ignition of entities by right-clicking instead of awkwardly lighting the block under them\n* **Better Ping Display:** Displays the ping in milliseconds of players when viewing the server list\n* **Better Placement:** Removes the delay between placing blocks\n* **Better Rail Placement:** Implements an improved system that makes rails face the player when placed\n* **Block Dispenser:** Allows dispensers to place blocks\n* **Block Hit Delay:** Sets the delay in ticks between breaking blocks\n* **Boat Speed:** Sets the acceleration value for controlling boats\n* **Infinity:**\n    * **Bow Infinity Remedy:** Bows enchanted with Infinity no longer require arrows\n    * **Mending and Infinity:** Allows the Infinity Enchantment to be combined with Mending\n    * **Infinity Affects All Arrows:** Allows the Infinity Enchantment to apply to all arrows (e.g. Tipped Arrows)\n* **Breakable Bedrock:** Allows customizable mining of bedrock\n* **Broadcast Sounds:** Controls broadcasting of Ender Dragon, End portal creation and Wither sounds\n* **Burning Baby Zombies:** Lets baby zombies burn in daylight as in Minecraft 1.13+\n* **Burning Skeletons:** Prevents skeletons burning in daylight\n* **Burning Zombies:** Prevents zombies burning in daylight\n* **Cave Generation:** Sets custom values for the vanilla cave generation\n* **Charged Creeper Spawning:** Sets the chance for creepers to spawn charged\n* **Chat:**\n    * **Chat Lines:** Sets the maximum number of chat lines to display\n    * **Compact Messages:** Removes duplicate messages and instead put a number behind the message how often it was repeated\n    * **Keep Sent Messages:** Don't clear sent message history on leaving the world\n    * **Keep Chat Active on waking:** When waking up from bed, if the chat had text keep the chat window open\n* **Check Animated Models:** Improves model load times by checking if an animated model exists before trying to load it\n* **Chicken Shedding:** Allows chickens to have a chance to shed feathers (similarly to laying eggs)\n* **Chunk Gen Limit:** Limits maximum chunk generation per tick for improved server performance\n* **Cobweb Slowness:** Modifies the applied slowness factor when entities are moving in cobwebs\n* **Connection Timeouts:** Allows configuring read/login timeouts\n    * Helps slow clients log into a server of a large modpack\n* **Copy World Seed:** Enables clicking of `/seed` world seed in chat to copy to clipboard\n* **Coyote Time Jumping:** Lets the player jump a couple frames after stepping off a ledge, similar to jumping in many platformers\n* **Crafting Cache:** Adds an IRecipe cache to improve recipe performance in large modpacks\n* **Creeper Confetti:** Replaces deadly creeper explosions with delightful confetti (with a configurable chance)\n* **Critical Arrow Damage:** Sets the additional damage that critical arrows deal\n* **Custom Rarity:** Sets custom rarities for items, affecting tooltip colors\n* **Custom Use Duration:** Sets custom use durations for items like shields, affecting the maximum block time\n* **Damage Tilt:** Restores feature to tilt the camera when damaged\n* **Damage Velocity:** Enables the modification of damage sources that change the entity's velocity\n* **Default Difficulty:** Sets the default difficulty for newly generated worlds\n* **Default GUI Text Color:** Sets the default GUI text color (HEX RGB code) which can improve readability in dark mode resource packs\n* **Dimension Unload:** Unloads dimensions not in use to free up resources\n* **Dirt To Path:** Dirt can be shoveled into grass paths and grass paths can be shoveled into dirt\n* **Disable Advancements:** Prevents the advancement system from loading entirely\n* **Disable Audio Debug:** Improves loading times by removing debug code for missing sounds and subtitles\n* **Disable Creeper Music Discs:** Disables creepers dropping music discs when slain by skeletons\n* **Disable Fancy Missing Model:** Improves rendering performance by removing the resource location text on missing models\n* **Disable FOV:** Disables FOV changes caused by sprinting, potions, or armor attributes\n* **Disable Hotbar Scroll Wrapping:** Disables using the scroll wheel to change hotbar slots wrapping\n* **Disable Mob Spawner Entity Render:** Disables rendering an entity inside of Mob Spawners\n* **Disable Narrator:** Disables the narrator functionality entirely\n* **Disable Rain Particles:** Prevents Rain and Snow Particles from rendering when Raining or Thundering\n* **Disable Glint Overlay on Enchantment Books:** Disables the glint overlay on enchantment books\n* **Disable Glint Overlay on Potions:** Disables the glint overlay on potions\n* **Disable Sleeping:** Disables skipping night by using a bed while making it still able to set spawn\n* **Disable Sleeping Setting Spawn:** Disables setting the spawn point by using a bed while making it still able to sleep\n* **Disable Text Shadowing:** Disables all text shadowing, where text has a darker version of itself rendered behind the normal text, changing the appearance and can improve fps on some screens\n* **Disable Villager Trade Leveling:** Disables leveling of villager careers, only allowing base level trades\n* **Disable Villager Trade Restock:** Disables restocking of villager trades, only allowing one trade per offer\n* **Disable Wither Targeting AI:** Disables withers targeting animals\n* **Display Title:** Determines the title of the game window\n* **Dragon Kill:** Allows setting dragon kill experience drops and egg spawn after first kill\n* **Easy Breeding:** Enables easy breeding of animals by tossing food on the ground\n* **End Crystal Placement:** Allows placing end crystals on more blocks than obsidian or bedrock below\n* **End Portal Parallax:** Re-implements parallax rendering of the end portal from 1.11 and older\n* **Entity Radius Check**\n    * These tweaks are only effective if you have mod(s) that increase `World.MAX_ENTITY_RADIUS`! (Lycanites Mobs, Advanced Rocketry, Immersive Railroading, etc.)\n    * Reduces the search size of various AABB functions for specified entity types to improve performance\n    * Reduces size of collision checks for most vanilla and specified entity types to improve performance\n* **Explosion Block Drop Chance:** Determines the numerator of the block drop formula on explosions\n* **Falling Block Lifespan:** Determines how long falling blocks remain in ticks until they are dropped under normal circumstances\n* **Fast Dye Blending:** Replaces color lookup for sheep to check a predefined table rather than querying the recipe registry\n* **Fast Leaf Decay:** Makes leaves decay faster when trees are chopped\n* **Fast Prefix Checking:** Optimizes Forge's ID prefix checking and removes prefix warnings impacting load time\n* **Fast World Loading:** Skips garbage collection to speed up world loading\n* **Faster Advancement Trigger Checking:** Optimizes triggering advancements when obtaining items\n* **Fence Gate Placing:** Allows placing Fence Gates without a supporting block\n* **Fence/Wall Jump:** Allows the player to jump over fences and walls\n* **Finite Water:** Prevents creation of infinite water sources outside of ocean and river biomes\n* **First Person Burning Overlay:** Sets the offset for the fire overlay in first person when the player is burning\n* **Flat Bedrock:** Allows height control over bedrock layer generation\n* **Forge Mod List Improvements:** Improves the Forge mod list GUI by remembering last searches and supporting pipes `|` to look up multiple mods\n* **Glass Bottle Consumes Water Source:** Causes Glass Bottles to consume the source block of water\n* **Glass Bottle Returns:** Respects stack sizes of water bottles when returning glass bottles on cauldron interactions\n* **Growth Size:** Configurable growth height/length for sugar cane, cacti and vines\n* **Hardcore Buckets:** Prevents placing of liquid source blocks in the world\n* **Hide Personal Effect Particles:** Disables potion effect particles emitting from yourself\n* **Hunger Threshold to Sprint:** Sets the limit of required hunger to be able to sprint\n* **Husk & Stray Spawning:** Lets husks and strays spawn underground like regular zombies and skeletons\n* **Improve Barrier Particle Display:** Causes Barrier Particles to always be displayed to players in Creative mode\n* **Improve Language Switching Speed:** Improves the speed of switching languages in the Language GUI\n* **Improve Server Connection Speed:** Improves the speed of connecting to servers by setting the InetAddress host name to the IP in situations where it can be represented as the IP address, preventing getHostFromNameService from being to be run\n* **Incremental Time Command:** Lets `/time set day` and `/time set night` commands skip to the actual next day/night instead of resetting total world time\n* **Incurable Potions:** Excludes potion effects from being curable with curative items like buckets of milk\n* **Infinite Music:** Lets background music play continuously without delays\n* **Inhospitable Nether Roof:** Effectively limits the Nether to its actual height and applies void damage to entities\n* **Interrupt Eating:** Interrupts consumption of food and drinks upon taking damage\n* **Item Entities:** Enables the modification of item entity properties\n* **LAN Server Properties:** Enhance the vanilla 'Open to LAN' GUI for listening port customization, removal of enforced authentication and more\n* **Lenient Paths:** Allows the creation of grass paths everywhere (beneath fence gates, trapdoors, ...)\n* **Lightning**\n    * **Lightning Damage:** Sets the damage lightning bolts deal to entities\n    * **Lightning Fire Ticks:** Sets the duration in ticks lightning bolts set entities on fire\n    * **No Lightning Fire:** Disables the creation of fire around lightning strikes\n    * **No Lightning Flash:** Disables the flashing of skybox and ground brightness on lightning strikes\n    * **No Lightning Item Destruction:** Prevents lightning bolts from destroying items\n* **Linear XP Amount:** Sets the amount of XP needed for each level, effectively removing the increasing level scaling\n* **Load Sounds:** Plays sounds when the game or the world are loaded\n* **Mending Overpowered:** If mending fix is enabled, repairs entire damaged inventory with XP\n* **Mending:** Only repairs damaged equipment with XP\n* **Minecart Drops Itself:** Replaces vanilla Minecarts dropping a Minecart and the contained item, and instead drop the combined item\n* **Mob Despawning Improvement:** Mobs carrying picked up items will despawn properly (and optionally drop their equipment)\n* **Mob Griefing:** Controls mob griefing through customizable lists\n* **Mob Spawning Light Level:** Sets the maximum light level for hostile mobs to spawn\n* **Modern Knockback:** Backports 1.16+ knockback to 1.12: Knockback resistance is now a scale instead of a probability\n* **More Banner Layers:** Sets the amount of applicable pattern layers for banners\n* **Music Control:** Enables various music playback control tweaks\n* **Mute Advancement Errors:** Silences advancement errors\n* **Mute Texture Map Errors:** Silences texture map errors\n* **No Attack Cooldown:** Disables the 1.9 combat update attack cooldown\n* **No Crafting Repair:** Disables crafting recipes for repairing tools\n* **No Enchantment Table Obstruction:** Allows blocks between enchantment tables and bookshelves\n* **No Golems:** Disables the manual creation of golems and withers\n* **No Leftover Breath Bottles:** Disables dragon's breath from leaving off empty bottles when a stack is brewed with\n* **No Night Vision Flash:** Disables the flashing effect when the night vision potion effect is about to run out\n* **No Pathfinding Chunk Loading:** Disables mob pathfinding from loading new/unloaded chunks when building chunk caches to improve performance\n* **No Potion Shift:** Disables the inventory shift when potion effects are active\n* **No Portal Spawning:** Prevents zombie pigmen spawning from nether portals\n* **No Redstone Lighting:** Disables lighting of active redstone, repeaters, and comparators to improve performance\n* **No Saddled Wandering:** Stops horses wandering around when saddled\n* **No Skeleton Trap Spawning:** Prevents skeleton traps spawning during thunderstorms\n* **No Smelting XP:** Disables the experience reward when smelting items in furnaces\n* **Offhand Improvement:** Prevents placing offhand blocks when blocks or food are held in the mainhand\n* **Overhaul Beacon:** Change how beacon construct and range apply per level\n* **Overlay Message Height:** Sets the Y value of the overlay message (action bar), displayed for playing records etc.\n* **Particle Limit:** Limits particles to a set amount. Should not be set too low, as it will cause particles to appear for a single tick before vanishing\n* **Pickup Notification:** Displays highly configurable notifications when the player obtains or loses items\n* **Piston Block Blacklist:** Integrates a blacklist of blocks which are not allowed to be pushed by pistons\n* **Player Speed:** Enables the modification of base and maximum player speeds along with fixing 'Player moved too quickly' messages\n* **Player XP Drop Percentage:** Sets the percentage of experience players can drop upon death instead of the capped ~7 levels\n* **Prevent Mob Eggs from Changing Spawners:** Prevents using Mob Spawner Eggs to change what a Spawner is spawning\n* **Prevent Observer Activating on Placement:** Controls if the observer activates itself on the first tick when it is placed\n* **Prevent Placing Buckets in Portals:** Prevents placing of liquid source blocks overriding portal blocks\n* **Projectiles Bounce Off Slime Blocks:** Lets projectiles like arrows bounce off slime blocks\n* **Pumpkin Placing:** Allows placing Pumpkins and Jack'O'Lanterns without a supporting block\n* **Rabbit Killer Spawning:** Configurable chance for rabbits to spawn as the killer bunny variant\n* **Rabbit Toast Spawning:** Configurable chance for rabbits to spawn as the Toast variant\n* **Rally Health:** Adds Bloodborne's Rally system to Minecraft, regain lost health when attacking back within the risk time\n* **Regen Exhaustion:** Sets the maximum exhaustion value when healing\n* **Remove 3D Anaglyph Button:** Removes the 3D Anaglyph button from the video settings menu\n* **Remove Realms Button:** Removes the redundant Minecraft Realms button from the main menu and silences notifications\n* **Remove Recipe Book:** Removes the recipe book button from GUIs\n* **Remove Snooper:** Forcefully turns off the snooper and hides the snooper settings button from the options menu\n* **Render End Portal Bottom:** Controls if the End Portal renders its texture on the bottom face\n* **Repairable Anvils:** Allows repairing damaged anvils by right-clicking with items like iron ingots\n* **Riding Exhaustion:** Enables depleting saturation when riding mounts\n* **Sapling Behavior:** Allows customization of sapling behavior while utilizing an optimized method\n* **Sea Level:** Sets the default height of the overworld's sea level\n* **Selected Item Tooltip Height:** Sets the Y value of the selected item tooltip, displayed when held items are changed\n* **Shield Parry:** Allows parrying of projectiles with shields\n* **Skip Credits:** Skips the credits screen after the player goes through the end podium portal\n* **Skip Missing Registry Entries Screen:** Automatically confirms the 'Missing Registry Entries' screen on world load\n* **Sleeping Time:** Determines at which time of day sleeping is allowed in ticks (0 - 24000)\n* **Smart Eat:** Requires the hunger bar to be missing food points equal to or more than the amount restored by the food\n* **Smooth Scrolling:** Adds smooth scrolling to every in-game list\n* **Soulbound Vexes:** Summoned vexes will also die when their summoner is killed\n* **Sound Channels:** Configures the amount of normal and streaming channels to be used by the sound engine\n* **Soup Bowl Returns:** Respects stack sizes of soups when returning bowls\n* **Spawn Caps:** Sets maximum spawning limits for different entity types\n* **Spawn Chunks Generation:** Determines if overworld spawn chunks are generated during world creation\n* **Spawn Chunks Loading:** Determines if overworld spawn chunks are always kept loaded\n* **Super Hot Torch:** Enables one-time ignition of entities by hitting them with a torch\n* **Stronghold Enforcement:** Enforces stronghold generation to generate all blocks, regardless of air\n* **Swing Through Grass:** Allows hitting entities through grass instead of breaking it\n* **Texture Atlas Size:** Increases the size of the texture atlas as large as the GPU actually supports, has no effect when [Valkyrie](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrie) is installed\n* **Third Person Ignores Non-solid Blocks:** When viewing in third person, don't stop the camera on non-solid blocks\n* **Tidy Chunk:** Tidies newly generated chunks by removing scattered item entities\n* **Toast Control:** Enables the control of toasts (pop-up text boxes)\n* **Toggle Cheats Button:** Adds a button to the pause menu to toggle cheats\n* **Trample Control:** Controls how and when farmland is trampled\n* **Uncap FPS:** Removes the hardcoded 30 FPS limit in screens like the main menu\n* **Undead Horses**\n    * **Burning:** Lets untamed undead horses burn in daylight\n    * **Despawning:** Lets untamed undead horses despawn\n    * **Taming:** Allows taming of undead horses\n* **Unsafe Sleeping**\n    * **Highlight Unsafe Mobs:** Apply the Glowing potion effect for a configurable length of time to nearby mobs preventing sleeping\n    * **Ignore Unsafe Sleeping:** Allow sleeping even if mobs are nearby\n    * **Ignore Named Mobs:** When checking nearby hostile mobs, skip named mobs1\n* **Unlimited Block Model Rotations:** Removes the artificial -45/-22.5/0/22.5/45 degree restriction for block models\n* **Unlimited Sound Pitch Range:** Removes the hardcoded range for sound pitches (0.5-2.0)\n* **Use Separate Dismount Key:** Makes the dismount keybind separate from LSHIFT, allowing it to be rebound independently\n* **Use Separate Narrator Key:** Allows using a custom Narrator key, instead of being stuck with CTRL+B\n* **Village Distance:** Sets the village generation distance in chunks\n* **Villager Harvesting:** Fixes Villagers being unable to replant modded crops and allows villagers to breed using modded foods.\n* **Villager Profession Biome Restriction:** Controls villager professions in specified biomes\n* **Void Fog:** Re-implements pre-1.8 void fog and void particles\n* **Water Fall Damage:** Re-implements an improved version of pre-1.4 fall damage in water\n* **Weaken Golem Structure Requirements:** Allows creating Golem with non-air blocks in the bottom corners of the structure\n* **Weaken Wither Structure Requirements:** Allows creating Withers with non-air blocks in the bottom corners of the structure\n* **XP Bottle Amount:** Sets the amount of experience spawned by bottles o' enchanting\n* **XP Level Cap:** Sets the maximum experience level players can reach\n* **View Bobbing Mode:** Sets the view bobbing mode (Default: Bobs both hand and camera (vanilla default); Hand only: Bobs only hand; Camera only: Bobs only camera)\n* **Void Teleport:**\n    * Options allow toggling the setting globally, controlling to what Y-level the entity is teleported, if blindness is applied, maximum number of consecutive times, and how much and in what way fall damage is taken\n    * **Configure Entities:** Configures what entities can be teleported, and if the player is teleported\n    * **Configure Dimensions:** Configures what dimensions the effect can take place in\n* **Watching AI Removal:** Removes watching/looking entity AI for improved server performance\n* **Watching AI Replacement:** Replaces watching/looking entity AI for improved server performance\n* **Window Icon:** Sets the relative path to the 16x16, 32x32 and 256x256 Minecraft window icons\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/1EmHZlb.png)\n\n### **⚙️ MOD INTEGRATION**\n\n* **AbyssalCraft**\n    * **Disable Plague Potion Clouds:** Disables AbyssalCraft's Plague-type mobs spawning lingering potion effects on death\n* **Actually Additions**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n    * **Laser Upgrade Voiding:** Fixes Laser Upgrades voiding instead of applying if there is only one item in the stack\n    * **Item Laser Particles Graphics:** Sets what level of Graphic Setting is required to disable the Item Particles generated by Item Lasers transferring items\n* **Aether Legacy**\n    * **Capture Accessory Drops:** When dropping equipped Accessories, add the drops to the event instead of dropping them directly, allowing compatibility with various grave mods\n* **Agricraft**\n    * **Ender IO Integration Fix:** Fixes crash when Ender IO's Farming Station attempts to harvest Agricraft crops\n* **Applied Energistics 2 Unofficial Extended Life**\n    * **Mitigate Storage Bus Crashes:** Mitigates crashes caused by misbehaving IItemHandlers\n* **Astral Sorcery**\n    * **Missing Player Log Level:** Downgrades the message when completing a recipe without an initializing player from a warning to a debug\n    * **Sooty Marble Rendering:** Fixes Sooty Marble Pillar blocking the proper rendering of adjacent fluids due to inverted logic\n    * **Clear Particle Effects:** Fixes a bug where particle effects would continue to render after changing dimensions\n    * **Fix Division By Zero Crystal Tool:** Fixes a bug where merging Crystal Tool Properties could result in a division by zero\n    * **Fix Fluid Vein Overflow:** Fixes a bug where the fluid veins could overflow, resulting in empty veins (just water)\n    * **Allow Unlimited Fluid Veins:** Make it so max size fluid veins never run out\n    * **Allow to change the Neromantic Prime Extraction Quantity:** Allows configuring the amount extracted from the fluid vein per Neromantic Prime operation\n    * **Allow to specify dimensions for fluid veins:** Extends the fluid vein configuration to allow specifying in which dimensions a fluid can generate\n* **Advent of Ascension**\n    * **Improved Player Tick:** Improves AoA player ticking by only sending inventory changes when necessary\n* **Arcane Archives**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n* **Avaritiaddons**\n    * **Fix Container Held Stack Bug:** Fix the Infinity Chest not properly handling the held itemstack when closing the container\n* **Backpacks**\n    * **No Offhand Interaction:** Prevents unintended offhand right-click behavior when opening backpacks\n* **Bewitchment**\n    * **Fix Altar IBlockState Check:** Fix the Witches Altar checking blocks causing crashes when scanning blocks that do not have the expected properties, primarily TerraFirmaCraft leaves\n    * **Witches' Oven Fix:** Fixes Witches' Oven consuming container fuel items\n* **Bibliocraft**\n    * **Allow Any Black Dye for Printing Press:** Allow the Printing Press to properly work with any itemstack with the dyeBlack oredict, instead of only processing with Ink Sacs\n    * **Disable Version Check:** Fixes client-side memory leak by disabling version check\n    * **Fix Armor Stand Binding:** Fix BiblioCraft's custom Armor Stand not respecting the Curse of Binding\n    * **Fix Armor Stand Slots:** Fix BiblioCraft's custom Armor Stand using the incorrect slots for items or not recognizing the items as valid\n    * **Fix Fancy Sign Rotation:** Fix Fancy Signs rendering items and blocks in different ways between the GUI and in-world\n    * **Fix IItemHandler Method Not Existing:** Fix IItemHandler#getStackInSlot method not existing due to being obfuscated by IInventory, preventing countless errors\n    * **Fix Item Transfer:** Make BiblioCraft actually use simulate properly when inserting and extracting items, fixing many item transfer methods\n    * **Fix ItemStack Copying:** Fixes removing an ItemStack not copying all data correctly, particularly for backpacks\n    * **Fix Left Handed Rendering:** Fixes the Antique Atlas and Clipboard rendering incorrect when the Main Hand is set to Left\n    * **Fix Using Incorrect Hand:** Fix the Clipboard and the Stockroom Catalogue behaving incorrectly when used in the offhand\n    * **Multiplayer Sound Fix:** Register all sounds, fixing bugs when attempting to play them on servers\n* **Binnie's Mods**\n    * **Gather Windfall:** Allows Forestry farms to pick up ExtraTrees fruit\n* **Biomes O' Plenty**\n    * **Hot Spring Water:** Fixes rapid inflection of regeneration effects in hot spring water\n* **Blood Magic**\n    * **Bound Tool Harvest Tweak:** Improves performance when harvesting blocks with Bound Tool's right-click and exposes block drops to HarvestDropsEvent\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n    * **Fluid Routing Fix:** Fixes Routing Node fluid routing unable to support multiple liquids and soft-locking when encountering a full fluid tank\n    * **Memory Leak Fix:** Fixes memory leak when unloading worlds/switching dimensions\n    * **Optimized Hellfire Forge:** Optimizes the Hellfire/Soul Forge to reduce tick time\n    * **Ritual Fix:** Fixes ritual resetting on chunk/world unload\n* **Botania**\n    * **Fancy Skybox:** Enables the Botania Garden of Glass skybox for custom dimensions\n* **Better with Mods**\n    * **Beacon NBT Loading Fix:** Fixes BWM beacons reading null tags from vanilla beacons\n* **CB Multipart**\n    * **Memory Leak Fix:** Fixes a memory leak associated with EntityPlayer\n* **Chisel**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n* **Chocolate Quest Repoured**\n    * **Legacy Golden Feather:** Restores the golden feather behavior from the original Better Dungeons mod\n* **CodeChicken Lib**\n    * **Packet Leak Fix:** Fixes network ByteBuf leaks from PacketCustom\n* **CoFH Core**\n    * **Multishot Enchantment For Any Bow:** Applies the Multishot enchantment to most bows instead of vanilla and CoFH only\n    * **Vorpal Enchantment Damage:** Sets the damage multiplier of the Vorpal enchantment\n* **CoFH World**\n    * **Prevent Superflat Generation:** Prevents CoFH World features from generating in superflat world types\n* **Collective**\n    * **Memory Leak Fix:** Fixes memory leak when unloading worlds/switching dimensions\n* **Compact Machines**\n    * **Allowed Spawns Improvement:** Improves server performance by properly controlling spawn checks (effectiveness depends on CM's config)\n    * **Invisible Wall Render Fix:** Fixes some compact machine walls being invisible if [Nothirium](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nothirium) 0.2.x (and up) or [Vintagium](https://github.com/Asek3/sodium-1.12) is installed\n    * **Memory Leak Fix:** Fixes client-side memory leak associated with miniaturization recipes\n* **Cooking For Blockheads**\n    * **Oven Fix:** Fixes CFB Oven consuming container fuel items\n* **Corpse**\n    * **Opening GUIs Off-thread Fix:** Fixes opening up GUIs on a non-client thread\n* **Cyclic**\n    * **Memory Leak Fix:** Fixes memory leak associated with advancements when creating FakePlayers\n* **Divine RPG**\n    * **Change Water Mob Creature Type:** Changes the creature type for DivineRPG Water Mobs to be WATER_CREATURE, fixing issues with hostile mob spawn caps and infinite water mob spawning\n    * **Fix Aquamarine Stack Size:** Aquamarine has durability, yet doesn't have a max stack size of 1\n    * **Fix Armor Set Effect Cleanup:** Fixes issues with armor set effects being cleaned up under the wrong conditions that caused crashes\n    * **Fix Consuming Incorrect Hand:** Fix various DivineRPG items consuming the item in the main hand regardless of the hand actually used\n    * **Fix Nightmare Bed Drop:** Fix the Nightmare Bed not dropping when being broken\n* **Dank Storage**\n    * **Max Int stack voiding:** Fixes Max Int (2.1B) stacks being voided when right clicking on them in a Dank\n* **Effortless Building**\n    * **Block Transmutation Fix:** Fixes Effortless Building ignoring Metadata when checking for items in inventory\n* **Electroblob's Wizardry**\n    * **Construct's Armory Armor Fix:** Fixes crash when wearing armors from Construct's Armory\n* **Elementary Staffs**\n    * **Electric Staff Port:** Reintroduces the 1.5 electric staff behavior along with some subtle particles\n    * **Health Staff Player Healing:** Lets the health staff also heal other players (and potentially more living entities)\n* **Elenai Dodge 2**\n    * **Extinguishing Dodges:** Chance per dodge to extinguish the player when burning\n    * **Feathers Helper API Fix:** Fixes server-sided crashes when the Feathers Helper API is utilized\n    * **Sprinting Integration:** Configurable consumption of feathers when the player is sprinting\n* **Ender IO**\n    * **Clear Outdated Redstone Conduit:** When changing colors in the Redstone Conduit GUI, remove the signal from the old color\n    * **Fix Chorus Farming StackOverflow:** Fixes the Farming Station Chorus Walker being able to loop though and check the same positions endlessly, causing a StackOverflow\n    * **Fix Impulse Hopper NBT Inputs:** Makes inserting into the Impulse Hopper filter by NBT of the relevant ghost item, which is required for actually moving the item\n    * **Fix Soul Binder JEI Appearance:** Fixes the Soul Binder having empty ingredients or displaying filled soul vials in the output slot incorrectly\n    * **Replace Obelisk Renderer:** Fixes client-side memory leak by replacing obelisk renderer with a simpler one\n    * **Save Filter Cycle Buttons Properly:** Fixes an issue where Cycle Buttons for Damage do not report being clicked when in the Picker Overlay, preventing changing Damage values until clicked again\n* **Ender Storage**\n    * **Fix Frequency Tracking:** Fixes storage frequencies being tracked multiple times\n* **Epic Siege Mod**\n    * **Disable Digger AI Debug:** Disables leftover debug logging inside the digger AI of the beta builds\n* **Extra Utilities 2**\n    * **Catch Radar Exception:** Fixes the Radar feature (find in nearby inventories) entirely breaking when near some inventories\n    * **Make Radar skip ungenerated chests:** Makes the Radar skip inventories when the loottable for it has not yet been generated\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n    * **Fix Deep Dark Stats:** Fixes Mob Attack and Health Statistics being repeatedly doubled\n    * **Mutable Machine Block Drops:** Fixes Machine Block drops being immutable, causing a crash on attempting to remove entries from the list.\n    * **Creative Mill Harvestability:** Fixes the Creative Mill Generator not respecting the Creative Block Breaking config\n    * **Downgrade Potion Recipes Log Level:** Downgrades the message when creating a potion recipe from info to a debug\n    * **Unstable Ingots Inventory Scanning:** Prevents CME crashes when iterating over inventory slots in special containers\n* **Extreme Reactors**\n    * **Mitigate Steam Reactor Crash:** Mitigates NPE in updateServer by no-oping fluid transfers when the direction is null\n* **Forestry**\n    * **Arborist Villager Trades:** Adds custom emerald to germling trades to the arborist villager\n* **FPS Reducer**\n    * **Correct FPS Display:** Fixes incorrect FPS number being displayed on the HUD\n* **Gaia Dimension**\n    * **Fix Restructurer Crash:** Safely access a nullable value when checking recipes in the Restructurer\n* **HammerLib**\n    * **Optimized ItemColorHelper Rendering**  Optimizes HammerLib's item color rendering performance, increasing FPS when rendering ItemStacks\n* **HWYLA**\n    * **Keybindings Fix:** Fixes crashes in all menus when changing HWYLA keybindings to unsupported values\n* **Immersive Engineering**\n    * **Tool Break Fire Event:** Fires the PlayerDestroyItemEvent when an Immersive Engineering tool breaks, fixing a number of cross-compatibility issues\n    * **Tool Break Hand Replacement:** Fixes the tool breaking setting the main hand to empty regardless of what hand the tool is in\n* **In Control!**\n    * **Fix ForgeEventHandler Crash:** Prevents the client thread from modifying a server-only static field\n    * **Spawn Rule Stats Fix:** Fixes onJoin spawn rules repeatedly modifying mob attack/health/speed\n* **IndustrialCraft 2**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n* **Industrial Foregoing**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n    * **Fix Black Hole Tank Bucket Voiding:** Fix the Black Hole Tank voiding buckets if the player inventory is full by dropping the buckets on the ground\n    * **Machines Max Range Off-By-One Fix:** Fixes an off-by-one error where IF Machines would display the max tier of range addon as one less than the actual maximum\n* **Infernal Mobs**\n    * **Better Entity Names:** Gets the actual display names of entities for improved naming\n    * **Sticky Recall Compatibility:** Enables compatibility between Infernal Mobs' Sticky effect and Capsule's Recall enchantment\n    * **Sticky Pedestal Compatibility:** Enables compatibility between Infernal Mobs' Sticky effect and Reliquary's Pedestal\n* **Iron Backpacks**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n* **Iron Chests**\n    * **Replace Crystal Chest/Shulker Renderer:** Fixes client-side memory leak by replacing the crystal chest/shulker box renderer with a simpler one (Note: Disables stack size rendering)\n* **Item Favorites**\n    * **Linux Saving/Loading**: Fixes saving and loading of favorite items on Unix systems\n* **Item Stages**\n    * **Ingredient Matching:** Changes item matching code to CraftTweaker's ingredient matching system, fixes item NBT issues\n* **Jurassic Reborn**\n    * **Geneticist Villager House Generation:** Toggles the generation of geneticist houses in villages\n* **Mekanism**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n    * **Fluid Tank Extraction:** Fixes a logic error allowing extracting fluids from fluid tanks regardless of requested fluid\n* **MmmMmmMmmMmm**\n    * **Copy Armor Stacks to Dummy:** Instead of deleting the original itemstack being equipped, use a copy of it and do not drop armor\n* **Moar Tinkers**\n    * **Baubles Compatibility:** Enables Energy Eater/Repair to pull from baubles\n* **Mob Stages**\n    * **Spawning Rules Fixes:** Fixes mob replacement ignoring entity spawning rules\n* **Modular Magic**\n    * **Fix Null Ingredient:** Fix a Null Pointer Exception in a few places caused by not checking if the ingredient is null before attempting to rendering it\n* **Modular Routers**\n    * **Particle Thread Fix:** Fixes particles being added from the wrong thread which corrupted the particle manager\n* **MrTJPCore**\n    * **Memory Leak Fix:** Fixes a memory leak associated with EntityPlayer\n* **Nether Chest**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n* **Netherrocks**\n    * **Right Click Harvesting Fix:** Prevents crashing with mods implementing right click crop harvesting\n* **OpenBlocks**\n    * **Last Stand Trigger Fix:** Fixes the Last Stand enchantment triggering too early on pre-mitigation damage (before enchants, potions, etc), instead of on post-mitigation damage.\n* **Open Glasses 2**\n    * **Exception getting Glasses Stack:** Fix a NPE when getting the glasses stack when Baubles or Techguns is installed\n* **ProjectRed**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n* **Proper Pumpkins**\n    * **Facing Crash Fix:** Fixes a bug where converting a pumpkin from a non-horizontal face would crash\n* **Quark**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n    * **Fix Untranslated Link Items:** When using the Link Items feature, if playing on a server, items that are not localized serverside will display the lang code in chat. This only impacts servers.\n* **Random Things**\n    * **Anvil Crafting Fix:** Fixes a bug where crafting the output of an Anvil recipe would modify the recipe, preventing crafts until restart\n    * **Fix Spectre Dimension Teleport Stall:** Fix a bug where teleporting to the Spectre dimension on servers can leave the player stalled out in the void\n    * **Item Collector Dupe:** Fixes a duplication exploit connected to the Advanced Item Collector\n* **Railcraft**\n    * **No Beta Warning:** Disables the beta message warning on world join\n* **Requious Frakto**\n    * **Particle Fixes:** Fixes server world being leaked to various particles\n* **RFTools**\n    * **Fully Unregister Dimensions:** Fixes a bug where joining a world or server with any RFTools Dimension registered would disallow entering another world without that dimension until restarting\n    * **Fix XNet Channel Crash:** Fixes sporadic crashes when using RFTools Storage XNet channels\n* **Roost**\n    * **Early Register CT Chickens:** Improves load time by registering ContentTweaker chickens early for Roost to detect them\n* **Roots**\n    * **Creative Pouch GUI Crash:** Disable opening the Creative Pouch GUI as it immediately crashes\n    * **Modifier GUI Voiding:** Fix an issue where disabled modifiers would still consume their material, voiding the \n    * **Icicle Type Saving:** Save the Icicle entity type as NBT, fixing a crash where the type was null\n    * **Mortar Spell Dust Fix:** Make the Mortar Spell Dust crafting output a copy of the ItemStack, avoiding issues where the recipe is inadvertently modified\n    * **Check Spirit Drop Oredict:** Check if the oredict is registered before adding an entry to the list, preventing a bug when copper or silver ingots or nuggets are disabled\n    * **Summon Creatures Ritual Infinite loop:** Make the Summon Creatures Ritual stop when checking if blocks out of world are air, preventing an infinite loop when running the ritual above the void\n    * **Prevent Shatter Spell Breaking Unbreakable:** Check if the target block is unbreakable for the Shatter Spell\n    * **Disable Element Soil Growth Acceleration:** Disable Elemental Soils triggering updates on redstone updates\n* **SimpleDifficulty**\n    * **Iron Canteen Interaction Fix:** Fixes the interaction of iron canteens with rain collectors\n    * **Altitude Modifier:** Sets additional variables for altitude modifier calculations\n    * **Always Drink:** Allows the consumption of drinks at any time, regardless of the thirst bar\n    * **Drinking Consumes Water Source:** Causes canteens and manual drinking to consume the source block or a cauldron level of water\n    * **Full Canteen Fix:** Prevents canteens from adding water when already full\n* **Simply Jetpacks**\n    * **Memory Leak Fix:** Fixes a client-side memory leak associated with EntityPlayer\n* **Spice Of Life**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n* **SteamWorld**\n    * **Sky of Old Dimension Fix:** Fixes a Stack Overflow crash when entering the Sky of Old Dimension\n* **Storage Drawers**\n    * **Item Voiding Fix:** Prevents voiding of items when near capacity limits\n    * **Render Range:** Approximate range in blocks at which drawers render contained items\n* **Tardis**\n    * **Memory Leak Fix:** Fixes a client-side memory leak associated with EntityPlayer\n* **Tech Reborn**\n    * **Optimized Rolling Machine:** Optimizes the Rolling Machine to reduce tick time\n* **The Erebus**\n    * **Disable Death Compass:** Disables granting a death compass upon demise without disabling Block o' Bones\n    * **Fix Cabbage Drop:** Fixes Cabbage not dropping the correct items in some situations\n    * **Fix Quake Hammer Texture:** Fixes the Quake Hammer using the incorrect config option to control its size\n    * **Preserved Blocks Fix:** Prevents HWYLA/TOP crashes with preserved blocks\n* **EvilCraft**\n    * **Vengeance Spirit Regex Cache:** Cache the result of Vengeance Spirit checks against the config, which may attempt to build and check against hundreds of Regex Patterns every tick\n    * **Vengeance Spirit Random Performance:** Avoid repeatedly running intensive calculations involving spawning a random Vengeance Spirit\n* **The Farlanders**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n* **Thermal Expansion**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n    * **Insolator Custom Monoculture:** Adds Monoculture Cycle integration to desired phytogenic insolator recipes added by ModTweaker\n* **Tinkers' Construct**\n    * **Disable Rendering Items in Smeltery:** Disables rendering items in the world when they are inside the Smeltery to prevent lag while rendering\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n    * **Gaseous Fluids:** Excludes gaseous fluids from being transferable via faucets\n    * **Material Blacklist:** Hides tool/bow materials in the 'Materials and You' book\n    * **Offhand Shuriken:** Suppresses special abilities of long swords and rapiers when shurikens are wielded in the offhand\n    * **Ore Dictionary Cache:** Caches all ore dictionary smelting recipes to speed up game loading\n    * **Particle Fixes:** Fixes server world being leaked to various particles\n    * **Projectile Despawning:** Despawns unbreakable projectiles faster to improve framerates\n    * **Tool Customization:** Sets the attack damage cutoff at which diminishing returns start for any Tinkers' tool and sets the rate at which a tool's attack damage incrementally decays depending on its damage cutoff\n* **Tiny Progressions**\n    * **Duplication Fixes:** Fixes various duplication exploits\n* **TombManyGraves2**\n    * **Add Compat Aether Legacy Accessories:** If **Aether Legacy: Capture Accessory Drops** is enabled, allow TombManyGraves2 to have compat with Aether Legacy Accessories\n    * **Change Timestamp:** Change the timestamp used from 'MM_dd_YYYY_HH_mm_ss' to an ISO 8601 based format of 'YYYY-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss'\n    * **Proper World Size Check:** Fix TombManyGraves not spawning the grave due to incorrectly checking world height\n* **Void Island Control**\n    * **Fix Spawn Island Creation:** Fixes islands not being able to be created if the dimension is not the overworld when visiting the dimension for the first time due to the spawn island not being created\n* **Woot**\n    * **Cleanup Simulated Kills:** Remove any leftover entities spawned on simulated mob's death\n* **XNet**\n    * **Fix Various Controller Crashes:** Patches several ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsExceptions in the controller logic\n","2023-07-11T10:10:42.673462Z","2026-05-26T16:24:09.232474Z","2023-07-13T03:58:09.676520Z","2023-07-11T11:24:14.068851Z",{"id":30070,"name":30071,"url":3571},"LGPL-3.0-only","GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 only",108104,29,[134,211,303],[],[354],[30078,30079,30080,30081,30082,30083,30084,30085,30086,30087,30088,30089,30090,30091,30092,30093,30094,30095,30096],"aPZh6B3A","UUiyQKvL","Skw50Rxx","V3EyorKx","o3EXxrkS","pOkzZlAu","rWy1nzna","Pb7ELn6C","FtuwJn6k","LdM7lj9f","vpxSyOkf","sTtLLwHS","lh6JT2C2","QJk1lCWh","s9LIMCwo","w7Txzez8","9eRsbj9s","YYeCz4t4","iVbBavWd","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s32LssQX/0230d25c1b997f79ea6a067fe8949a084c83a31d_96.webp","https://github.com/ACGaming/UniversalTweaks/issues","https://github.com/ACGaming/UniversalTweaks","https://discord.gg/JdthM8qbJ3",[30102],{"id":3128,"platform":3129,"url":30103},"https://ko-fi.com/acgaming",[30105,30110,30114,30119],{"url":30106,"raw_url":30107,"featured":439,"title":30108,"description":3571,"created":30109,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s32LssQX/images/23ca66bda8776598ad22a0f08a96d445540e846d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s32LssQX/images/23ca66bda8776598ad22a0f08a96d445540e846d.png","Extra Trees windfall tweak","2023-07-11T11:13:57.507252Z",{"url":30111,"raw_url":30111,"featured":439,"title":30112,"description":3571,"created":30113,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s32LssQX/images/3345c31f89aa5478b221a15f617747ed71f60fe1.png","Spawn caps tweak","2023-07-11T11:14:27.740627Z",{"url":30115,"raw_url":30116,"featured":439,"title":30117,"description":3571,"created":30118,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s32LssQX/images/be04e949809af5a53abdd390d3243d4e6e50361f_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s32LssQX/images/be04e949809af5a53abdd390d3243d4e6e50361f.png","Lenient paths tweak","2023-07-11T11:14:12.415909Z",{"url":30120,"raw_url":30121,"featured":439,"title":30122,"description":3571,"created":30123,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s32LssQX/images/c833a47120e20cf48dc2aae5edf151e81e020768_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s32LssQX/images/b12f8eab4fc0cb2ad815de1dde7249fc50006b93.png","Fixed particles","2023-07-11T11:13:40.897164Z",3447514,{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30126,"id":30127,"slug":30128,"project_type":31,"team":30129,"organization":3571,"title":30130,"description":30131,"body":30132,"body_url":3571,"published":30133,"updated":30134,"approved":30135,"queued":30136,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30137,"downloads":30140,"followers":29995,"categories":30141,"additional_categories":30142,"loaders":30143,"versions":30144,"icon_url":30146,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":30147,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30148,"gallery":30149,"color":30158,"thread_id":30159,"monetization_status":30006},[649,640,634],"s3QlQLxd","sculk-vault","gLoYTWFP","Sculk Vault","Adds some sculky features to make the ancient cities more enticing","This small mod introduces a few new things crafted from materials found in the Ancient Cities that allow you to play with experience in new ways. \n\n# Sculk Vault\nThe Sculk Vault is a block that attracts and stores experience. When there is experience available, you can click on this block with a bottle to turn it into a bottle o' enchanting and retrieve some of the stores experience.  \n\n## Recipe\nThe sculk vault can be crafted using the following recipe. \n![The sculk vault is crafted from 5 echo shards, a sculk catalyst, and 3 lapis blocks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f8c7e9ab4a8f2338e553e9c2eff92b5c7ee0f1c3.png)\n\n\n# Sculk Vial\nThe sculk vial is an item that collects experience. When it is in your inventory, it will spend its experience to repair any items you're using if they're enchanted with mending. You can right click in the air to empty the experience stored in it out into the world, or right click on a sculk vault to fill the vial.   \n\n## Recipes\nSculk vials can be crafted using the following recipe. \n![The sculk vial is crafted from 8 echo shards surrounding a glass bottle](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4c0eec200555a4f4540fd4845d50868d2cae6871.png)\n\nSculk vials can have their capacity increased up to twice using the following recipe. \n![The sculk vial can be upgraded by surrounding it with 8 echo shards](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a7f69e784ffc688255b5ce832b62da576affaf4f.png)\n\n","2025-09-14T02:06:12.197978Z","2025-09-14T02:06:41.664839Z","2025-09-16T02:46:22.360691Z","2025-09-14T13:45:09.396695Z",{"id":30138,"name":30139,"url":3571},"GPL-3.0-only","GNU General Public License v3.0 only",105,[30,303],[134,157,288],[346,409],[30145],"bX9JQKqj","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3QlQLxd/fc77058d6cf11a7c048a0ddd9416e39d421a82c9_96.webp","https://gitlab.sdpetra.com/miah/sculk-vault",[],[30150,30153],{"url":30151,"raw_url":30151,"featured":828,"title":30130,"description":3571,"created":30152,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3QlQLxd/images/eaeaaea34d2e423a99651ae9ab7238aa94db8fa3.png","2025-09-14T11:49:44.380375Z",{"url":30154,"raw_url":30155,"featured":439,"title":30156,"description":3571,"created":30157,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3QlQLxd/images/f18a9fce2088477e47052c4ac9888c390ff5f454_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3QlQLxd/images/f18a9fce2088477e47052c4ac9888c390ff5f454.png","Sculk Vial","2025-09-14T11:51:06.023054Z",1450542,"UcjevYyP",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30161,"id":30162,"slug":30163,"project_type":12,"team":30164,"organization":3571,"title":30165,"description":30166,"body":30167,"body_url":3571,"published":30168,"updated":30169,"approved":30170,"queued":30171,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30172,"downloads":30173,"followers":29995,"categories":30174,"additional_categories":30175,"loaders":30176,"versions":30177,"icon_url":30179,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30180,"gallery":30181,"color":30186,"thread_id":30187,"monetization_status":30006},[826,820,772,769,739,691,649,640,634,589,583,538,484,478],"s2pdX3gL","heart-recolor-purple","VnNERbaS","Heart Recolor - Purple","Changes the vanilla health hearts to be a purple instead of red!","A super simple pack that replaces the normal red health heart icons in the survival HUD with some newly recolored purple ones! Unfortunately due to various changes to resource pack formats the current version will only work on 1.21.x and beyond.","2026-04-08T20:36:32.007560Z","2026-04-08T20:37:27.688200Z","2026-04-09T00:39:14.749419Z","2026-04-08T20:38:52.066449Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},132,[15,139,300],[307],[377],[30178],"14lDCxva","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2pdX3gL/e67cb028f435bd2c50a5b820ba4dcce7456f6331_96.webp",[],[30182],{"url":30183,"raw_url":30184,"featured":828,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":30185,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2pdX3gL/images/448717be9a07ba9f5a7ab53a7c920e4bc825e346_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2pdX3gL/images/448717be9a07ba9f5a7ab53a7c920e4bc825e346.png","2026-04-08T20:38:11.232903Z",13879456,"E7d9MPXa",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30189,"id":30190,"slug":30191,"project_type":31,"team":30192,"organization":3571,"title":30193,"description":30194,"body":30195,"body_url":3571,"published":30196,"updated":30197,"approved":30198,"queued":30199,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30200,"downloads":30203,"followers":30204,"categories":30205,"additional_categories":30206,"loaders":30207,"versions":30208,"icon_url":30211,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":30212,"donation_urls":30213,"gallery":30214,"color":30257,"thread_id":30258,"monetization_status":30006},[634],"s3egT8EF","vt-nonsense","bfAyKNzy","Nonsense","A new dimension with unique and creative biomes ...","![nonsense_logo_release](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5e44a8a8d9e7589707c4d7db9175130feedc0b09.png)\n\nNonsense adds a new sky-based dimension made of floating islands.\nThe special feature of the mod is its creative and unique biomes. It starts with one biome, and every major update adds a new one.\n\n### Briza Fields\n\nThe first biome is an earthy wasteland filled with rusty mechanical debris and ancient plants and structures.\nWhile it appears empty at first, careful exploration reveals many details and discoveries.\n\n![nonsense_logo_release](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cea45b2256d135fcfdcc6baed243d17346adc899.png)\n\n```\n### tiny_wiki\n\n-1 locate a 'mechanical_temple' // underground structure\n\n-2 defeat the 'globuc' // mini boss mob\n\n-3 take the 'portal_crystal_blocks' and build a portal // netherportal like\n\n-4 craft a 'socket_and_steel' and light the portal\n\n-5 explore!\n\n## infos\n\n-1 'kuro_blocks' oxidize slowly in rain\n\n-2 'kuro_blocks' can be waxed with slime_ball, undo with axe // rusty, perishing, scrapped too / or by using a 'slimy_brush'\n\n-3 'dry_betherrack' drops rarely rare items // for example the 'mechanical_mask'\n\n-4 'aolite' will get a use in the next major update\n\n-5 use a name_tag 'cute' or 'repo' on 'robes' or 'trader_robes' for new skins\n\n-6 use a name_tag 'happy' on 'spider_mech' for a new skin\n\n-7 'scrap_armor' is a faster way to get \"full netherite\" // same armor level\n```\n\n![wip](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b2ccfc5cfef354e21e5ef50465b0f9c1964b8d4.png)","2026-01-16T21:11:33.418697Z","2026-02-12T09:37:02.147226Z","2026-02-05T08:01:07.810133Z","2026-02-04T17:42:39.641240Z",{"id":30201,"name":30202,"url":3571},"CC-BY-NC-4.0","Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial 4.0 International",53,7,[30,134,191],[93,100,115,171,288],[385],[30209,30210],"NWf3si57","BqqlkL0R","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/8049236932d84f76ed0546d5719cdadbd19fc9f8_96.webp","https://discord.gg/QVgqSvaR2x",[],[30215,30222,30228,30234,30239,30244,30251],{"url":30216,"raw_url":30217,"featured":439,"title":30218,"description":30219,"created":30220,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/2b0258ffee08f733ca189a4d3d5adb1cffc02056_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/2b0258ffee08f733ca189a4d3d5adb1cffc02056.png","Briza Village","New villages with new inhabitants","2026-02-03T18:44:33.801314Z",1,{"url":30223,"raw_url":30224,"featured":439,"title":30225,"description":30226,"created":30227,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/b4853152180348e4921b01231f98c816829d743e_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/b4853152180348e4921b01231f98c816829d743e.png","Briza Fields","New Biome","2026-02-03T18:50:35.104005Z",{"url":30229,"raw_url":30230,"featured":439,"title":30231,"description":30232,"created":30233,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/0260e6db96ace4d440e5658f8323a2a543dc0550_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/0260e6db96ace4d440e5658f8323a2a543dc0550.png","Mechanical Structure","Ancient and unique structures","2026-02-03T18:45:44.276652Z",{"url":30235,"raw_url":30236,"featured":439,"title":30237,"description":30225,"created":30238,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/9d389db92859b13d313d05667153b5cf9baff1c9_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/9d389db92859b13d313d05667153b5cf9baff1c9.png","New Islands","2026-02-03T18:50:00.383575Z",{"url":30240,"raw_url":30241,"featured":439,"title":30242,"description":3571,"created":30243,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/9db1371be4afa8077648827d9af0bdf8cd382503_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/9db1371be4afa8077648827d9af0bdf8cd382503.png","Emerging civilizations","2026-02-03T18:51:48.872387Z",{"url":30245,"raw_url":30246,"featured":439,"title":30247,"description":30248,"created":30249,"ordering":30250},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/2319e13c192484fb71986e9595fd038a0764ffe2_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/2319e13c192484fb71986e9595fd038a0764ffe2.png","New Technical Components","New technical devices","2026-02-03T18:47:54.718426Z",5,{"url":30252,"raw_url":30253,"featured":439,"title":30254,"description":30255,"created":30256,"ordering":30250},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/96a7aaffd14c6435df417a583410bf64935f685b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3egT8EF/images/96a7aaffd14c6435df417a583410bf64935f685b.png","Create new machines","New technical blocks","2026-02-03T18:49:15.211409Z",2497318,"RWC0wkQb",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30260,"id":30261,"slug":30262,"project_type":31,"team":30263,"organization":3571,"title":30264,"description":30265,"body":30266,"body_url":3571,"published":30267,"updated":30268,"approved":30269,"queued":30270,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30271,"downloads":30272,"followers":30273,"categories":30274,"additional_categories":30275,"loaders":30276,"versions":30277,"icon_url":30279,"issues_url":30280,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":30280,"donation_urls":30281,"gallery":30282,"color":30292,"thread_id":30293,"monetization_status":30006},[1022],"s2OD4pdL","sonicdrivers","ReLXjesx","Sonic Drivers","A simple Doctor Who mod\nMade with MCreator","# Project on hold\n### progress will return shortly\n\n# \"**Sonic Drivers**\" the simple doctor who mod\n## Features\n### Sonic Screwdrivers(Sonic Drivers)\n- Limited use\n- 4 colours(red, green, blue, orange)\n- Survival friendly\n### Tardis\n- Poorly coded and scuffed\n- Not survival friendly\n### Time Lords\n- Don't spawn naturally \n### Gallifrey\n- 3 biomes (gallifrian mountains, gallifrian Desert, Badlands)\n- Trees(Cadonwood) based of 8th doctor's audio stories\n- Not survival friendly\n## What's to come?\n### Sonics\n- New models\n- More uses (if I can figure it out)\n### Tardis\n- Better useablity\n- New models\n- Survial friendly\n### Timelords\n- Spawn naturally\n- Better AI (if I can figure it out)","2024-04-13T14:26:08.195609Z","2024-04-13T14:32:22.511966Z","2024-04-16T06:20:11.568782Z","2024-04-13T15:53:10.055209Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},412,3,[30,288],[],[354],[30278],"huDkODe6","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OD4pdL/59bc20e78eaa7392273cfe6789d5237d77ea3ec4_96.webp","https://discord.gg/5uaV7x643f",[],[30283,30287],{"url":30284,"raw_url":30284,"featured":439,"title":30285,"description":3571,"created":30286,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OD4pdL/images/304723b0a92382947e6b6c46ea9660755b5be157.png","Items+Painting","2024-04-13T15:41:40.672995Z",{"url":30288,"raw_url":30289,"featured":439,"title":30290,"description":3571,"created":30291,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OD4pdL/images/acd7c90a874e9e04a56c6bb9777b90ff69114e93_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OD4pdL/images/acd7c90a874e9e04a56c6bb9777b90ff69114e93.png","Blocks","2024-04-13T15:41:16.056214Z",16382427,"cjeEr9Yf",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30295,"id":30296,"slug":30297,"project_type":34,"team":30298,"organization":30299,"title":30300,"description":30301,"body":30302,"body_url":3571,"published":30303,"updated":30304,"approved":30305,"queued":30306,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30307,"downloads":30308,"followers":29995,"categories":30309,"additional_categories":30310,"loaders":30311,"versions":30312,"icon_url":30316,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30317,"gallery":30318,"color":30330,"thread_id":30331,"monetization_status":30006},[826],"s35FfoCw","olde-worlde","EJPiMlyF","6J4qmBF3","Olde Worlde","\"Olde World\" is a meticulously crafted Minecraft modpack designed to transport players back to the beloved Alpha and Beta eras, infusing the latest Minecraft versions with a profound sense of nostalgia.","# Olde Worlde\n_Olde Worlde_ is a meticulously crafted Minecraft modpack designed to transport players back to the beloved Alpha and Beta eras, infusing the latest Minecraft versions with a profound sense of nostalgia. This Modrinth creation by RetroDim goes far beyond simple texture changes, aiming to recreate the distinct \"feel\" of early Minecraft.\n\nPlayers will rediscover the iconic, wild terrain generation, including the signature far lands, reminiscent of a time before modern biomes. The modpack reintroduces classic lighting, sound effects, and even the simpler, more mysterious progression systems that defined the game's nascent stages. From the blocky, yet charming, aesthetics to the less cluttered UI, \"Olde World\" offers an authentic blast from the past. It's a curated journey for veterans yearning for the game's formative years and a unique historical experience for newer players, proving that sometimes, \"Olde\" is truly golden.\n\n# WARNING\nThis is not a 1 to 1 modpack for beta/alpha versions of Minecraft. This is pre-modern recreation using a bunch of mods that recreate a TON of features, mechanics, world generators and vibes of Alpha Minecraft. This is still Modern minecraft, and will likely have bugs and glitches. Certain mods that add \"Mobs, Items, Mechanics\" may be edited and or removed to help keep the pre-modern feel; So please keep world backups. tysm \u003C3\n\n# Features\n- LAN anywhere, With anyone thanks to [e4mc](https://e4mc.link/)\n- Outvoted and Forgotten mobs thanks to [Friends&Foes](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes)\n- Wandering Player Mobs just like in beta 1.7.3\n- Modern Minecraft but how it could have been **GOLDEN**\n- Many more features and classic adventures await!","2025-05-28T05:26:44.380979Z","2025-08-20T17:28:42.713527Z","2025-06-03T17:27:35.983028Z","2025-05-28T07:27:35.454028Z",{"id":30138,"name":30139,"url":3571},243,[162,200],[],[346],[30313,30314,30315],"Be9ewudx","byWRQl41","kG6xeWhJ","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35FfoCw/06e03328fc4a05f41ff67496777a099771207a59_96.webp",[],[30319,30325],{"url":30320,"raw_url":30321,"featured":439,"title":30322,"description":30323,"created":30324,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35FfoCw/images/1f912fa437eecaf636444ad5cccf8ab698d91573_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35FfoCw/images/1f912fa437eecaf636444ad5cccf8ab698d91573.png","Custom World Presets","Loads beta 1.7.3 Terrain as default; Can be changed when making a new world under world-type: Moderner Beta Presets","2025-06-04T08:15:36.589287Z",{"url":30326,"raw_url":30327,"featured":439,"title":30328,"description":3571,"created":30329,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35FfoCw/images/b614ed24a773435f6b3e5ffb2b2b7cd5119f848a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35FfoCw/images/b614ed24a773435f6b3e5ffb2b2b7cd5119f848a.png","Worldgen Beta 1.7.3","2025-05-28T07:07:12.198761Z",3617569,"O7AN4Xhp",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30333,"id":30334,"slug":30335,"project_type":34,"team":30336,"organization":30337,"title":30338,"description":30339,"body":30340,"body_url":3571,"published":30341,"updated":30342,"approved":30343,"queued":30344,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30345,"downloads":30346,"followers":30273,"categories":30347,"additional_categories":30348,"loaders":30349,"versions":30350,"icon_url":30353,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":30354,"donation_urls":30355,"gallery":30356,"color":30363,"thread_id":30364,"monetization_status":30006},[739],"s3hegyX0","autumnsmp","i9dOVYwp","wX7gRMxG","Autumn SMP","Embark on a vibrant adventure in our First season. This modpack enhances your gameplay with an array of top-tier optimization and client mods.","# Experience the Magic of Autumn SMP\n\nAutumn SMP is a survival server in which the world is fully defined by its players.  \nTowns are built, markets flourish, and politics evolve through trade, alliances, and decisions every player makes.  \nYou are either a farmer, a merchant, a builder, or a ruler; your choices determine the direction of the server.  \n\n---\n\n## Core Survival Features\n- **Player-Controlled Towns**: Found or join towns, set your own policies, and decide how your town will evolve.  \n- **Dynamic Farming & Trade**: Food, animals, and commodities power the economy, unencumbered by admin shop interference.  \n- **Exploration & Discovery**: Multi-level Nether dungeons with growing difficulty and rewards require discovery.  \n- **Arena Challenges**: Go into the arena to pit your combat skills against others, gain rewards, and earn extra lives.  \n- **Casino Games**: Bet your luck and fortune in the casino, with the potential to win a fortune or lose everything.  \n- **Stock Market Simulation**: Invest in the server's ever-changing stock market, where prices fluctuate according to player interaction.  \n\n---\n\n## Economy & Trade\n- **Player Economy Only**: No server shop — all items, trades, or auctions are player-run completely.  \n- **Resource Value**: Diamonds, food, hearts, and rare loot all have value in Autumn's ever-changing economy.  \n- **Markets & Deals**: From street vendors to thriving town markets, business is in the people's hands.  \n\n---\n\n## Politics & Community\n- **Unions & Alliances**: Unite in unions, form alliances, and gain power through unity or competition.  \n- **Player-Driven Politics**: Players control conflicts, elections, and agreements, not admins.  \n- **Community Rules**: Polite play, honest PvP, and zero cheats — promoting a healthy community.  \n\n---\n\n## Why Autumn SMP?\nMost survival servers are complete anarchy or extremely controlled. Autumn SMP isn't.  \nHere, farming, trade, politics, and community are just as significant as combat.  \nWith arenas, casinos, dungeons, and a thriving stock market, every choice matters.  \n\nEvery crop harvested, every trade conducted, every alliance forged, and every risk taken creates the world.  ","2024-10-14T15:10:13.950156Z","2025-09-07T20:08:24.977332Z","2024-10-21T01:14:19.985507Z","2024-10-16T19:53:32.898783Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},320,[30,200],[211],[346],[30351,30352],"Js3eGrtZ","cEiAybaE","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3hegyX0/e74f6362a3cf36af2bd555c5c94e1a0c80e2d8c0_96.webp","https://discord.gg/UFAKct7msu",[],[30357],{"url":30358,"raw_url":30359,"featured":828,"title":30360,"description":30361,"created":30362,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3hegyX0/images/87cb997da08d79c64996e9c4546f013abd17dd18_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3hegyX0/images/87cb997da08d79c64996e9c4546f013abd17dd18.png","Autumn SMP Monument ","Monument Built on Autumn SMP server","2025-09-07T17:14:11.040725Z",13202459,"HjktAi4x",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30366,"id":30367,"slug":30368,"project_type":12,"team":30369,"organization":3571,"title":30370,"description":30371,"body":30372,"body_url":3571,"published":30373,"updated":30374,"approved":30375,"queued":30376,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30377,"downloads":30378,"followers":30379,"categories":30380,"additional_categories":30381,"loaders":30382,"versions":30383,"icon_url":30385,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":30386,"donation_urls":30387,"gallery":30390,"color":30396,"thread_id":30397,"monetization_status":30006},[772,769,739,691,649,640,634,589],"s3TZsyzL","brays-3d-tools","xuM5OiTK","Bray's Better 3D Tools!","Make Tools and Weapons feel more interesting with a 3D spin!","# Bray's 3D Tools!\n\n![DiamondAxe](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9ad66ea8b1839d2575f1674e3b6b906a7b166d95.jpeg)\n**Add some spice to your tools and weapons by giving them a 3D spin that still fits into the vanilla feel of Minecraft!**\n\n---\n\nNote: Resource Pack is currently in Alpha and will be updated with time\n\n\u003Ccenter>\n  \n[![Discord](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b716f9bf1f25106aea330ff2308302ce911dea3a.png)](https://discord.gg/H7JPX6hPQB)\n[![Youtube](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e66483ab22160e1621066e9df3c259615edd2ba9.png)](https://www.youtube.com/@BraysWorld_MC)\n\n\u003C/center>\n","2025-04-15T19:47:41.351759Z","2025-04-15T19:51:09.213750Z","2025-04-17T04:49:26.102998Z","2025-04-15T19:59:19.751317Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},6580,24,[148,197,307],[15,292],[377],[30384],"6BkL3BsT","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3TZsyzL/2978df2f4077db57e88e901269fc2724f44bfae6_96.webp","https://discord.gg/H7JPX6hPQB",[30388],{"id":3128,"platform":3129,"url":30389},"https://ko-fi.com/braydickey",[30391],{"url":30392,"raw_url":30393,"featured":828,"title":30394,"description":3571,"created":30395,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3TZsyzL/images/9ad66ea8b1839d2575f1674e3b6b906a7b166d95_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3TZsyzL/images/9ad66ea8b1839d2575f1674e3b6b906a7b166d95.jpeg","Diamond Axe","2025-04-15T19:57:39.747982Z",4867384,"KcNrpZlw",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30399,"id":30400,"slug":30401,"project_type":12,"team":30402,"organization":3571,"title":30403,"description":30404,"body":30405,"body_url":3571,"published":30406,"updated":30407,"approved":30408,"queued":30409,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30410,"downloads":30411,"followers":29995,"categories":30412,"additional_categories":30413,"loaders":30414,"versions":30415,"icon_url":30417,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30418,"gallery":30419,"color":30433,"thread_id":30434,"monetization_status":30006},[826,820,817,814,811,808,805,802,799,796,793,790,772,769,766,763,760,739,691,649,640,634,589,583,538],"s2X1GcIS","infuse-rp","DTz8M9oG","infuse-RP","The Resource Pack for the Infuse SMP plugin","Infuse SMP Official Resource Pack\n\n**This pack is required for the full Infuse SMP experience and is intended to be used alongside the Infuse SMP plugin on supported servers.**\n\nThis resource pack is designed specifically for the Infuse SMP plugin. It has been updated to work seamlessly across Minecraft 1.21 through 1.21.11, including compatibility with the newer item model and tint systems introduced in recent versions.\n\n**My Infuse Plugin is found here:**","2026-02-28T20:59:57.715212Z","2026-03-03T17:50:17.901314Z","2026-03-11T05:49:04.515318Z","2026-03-03T18:08:31.862560Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},260,[77],[194,307],[377],[30416],"Nubbnk6W","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2X1GcIS/9bbf8af0361d9f9dee4edc80085a7c4a83730dba_96.webp",[],[30420,30424,30428],{"url":30421,"raw_url":30421,"featured":439,"title":30422,"description":3571,"created":30423,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2X1GcIS/images/cad57f5a6f3510abbf7c9fb109dde157a41f0923.png","Custom Infuse Icons","2026-03-03T17:57:59.681934Z",{"url":30425,"raw_url":30425,"featured":828,"title":30426,"description":3571,"created":30427,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2X1GcIS/images/67cc3c5f09b2e1a6895d2464108f78992f0144af.png","Advancement Tree","2026-03-03T17:58:47.350624Z",{"url":30429,"raw_url":30429,"featured":439,"title":30430,"description":30431,"created":30432,"ordering":30273},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2X1GcIS/images/b587572cfae2fe3435111188d412cb8d69cb9633.png","Custom Bottle Imaging","Different Colors for each Infuse Potion","2026-03-03T18:07:38.099381Z",2821467,"pcWjxbId",{"client_side":30436,"server_side":30436,"game_versions":30437,"id":30438,"slug":30439,"project_type":38,"team":30440,"organization":3571,"title":30441,"description":30442,"body":30443,"body_url":3571,"published":30444,"updated":30445,"approved":30446,"queued":30447,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30448,"downloads":29995,"followers":29995,"categories":30450,"additional_categories":30451,"loaders":30452,"versions":30453,"icon_url":30455,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":30456,"donation_urls":30457,"gallery":30458,"color":30479,"thread_id":30480,"monetization_status":30481},"unknown",[],"s2vGh2LX","flexosmp","CpOB240o","Flexo SMP | Chapter 2","FlexoSMP, the next-generation Minecraft survival SMP, was created with the aims of fun, fairness, and unforgettable events.⚔️","FlexoSMP, the next-generation Minecraft survival SMP, was created with the aims of fun, fairness, and unforgettable events.⚔️\n\nStory-driven events, seasonal build challenges, balanced economy systems, jobs, and rewards. Everything at FlexoSMP is centered around community-first gameplay.\n\n✨ What is special about FlexoSMP?\n\nCustom events & boss fights with lore\n\nPlayer economy (jobs, shopping, voting rewards)\n\nLag-optimized, fair survival experience\n\nFriendly and Active Community\n\nConstant updates and long-term vision\n\nWhether you're a builder, a grinder, a PvE warrior, or a casual player, a world where your progress matters awaits at FlexoSMP.\n\nFlexoSMP | Play the story. Build the future.","2026-03-05T18:40:02.440898Z","2026-03-05T18:40:02.443635Z","2026-03-07T20:10:08.978717Z","2026-03-05T18:43:29.326491Z",{"id":30449,"name":10,"url":3571},"LicenseRef-Unknown",[206,235,272],[105,189,237,275,283],[],[30454],"gxvZHPMr","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/19332693af4d8103e6ebe167f9b69161cf94a5f5.webp","https://discord.flexo.lol",[],[30459,30463,30467,30471,30475],{"url":30460,"raw_url":30461,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":30462,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/2665703cb5d1601de0822619256adb90bd0a1e47_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/2665703cb5d1601de0822619256adb90bd0a1e47.png","2026-03-06T10:45:04.638709Z",{"url":30464,"raw_url":30465,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":30466,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/399c478949a196e42aec81365726b2f2bd999bca_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/399c478949a196e42aec81365726b2f2bd999bca.png","2026-03-06T10:43:58.802101Z",{"url":30468,"raw_url":30469,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":30470,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/52e1ee1a6448fc21073e342432383e3573d0efcb_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/52e1ee1a6448fc21073e342432383e3573d0efcb.png","2026-03-06T10:44:22.527387Z",{"url":30472,"raw_url":30473,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":30474,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/77af1286716034a842a7f8d457966adc560cc04c_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/77af1286716034a842a7f8d457966adc560cc04c.png","2026-03-06T10:45:21.512681Z",{"url":30476,"raw_url":30477,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":30478,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/90a077f03310ab0ad1b0e375f6d37f13fb24b345_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2vGh2LX/images/90a077f03310ab0ad1b0e375f6d37f13fb24b345.png","2026-03-06T10:44:10.878217Z",3083824,"tkcpbGV4","force-demonetized",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30483,"id":30484,"slug":30485,"project_type":31,"team":30486,"organization":3571,"title":30487,"description":30488,"body":30489,"body_url":3571,"published":30490,"updated":30491,"approved":30492,"queued":30493,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30494,"downloads":30495,"followers":29976,"categories":30496,"additional_categories":30497,"loaders":30498,"versions":30499,"icon_url":30503,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30504,"gallery":30505,"color":30518,"thread_id":30519,"monetization_status":30006},[1022],"s3dDaNji","babapratas-fishy-friends","TL3yzt2z","Babaprata's Fishy Friends","Adds in some new collectible fish","![title](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/61033dbbe8760f695eede769192c6f304845baca.png)\nBabaprata's Fishy Friends is a content mod that expands on gameplay, through fishing with a new fishing rod, and currently 58 new fish to collect, with many more to come! \n\n## Content\n\n**58 Brand new fish** to collect (with more planned)\n\nA **new fishing rod** to fish up special fish\n\nA **currency system**, as well as progression\n\n## Getting Started\n\n Advancements are your best friend! Although there aren't that many to follow, the system is relatively simple, and more will be added in the future!\n\n## The Future\n\nDiscord ( )\n\nFossilised Fish ( )\n\n## FAQ\n\nQ:Can I use this mod in...\n\nA: Yes, definitely! I really want to see others use this for additional content, but I do want to be credited when appropriate.\n\nQ: WIll you add...\n\nA: Comment on this mod page, and I will add it in if I deem it fleshed out enough.\n\n## Links\n[Curseforge Link](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/babapratas-fishy-friends)\n\n[Legacy Curseforge Link](https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/babapratas-fishy-friends)\n\nA huge thanks to my myxical on the MCreator forums for allowing this project to be made with his custom fishing rod effect tutorial, I couldn't have done it without him.\n","2024-02-11T10:53:35.423604Z","2024-03-15T07:27:56.349280Z","2024-02-20T08:04:26.901517Z","2024-02-11T11:09:09.698676Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},1300,[30,134],[100,105],[354],[30500,30501,30502],"RY8e4WIK","Qdui08gs","tTm1lqbO","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3dDaNji/f81e704ead023fa14176f8442b1f3f24009792ac.png",[],[30506,30512],{"url":30507,"raw_url":30508,"featured":439,"title":30509,"description":30510,"created":30511,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3dDaNji/images/662441e19bd66e8e0f7b6c38c6446afbbb25ca6c_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3dDaNji/images/662441e19bd66e8e0f7b6c38c6446afbbb25ca6c.png","Items","Some items that are available in the mod","2024-02-11T10:58:06.009191Z",{"url":30513,"raw_url":30514,"featured":439,"title":30515,"description":30516,"created":30517,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3dDaNji/images/aa2715b61a07000aac2a40e120db057ac29d3142_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3dDaNji/images/aa2715b61a07000aac2a40e120db057ac29d3142.png","Fish","Some fish that are available in the mod as of 1.4","2024-02-11T10:58:48.062866Z",2376056,"zrH3TeUh",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30521,"id":30522,"slug":30523,"project_type":12,"team":30524,"organization":3571,"title":30525,"description":30526,"body":30527,"body_url":3571,"published":30528,"updated":30529,"approved":30530,"queued":30531,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30532,"downloads":30533,"followers":29976,"categories":30534,"additional_categories":30535,"loaders":30536,"versions":30537,"icon_url":30539,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30540,"gallery":30543,"color":30549,"thread_id":30550,"monetization_status":30006},[739],"s3TX4UFa","invisible-guis","1Y4IkFuS","invisible gui's","makes most gui's invisible","makes most gui's invisible like the furnace, blaster, smoker, crafting table, inventory, hotbar and more but not all and they still function like normal but you can see trough them now.","2025-05-02T17:47:46.986102Z","2025-05-02T17:48:58.392995Z","2025-05-07T05:50:12.028958Z","2025-05-02T17:52:21.053142Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},258,[139],[25,93,194,268,292,307],[377],[30538],"JTBBR3Gl","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3TX4UFa/97c475c0ef3c35e00fd61012a1f26b4502b13457.jpeg",[30541],{"id":3131,"platform":3132,"url":30542},"https://www.youtube.com/@thisisM7373",[30544],{"url":30545,"raw_url":30546,"featured":439,"title":30547,"description":3571,"created":30548,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3TX4UFa/images/468a534ed5c7cf6be8312a36ce7c5dbf63657580_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3TX4UFa/images/468a534ed5c7cf6be8312a36ce7c5dbf63657580.png","inventory with recource pack","2025-05-02T17:51:28.035826Z",4400414,"hYdvBWVk",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30552,"id":30553,"slug":30554,"project_type":31,"team":30555,"organization":3571,"title":30556,"description":30557,"body":30558,"body_url":3571,"published":30559,"updated":30560,"approved":30561,"queued":30562,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30563,"downloads":30566,"followers":30273,"categories":30567,"additional_categories":30568,"loaders":30569,"versions":30570,"icon_url":30573,"issues_url":30574,"source_url":30575,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30576,"gallery":30580,"color":30581,"thread_id":30553,"monetization_status":30006},[1151],"s3IXS7yO","gluon","RoXZuBZJ","Gluon","Small customizable tweaks for Minecraft","# gluon\nGluon is a bunch of small, and customizable vanilla-style tweaks for Minecraft.\n# features\n- unbreakable leads\n- villagers can be leashed\n- you can use blocks through signs and item frames (sneak to use the sign or item frame instead)\n- /stonecutter command\n- craftable leather (4 rotten flesh)\n- you can craft a nether wart block into 9 nether warts\n- piglin brutes drop netherite scrap (55% chance, +15% chance for every Looting level)\n- piglins are neutral for 15 seconds after bartering\n- piglins spawn anger particles when they get angry\n# configuration\nEvery feature (other than recipes as of now) can be disabled and/or customized.  \nUse Mod Menu (https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) to open the mod's configuration screen. \n# installation\nMost of the mod's features require the mod to be installed on both the client and the server.\n# modpacks\nYou can freely use this mod in your modpack if you want.\n# updates\nAs of now, the mod will stay on 1.19.2 only. When 1.20 releases, the mod will be updated for that version.","2023-05-10T21:26:49.876583Z","2023-05-11T12:05:48.311559Z","2023-05-12T00:57:48.863199Z","2023-05-10T21:38:14.480996Z",{"id":30564,"name":30565,"url":3571},"CC0-1.0","Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal",303,[134,303],[191,279],[346],[30571,30572],"H8gcWy4b","B1OwZG7J","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3IXS7yO/c1d784e3e2c4946fc64fcd9a69f2dd5a74891388_96.webp","https://github.com/inxanedev/gluon/issues","https://github.com/inxanedev/gluon",[30577],{"id":3122,"platform":30578,"url":30579},"Paypal","https://paypal.me/inxanen1nja",[],5526612,{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30583,"id":30584,"slug":30585,"project_type":12,"team":30586,"organization":3571,"title":30587,"description":30588,"body":30589,"body_url":3571,"published":30590,"updated":30591,"approved":30592,"queued":30593,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30594,"downloads":30597,"followers":30598,"categories":30599,"additional_categories":30600,"loaders":30601,"versions":30602,"icon_url":30611,"issues_url":30612,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30613,"gallery":30616,"color":30632,"thread_id":30633,"monetization_status":30006},[1028,1022,989,947,941,869,863,826,820,772,769,739,691,649,640,634,589,583,538],"s3PvB3Pn","undopia-3d-chiseled-bookshelf","RBR4RJhU","Undopia 3D Chiseled Bookshelf","Gives the Chiseled Bookshelf a 3 dimensional model","\u003Cdiv align=\"center\">\n\n![undopia-3d-chiseled-bookshelf](https://i.imgur.com/N1lhvud.png)\n\n# Undopia 3D Chiseled Bookshelf\n\n[![Modrinth Downloads](https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/undopia-3d-chiseled-bookshelf?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&color=%231bd96a)\n](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/undopia-3d-chiseled-bookshelf)\n[![CurseForge Downloads](https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1162747?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&color=%23f16436)\n](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/undopia-3d-chiseled-bookshelf)\n\n[![ko-fi](https://i.imgur.com/wv1uE4k.png)](https://ko-fi.com/undugt)\n\n3D Chiseled Bookshelf makes your Chiseled Bookshelves 3D by modeling each Book in the shelf!\n\nWorks great with [Undopia 3D Bookshelf](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/undopia-3d-bookshelf).\n\n---\n\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv align=\"center\">\n\n[![Undopia Patch Resource Pack](https://i.imgur.com/beZ50qS.png)](https://patch.undopia.net)\n\nThis resource pack is part of the Undopia Patch family.\n\nIt is made of these Undopia Patch Features\n\n![AK0EfnZ.png](https://i.imgur.com/AK0EfnZ.png)\n\n\nIf you want to customize any of these use the Undopia Patch Customizer.\n\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv align=\"center\">\n\n---\n\n[![Customizer](https://i.imgur.com/UEAZSvr.png)](https://patch.undopia.net/custom-downloads/)\n[![FAQ](https://i.imgur.com/GGUjVLj.png)](https://patch.undopia.net/faq)\n[![Terms & Conditions](https://i.imgur.com/kVzzs3F.png)](https://patch.undopia.net/terms-and-conditions)\n[![Bug Report / Feature Suggestion](https://i.imgur.com/mYSKqtv.png)](https://github.com/UnduGT/undopiapatch/issues)\n\n\u003C/div>\n    ","2024-12-20T13:37:15.867271Z","2025-12-26T16:13:14.030608Z","2024-12-22T00:21:57.724814Z","2024-12-20T13:44:48.669591Z",{"id":30595,"name":10,"url":30596},"LicenseRef-Undopia-Patch-License","https://patch.undopia.net/terms-and-conditions",29674,41,[57,300,307],[15,197],[377],[30603,30604,30605,30606,30607,30608,30609,30610],"Z53Zij1Y","LJLe5OQd","zIKiOxV0","Hr38M1CP","On3dGAyy","MHug4aAa","Jx1ZsEj8","2g4pjPls","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PvB3Pn/2e6b4bef71a995d8668a9ceb15c9d826c71cf7e2_96.webp","https://github.com/UnduGT/undopiapatch/issues",[30614],{"id":3128,"platform":3129,"url":30615},"https://ko-fi.com/undugt",[30617,30622,30627],{"url":30618,"raw_url":30619,"featured":828,"title":30620,"description":3571,"created":30621,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PvB3Pn/images/056591359a8d13d6b9871dd9b791e36cbaf542dc_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PvB3Pn/images/056591359a8d13d6b9871dd9b791e36cbaf542dc.png","Chiseled Bookshelves in a Library","2024-12-20T13:43:55.838197Z",{"url":30623,"raw_url":30624,"featured":439,"title":30625,"description":3571,"created":30626,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PvB3Pn/images/54bc6b9b268551e979a9151824639ce76e2b3221_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PvB3Pn/images/54bc6b9b268551e979a9151824639ce76e2b3221.png","Wall of Chiseled Bookshelves","2024-12-20T13:44:17.578302Z",{"url":30628,"raw_url":30629,"featured":439,"title":30630,"description":3571,"created":30631,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PvB3Pn/images/c663a5b4f2347336e657f03018d07ac82a599222_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PvB3Pn/images/c663a5b4f2347336e657f03018d07ac82a599222.png","Chiseled Bookshelves in a Library (Front View)","2024-12-20T13:44:41.993474Z",5390375,"m77YSL1G",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30635,"id":30636,"slug":30637,"project_type":31,"team":30638,"organization":3571,"title":30639,"description":30640,"body":30641,"body_url":3571,"published":30642,"updated":30643,"approved":30644,"queued":30645,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30646,"downloads":30647,"followers":29976,"categories":30648,"additional_categories":30649,"loaders":30650,"versions":30651,"icon_url":30660,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30661,"gallery":30662,"color":30663,"thread_id":30664,"monetization_status":30006},[1022],"s2G6DIEd","trulytweaks","UVnMQhUJ","[DEPRECATED] TrulyTweaks","This mod is no longer being actively worked on. - TrulyAussie","TrulyTweaks is a mod full of a big amount of small things, and a small amount of big ones. The mod features things like recipe changes and additions, for example smoking rotten flesh to leather, as well as a few items to aid you on your modding journey.\n\n## TrulyTweaks is now compatible with other mods!\n### Currently, these mods are supported:\n- _Create, by Simibubi_\n\nTrulyTweaks is currently still going through development. If you would like to suggest a feature, such as a new item or a mod for compatability, please DM TrulyAussie (trulyaussie) on discord. Thank you!\n","2024-01-16T23:08:17.197319Z","2024-03-08T06:24:15.846961Z","2024-01-17T23:30:22.755897Z","2024-01-16T23:47:06.484069Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},459,[115,134,303],[175],[354],[30652,30653,30654,30655,30656,30657,30658,30659],"mIntNawV","JLafHYcN","kaleGlH4","MV2trtWK","jxWaunBZ","RPgnxkts","j0pVcmsn","2um6Iydo","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2G6DIEd/333f351f965db0201d814002a5fc654576594baf_96.webp",[],[],5064254,"P1vxZHYp",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30666,"id":30667,"slug":30668,"project_type":34,"team":30669,"organization":3571,"title":30670,"description":30671,"body":30672,"body_url":3571,"published":30673,"updated":30674,"approved":30675,"queued":30676,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30677,"downloads":30678,"followers":30221,"categories":30679,"additional_categories":30680,"loaders":30681,"versions":30682,"icon_url":30684,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30685,"gallery":30686,"color":30687,"thread_id":30688,"monetization_status":30006},[1022],"s2xtCGFE","tekwiz","twHvyQAt","Tekwiz","A modpack with the best and the most necessary magic, tech, and quality of life mods.","# What the heck is a Tekwiz?!\nWhere Arcane Power Meets Technological Mastery\n\nStep into the world of Tekwiz, a carefully crafted Minecraft modpack where the arcane arts and high-tech innovation collide. Whether you dream of becoming a master spellcaster or a technological tycoon, Tekwiz gives you the tools to shape your world your way.\n\n🔮 Magic Meets Mystery\nUncover ancient secrets with Ars Nouveau, weaving powerful spells and summoning familiars to assist you in battle and automation. Channel life energy with Biomancy, manipulate mystical flora through Botania, or tame mystical creatures with Chococraft. Hunt down rare Artifacts hidden throughout the world and expand your strength with Heart Crystals, boosting your max health as you explore.\n\nAt the peak of magical might lies Draconic Evolution — offering god-tier weapons, armor, and even time-manipulation... but only for those who dare to face its challenges.\n\n⚙️ Technology & Automation\nBuild complex machines and factories using the Thermal Series: Foundation, Expansion, Dynamics, and Cultivation. Automate everything from ore processing to farming, and streamline power generation for your magical and mechanical needs.\n\nMaster advanced crafting and digital storage with Applied Energistics 2, turning your base into a hub of infinite inventory control. Journey into space with Ad Astra, exploring the stars and gathering rare resources from distant planets.\n\nBoost your tools and weapons with Tinker's Construct and its leveling addon — upgrading gear as you use it, combining the best of both combat and utility.\n\n💎 Loot & Adventure\nWith Loot+, every dungeon, chest, and structure becomes a treasure trove of surprises. From rare magical relics to powerful gear enhancements, exploration is always rewarded.\n\nTekwiz is ideal for players who love freedom of choice: build sky-high tech empires, master spellcraft, or fuse the two into a hybrid playstyle that’s uniquely yours.\n\nForge your path. Unlock your potential. Become the ultimate Tech Wizard!\n\n68 Mods Included: _(If they aren't listed below they are dependencies)_\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Magic\u003C/summary>\n\nArs Novaeu\n\nArtifacts\n\nBiomancy\n\nBotania\n\nChococraft\n\nDraconic Evolution\n\nHeart Crystals\n\nLoot+\n\u003C/details>\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Tech\u003C/summary>\n\nThermal Foundation\n\nThermal Expansion\n\nThermal Dynamics\n\nThermal Cultivation\n\nTinker's Construct\n\nTinker's Leveling Addon\n\nAd Astra\n\nApplied Energistics 2\n\u003C/details>\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Quality of Life\u003C/summary>\n\nIron Chests: Restocked\n\nIron Furnaces\n\nChicken Chunks\n\nGravestone Mod\n\nElevatorMod\n\nAzureDooms Angel Ring\n\nL2 Backpack\n\nMob Lassos\n\nPortable Spawners\n\nResource Nether Ores\n\u003C/details>\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Performance & Game\u003C/summary>\n\nEmbeddium\n\nChloride\n\nFerriteCore\n\nEntity Culling\n\nModernFix\n\nImmediately Fast\n\nJade\n\nJEI\n\nControlling\n\nSearchables\n\nTrash Slot\n\nToroHealth Damage Indicators\n\nCoreCommands\n\nSuper Bosses\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","2025-06-15T00:25:48.968068Z","2025-07-01T19:56:25.212028Z","2025-06-23T18:31:32.880140Z","2025-06-15T19:29:08.930087Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},168,[30,69,171],[77,211,288],[354],[30683],"wUzJXMkG","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2xtCGFE/b4d3b12695fb19d6a63d998d2d4e2c21eb623a68_96.webp",[],[],2500411,"R3HZUDNf",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30690,"id":30691,"slug":30692,"project_type":31,"team":30693,"organization":3571,"title":30694,"description":30695,"body":30696,"body_url":3571,"published":30697,"updated":30698,"approved":30699,"queued":30700,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30701,"downloads":30704,"followers":30221,"categories":30705,"additional_categories":30706,"loaders":30707,"versions":30708,"icon_url":30710,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30711,"gallery":30712,"color":30713,"thread_id":30714,"monetization_status":30006},[1250,1193,1160,1151,1115,1076,1028,1022,989,947,941,869,863,826,820,772,769,739,691,649,640,634,589,583,538,484,478,465],"s2pdT3TI","sneak-grow","SFIuIHjQ","Sneak Grow","Sneak to grow nearby crops by 1. (5x-3y-5z)","One of my first java paper plugins, pretty basic. when the player sneaks it looks at nearby crops in a 5x3x5 area and grows them by 1.","2025-06-13T05:46:15.309287Z","2025-06-13T05:49:57.561672Z","2025-06-18T09:22:19.323203Z","2025-06-13T05:50:01.065866Z",{"id":30702,"name":30703,"url":3571},"GPL-3.0-or-later","GNU General Public License v3.0 or later",124,[],[],[401],[30709],"iVAlJH3E","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2pdT3TI/b6be19bb8438c29ae7d962295c8f97b9a15e998d.webp",[],[],3759384,"NhOf4RZT",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30716,"id":30717,"slug":30718,"project_type":31,"team":30719,"organization":3571,"title":30720,"description":30721,"body":30722,"body_url":3571,"published":30723,"updated":30724,"approved":30723,"queued":3571,"status":29947,"requested_status":3571,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30725,"downloads":30728,"followers":30729,"categories":30730,"additional_categories":30731,"loaders":30732,"versions":30733,"icon_url":30758,"issues_url":30759,"source_url":30760,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":30761,"donation_urls":30762,"gallery":30765,"color":30791,"thread_id":30717,"monetization_status":30006},[1373,1355,1292,1193,1160,1151,1115,1022,989,941],"s2OAgsTb","cammies-wearable-backpacks","SE04Ello","Cammie's Wearable Backpacks","Adds classic wearable backpacks in 16 colours!","\u003Ctable align=\"center\">\n    \u003Ctr>\n        \u003Cth>\n            \u003Ca href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/qsl\">\n                \u003Cimg src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/cozy/requires/quilt-standard-libraries_64h.png\" width=\"311\" height=\"64\" title=\"QSL\" alt=\"QSL\">\n            \u003C/a>\n        \u003C/th>\n    \u003C/tr>\n\u003C/table>\n\n---\n\nJust a small mod that adds 16 backpacks to the game that can be worn in the chest slot.\n\nYou get double the inventory space, and can be placed on the ground as a nice decoration!\n\n**Pics for Clicks :hahayes:**\n\u003Cdetails>\n  \n  ![Backpack on player from back](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142283955-60842ff4-7ee9-4c7d-ad13-5eee08c6b0ab.png)\n  ![Backpack on player from front](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142284019-146ca1d8-ae8d-41a4-b0c5-a0c2e708d030.png)\n  ![Backpack GUI on ground](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142284054-911f7586-f9a0-4a12-98f1-f7c98044e7ed.png)\n  ![Backpack GUI on player](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142284068-394839a8-fbea-4f93-a165-22fa42b98243.png)\n  ![Survival inventory when wearing backpack](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142284075-82b1ada8-fefa-4a1c-9558-dfefb78452e0.png)\n\u003C/details>\n\n**Q:** Can you please let us put backpacks in a Trinkets slot?\n**A:** No. It's a lot of extra effort for a feature I don't feel like implementing. It makes the inventory space free with literally 0 cost to it. If you want that, go install any other backpack mod.\n\n**Q:** How do I craft a backpack?\n**A:** You can install REI to see all of them, but this is the format.\n\n![Backpack Crafting Recipe](https://mod-assets.upcraft.dev/promo/cammies-wearable-backpacks/modpage_crafting.png)\n\n---\n\n\u003Ctable align=\"center\">\n    \u003Ctr>\n        \u003Cth>\u003Cb>Join my Discord\u003C/b>\u003C/th>\n        \u003Cth>\u003Cb>Join my Ko-Fi!\u003C/b>\u003C/th>\n    \u003C/tr>\n    \u003Ctr>\n        \u003Cth>\u003Ca href=\"https://discord.gg/f5dFYWX\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/discord.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" title=\"Cammie's Corner Discord\" alt=\"Cammie's Corner Discord\">\u003C/a>\u003C/th>\n        \u003Cth>\u003Ca href=\"https://ko-fi.com/camellias/tiers\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/kofi.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" title=\"Cammie's Corner Patreon\" alt=\"Cammie's Corner Patreon\">\u003C/a>\u003C/th>\n    \u003C/tr>\n\u003C/table>","2021-10-28T02:22:00.072167Z","2024-05-24T12:24:16.778858Z",{"id":30726,"name":10,"url":30727},"LicenseRef-Custom","https://github.com/Up-Mods/Cammies-Wearable-Backpacks/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md",14196,48,[30,115,279],[303],[346,385,409],[30734,30735,30736,30737,30738,30739,30740,30741,30742,30743,30744,30745,30746,30747,30748,30749,30750,30751,30752,30753,30754,30755,30756,30757],"DKAMzWbR","cCUozLE6","3ZAxXPjp","bcgg8RCZ","LCyMLQq6","Wj4FZTv2","c5PTtF0g","MoLUloxd","xva2U8po","bVTALiNR","x6tMOUJV","G1UwLqve","3XM4wViK","Zt6yJhbg","41yCBqNl","vmFlUsgQ","fSk9xpH5","3uZsVPMh","3uTgEO0w","TppPP8pH","GKXjS233","iVdaiRdX","clmS5aJw","oQbhnfl3","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/2b41dd8370695ef8d74b3e820c55f6741245b3bf_96.webp","https://github.com/Up-Mods/Cammies-Wearable-Backpacks/issues","https://github.com/Up-Mods/Cammies-Wearable-Backpacks","https://discord.gg/f5dFYWX",[30763],{"id":3128,"platform":3129,"url":30764},"https://ko-fi.com/camellias",[30766,30771,30776,30781,30786],{"url":30767,"raw_url":30768,"featured":439,"title":30769,"description":3571,"created":30770,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/31329757d16aee41c5e2703128d0e456985f1198_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/31329757d16aee41c5e2703128d0e456985f1198.png","Survival inventory when wearing backpack","2023-12-30T13:57:48.998612Z",{"url":30772,"raw_url":30773,"featured":439,"title":30774,"description":3571,"created":30775,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/6942b12914435b719d5caf480c12cfff239a1b79_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/6942b12914435b719d5caf480c12cfff239a1b79.png","Backpack GUI on ground","2023-12-30T13:56:56.939592Z",{"url":30777,"raw_url":30778,"featured":439,"title":30779,"description":3571,"created":30780,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/a2f528887be67d9a95a492d31c816584f238c2d0_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/a2f528887be67d9a95a492d31c816584f238c2d0.png","Backpack on player from back","2023-12-30T13:56:01.737175Z",{"url":30782,"raw_url":30783,"featured":828,"title":30784,"description":3571,"created":30785,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/a4aeb7471cea6ee3368269adae7bedba1182b885_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/678956ec2eac816ebbe91cbeb7017a6e5f29fc52.png","Backpack on player from front","2023-12-30T13:56:31.100889Z",{"url":30787,"raw_url":30788,"featured":439,"title":30789,"description":3571,"created":30790,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/fae0b58a4a8f94561aa61fc94ba6678c3d6fb177_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OAgsTb/images/fae0b58a4a8f94561aa61fc94ba6678c3d6fb177.png","Backpack GUI on player","2023-12-30T13:57:19.519803Z",5706772,{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30793,"id":30794,"slug":30795,"project_type":12,"team":30796,"organization":3571,"title":30797,"description":30798,"body":30799,"body_url":3571,"published":30800,"updated":30801,"approved":30802,"queued":30803,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30804,"downloads":30805,"followers":30221,"categories":30806,"additional_categories":30807,"loaders":30808,"versions":30809,"icon_url":30811,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":30812,"donation_urls":30813,"gallery":30814,"color":30826,"thread_id":30827,"monetization_status":30006},[1292,1277,1250,1193,1160,1151,1115,1076,1028,1022,989,947,941,869,863,826,820,772,769,739,691,649,640,634,589,583,538],"s2obQxXn","pirates-hardcore-heart-totem","qAFvwhUq","Hardcore Heart Totem","This pack changes the texture of the Totem of Undying to an Minecraft hardcore Heart","# ❤️ Heart Totem\n## \"Keep your heart in your hand.\"\n\nTired of the bulky golden villager statue taking up your screen? Heart Totem is a simple, lightweight resource pack that replaces the standard Totem of Undying with a vibrant, iconic Minecraft heart.\n\n## ✨ Features\nClean Design: Replaces the totem sprite with a high-quality heart icon that fits perfectly with the vanilla UI.\n\nBetter Visibility: The heart model is sleeker and less intrusive in your off-hand.\n\nThematic Consistency: Makes \"extra lives\" feel more intuitive—you're literally holding onto your life!\n\n## 🛠️ Installation\n1. Download the .zip file.\n\n2. Drop it into your resourcepacks folder.\n\n3. Activate it in-game under Options > Resource Packs.","2026-02-09T12:25:25.086588Z","2026-02-09T12:47:24.726736Z","2026-02-22T08:33:09.626585Z","2026-02-09T13:11:34.156077Z",{"id":29973,"name":29974,"url":3571},926,[15,115,148],[77,100,268,307],[377],[30810],"3FFjLLwm","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2obQxXn/6c7f960624c0b66fe3080925f495e00353246cd2.png","https://discord.gg/nDz35mdDnq",[],[30815,30821],{"url":30816,"raw_url":30817,"featured":828,"title":30818,"description":30819,"created":30820,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2obQxXn/images/bce23f832b5d129a80a9a9e8faa4eccbb0aa0eb2_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2obQxXn/images/bce23f832b5d129a80a9a9e8faa4eccbb0aa0eb2.png","Totem in Hand","This is the pack in use","2026-02-09T13:10:58.297418Z",{"url":30822,"raw_url":30823,"featured":439,"title":30824,"description":30824,"created":30825,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2obQxXn/images/b30332c8e8c38e153bf8836b0465f2b8df612409_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2obQxXn/images/b30332c8e8c38e153bf8836b0465f2b8df612409.png","Pack Functionality Showcase","2026-02-23T09:56:56.041489Z",263172,"Mwcatc8L",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30829,"id":30830,"slug":30831,"project_type":31,"team":30832,"organization":3571,"title":30833,"description":30834,"body":30835,"body_url":3571,"published":30836,"updated":30837,"approved":30838,"queued":30839,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30840,"downloads":30842,"followers":29995,"categories":30843,"additional_categories":30844,"loaders":30845,"versions":30846,"icon_url":30849,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30850,"gallery":30851,"color":30852,"thread_id":30853,"monetization_status":30006},[1907,1883,1874,1757,1748,1733,1718,1694,1625,1619,1610,1520,1517,1487,1481,1469,1448,1373,1355,1292,1277,1250,1193,1160,1151,1115,1076,1028,1022,989,947,941,869,863,826],"s2rtnCoH","autofarm","6My5i56z","AutoFarm","Plugin that adds the ability to create an auto farm on the server","Плагин добавляющий возможность создать автоферму на сервере. В конфиге плагина можно выставить цену за каждое растение. Также можно включить или выключить настройку отвечающую за то, чтобы растение появлялось сразу большим. Можно настроить задерку с которой растение будет засаживаться.  \nКоманды:  \n/autofarm reload - перезагрузить плагин  \n/autofarm setpos1 - поставить первую точку  \n/autofarm setpos2 - поставить вторую точку  \n/autofarm addregion - создать регион фермы  \n/autofarm removeregion - удалить регион фермы  \n/autofarm editregion - редактировать регион фермы\n/autofarm getsalary - получить зарплату (если в конфиге стоит manual)\n/af = /autofarm  \nA plugin that adds the ability to create an autofarm on the server. In the plugin config, you can set the price for each plant. You can also enable or disable the setting that is responsible for the plant appearing immediately large. You can configure the delay with which the plant will be planted.  \nCommands:  \n/autofarm reload - reload the plugin  \n/autofarm setpos1 - set the first point  \n/autofarm setpos2 - set the second point  \n/autofarm addregion - create a farm region  \n/autofarm removeregion - delete a farm region  \n/autofarm editregion - edit a farm region\n/autofarm getsalary - get salary (if manual is set in config)\n/af = /autofarm  ","2025-08-27T18:01:15.589579Z","2025-08-28T13:24:43.098394Z","2025-08-28T08:21:23.052279Z","2025-08-28T05:42:53.738532Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":30841},"https://webmaster-tools.online/bins/e7f022eb4fcc784e71b167e8ff0ca1eb",148,[105,134],[],[329,401,405,417],[30847,30848],"F0gnDadH","h9XOf4Bb","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2rtnCoH/0710ac3fece3f383b98f1c49f33ee268106aabe3.png",[],[],10324039,"5sNKMadU",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30855,"id":30856,"slug":30857,"project_type":34,"team":30858,"organization":3571,"title":30859,"description":30860,"body":30861,"body_url":3571,"published":30862,"updated":30863,"approved":30864,"queued":30865,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30866,"downloads":30869,"followers":30221,"categories":30870,"additional_categories":30871,"loaders":30872,"versions":30873,"icon_url":30883,"issues_url":30884,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30885,"gallery":30886,"color":30908,"thread_id":30909,"monetization_status":30006},[989,941],"s35or7nJ","superzekes-pvp","buOcFVAO","SuperZekes's PvP Pack","A Minecraft modpack designed to be used with PvP - it also works well for multiplayer server use. Made for players and content creators.","# SuperZekes's PvP Pack\n\n\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/SuperZekes/SuperZekes-PvP-Pack\">\u003Cimg alt=\"github\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\">\u003C/a>\n\n\n\n\nThis modpack is perfect for PvPers. Mods such as small totem pops are great so you can see more when you're in battle! Also another good one is world host so you can host worlds to battle your friends, on top of that I have added in some QoL features as well. It includes ViaFabricPlus. If your looking to play a server for an older version then simply change the version using the button, then join it and boom! This modpack works with all versions! look at some more \u003Ca href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/superzekes-pvp/gallery\">here\u003C/a>. I made this pack because of my love to PvP. I hope the mods in here help you while in battle! There is a custom cape you can [download](https://tinyurl.com/23hkdhgz) you can use the capes mod and sign up for [minecraftcapes.net](https://minecraftcapes.net/) and upload it.\n\n## Looking for a place to PvP?\nI would recommend \u003Ca href=\"https://pvplegacy.net/\">PvP Legacy\u003C/a> if you want the best 1.9 pvp experience.\n\nI would highly recommend \u003Ca href=\"https://hypixel.net/\">Hypixel\u003C/a> if your looking for a 1.8 pvp server\n\n## Theres a version I want thats not there\nAs said above viafabricplus lets you join servers from any version.\nIf theres a version you really really want for whatever reason fork the repo on GitHub and make it yourself!","2023-11-20T20:41:11.705072Z","2024-04-03T13:07:01.211067Z","2023-11-26T18:35:04.502687Z","2023-11-23T18:15:27.707227Z",{"id":30867,"name":30868,"url":3571},"Apache-2.0","Apache License 2.0",4597,[77,200,211],[288],[346],[30874,30875,30876,30877,30878,30879,30880,30881,30882],"4uGPjQ4h","uiZi4cfv","ZZeWvqeJ","p3t56pyU","CL52TbvQ","k6yRSEiH","mLYsfTKL","6HbZjVk8","Q9ggi1YO","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35or7nJ/b7e5f04b799636139801f3681686e4143e913e4b_96.webp","https://github.com/SuperZekes/SuperZekes-PvP-Pack/issues",[],[30887,30892,30897,30903],{"url":30888,"raw_url":30889,"featured":439,"title":30890,"description":3571,"created":30891,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35or7nJ/images/3a387666f3d5492d24b04a501b58aa93caae1281_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35or7nJ/images/3a387666f3d5492d24b04a501b58aa93caae1281.png","A simple mini map","2023-11-21T12:52:31.209409Z",{"url":30893,"raw_url":30894,"featured":439,"title":30895,"description":3571,"created":30896,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35or7nJ/images/4303bdad80fdce61d3371bd0c80a85aeb29d31e8_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35or7nJ/images/4303bdad80fdce61d3371bd0c80a85aeb29d31e8.png","Better statistics","2023-11-21T12:38:05.627588Z",{"url":30898,"raw_url":30899,"featured":439,"title":30900,"description":30901,"created":30902,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35or7nJ/images/7dea9da882af1a4596b83522947af4479f1a1590_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35or7nJ/images/7dea9da882af1a4596b83522947af4479f1a1590.png","Fast better grass","Faster FPS!","2023-11-21T12:36:01.652004Z",{"url":30904,"raw_url":30905,"featured":828,"title":30906,"description":3571,"created":30907,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35or7nJ/images/e37ad65d706b0abaa54db3ed8131117d36b97946_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s35or7nJ/images/253ff65e05f1b496fa4c119f6ee1a7628175547c.png","Small totem pops","2023-11-21T12:40:24.577440Z",14727840,"9VyEwqGd",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30911,"id":30912,"slug":30913,"project_type":12,"team":30914,"organization":3571,"title":30915,"description":30916,"body":30917,"body_url":3571,"published":30918,"updated":30919,"approved":30920,"queued":30921,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":30922,"license":30924,"downloads":30927,"followers":30928,"categories":30929,"additional_categories":30930,"loaders":30931,"versions":30932,"icon_url":30934,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30935,"gallery":30936,"color":30937,"thread_id":30912,"monetization_status":30006},[1193,1160,1151,1115,1076],"s2J5tPi3","oof-sfx","X0wV8m03","Minecraft but, all death sounds are OOF!","Replaces all death sounds with the iconic Roblox OOF!","## Are pvp battles getting a bit boring? Is farming mobs for hours not satisfying?\n\nWell, do not fear as I've made a resource pack to make events like these 5% more enjoyable, by replacing most death sounds in the game with the iconic Roblox OOF sound.\n\nI hope you enjoy, :>\n\n\n\u003C>\u003C","2023-02-17T14:01:06.960662Z","2023-05-16T14:33:00.713606Z","2023-05-18T21:29:29.750268Z","2023-05-16T14:38:51.455795Z",{"message":30923,"body":3571},"Made me giggle.",{"id":30925,"name":30926,"url":3571},"CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0","Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial No Derivatives 4.0 International",1444,4,[50,93,292],[77,268],[377],[30933],"d96ZeEYo","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2J5tPi3/8ed081e8a78332af784f052df0465b947551765b.png",[],[],8139837,{"client_side":30436,"server_side":30436,"game_versions":30939,"id":30940,"slug":30941,"project_type":34,"team":30942,"organization":3571,"title":30943,"description":30944,"body":30945,"body_url":3571,"published":30946,"updated":30947,"approved":30948,"queued":30949,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30950,"downloads":30598,"followers":29976,"categories":30951,"additional_categories":30952,"loaders":30953,"versions":30954,"icon_url":30959,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":30960,"donation_urls":30961,"gallery":30962,"color":30967,"thread_id":30968,"monetization_status":30481},[820],"s2xsQhKF","pcgmon-2.0","P43v9bYU","PCGMon 2.0","Modpack to join my cobblemon server","Welcome to PCGmon 2.0 — a Cobblemon server built to feel alive.\n\n\nIf you want a place to actually play long-term (not just catch a few mons and dip), this is it.\n\nIP: pcgmon.my.pebble.host\n✅ Modpack required to join\n\n🔥 Highlights:\nExclusive Sinister Fakemon (server-only)\nEvents + community-driven server updates\nSafari World with zones for focused spawns\nUpgraded, themed Raid Dens\nCustom questline + progression content\nUnderground digging mini-game\nEV training area\nRelaxed, fair economy + casual vibes\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7dZT7J9wMew\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>","2026-03-02T17:51:58.629809Z","2026-03-03T03:54:21.473823Z","2026-03-03T05:24:30.700488Z","2026-03-03T03:55:09.061407Z",{"id":30449,"name":10,"url":3571},[88,97,226],[62,103,105,150,233,235,237,283,307],[346],[30955,30956,30957,30958],"ReNpw119","6ApVrW1k","58KlJUfn","kb2WfoX0","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2xsQhKF/3444c295a8953678c08615790deec92ba1c2a3f9_96.webp","https://discord.gg/8PXyRVWFcm",[],[30963],{"url":30964,"raw_url":30964,"featured":439,"title":30965,"description":3571,"created":30966,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2xsQhKF/images/3444c295a8953678c08615790deec92ba1c2a3f9.webp","__mc_server_banner__","2026-03-02T18:09:10.822628Z",16777215,"jyyP6T8h",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":30970,"id":30971,"slug":30972,"project_type":12,"team":30973,"organization":3571,"title":30974,"description":30975,"body":30976,"body_url":3571,"published":30977,"updated":30978,"approved":30979,"queued":30980,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":30981,"downloads":30982,"followers":29995,"categories":30983,"additional_categories":30984,"loaders":30985,"versions":30986,"icon_url":30988,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":30989,"gallery":30990,"color":30995,"thread_id":30996,"monetization_status":30006},[538],"s2avy7mu","battery-destroy","tfcUDmb9","Battery destroy🔋","✨ Experience a whole new way to break blocks! ✨\nWith this unique resource pack, every time you break blocks or stones, a dynamic battery-like effect appears, making each hit visually stunning ⚡. Whether you're mining deep underground or building your epic","✨ Experience a whole new way to break blocks! ✨\nWith this unique resource pack, every time you break blocks or stones, a dynamic battery-like effect appears, making each hit visually stunning ⚡. Whether you're mining deep underground or building your epic creations 🏰, you'll notice how every block reacts with a smooth and realistic breaking animation.\nThis pack isn’t just a simple visual tweak—it transforms the way you interact with your world 🌍. Perfect for players who love detailed effects and want their gameplay to feel more alive and immersive. Every strike, every block, becomes part of a more exciting and interactive experience! 💥![This is the shape of the blocks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f09fa8128509d808d4935b3713e73c5f886de953.gif)","2026-03-21T18:37:10.155962Z","2026-03-21T18:39:22.238263Z","2026-03-22T02:38:37.260784Z","2026-03-21T18:44:29.778205Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},99,[57],[15],[377],[30987],"GZlaYScU","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2avy7mu/f09fa8128509d808d4935b3713e73c5f886de953.gif",[],[30991],{"url":30992,"raw_url":30992,"featured":828,"title":30993,"description":3571,"created":30994,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2avy7mu/images/f09fa8128509d808d4935b3713e73c5f886de953.gif","This is how the blocks are broken.","2026-03-21T18:42:46.263294Z",326908,"XwLIYQ53",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30998,"id":30999,"slug":31000,"project_type":31,"team":31001,"organization":3571,"title":31002,"description":31003,"body":31004,"body_url":3571,"published":31005,"updated":31006,"approved":31007,"queued":31008,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":31009,"downloads":31010,"followers":31011,"categories":31012,"additional_categories":31013,"loaders":31014,"versions":31015,"icon_url":31024,"issues_url":31025,"source_url":31026,"wiki_url":31027,"discord_url":31028,"donation_urls":31029,"gallery":31030,"color":31031,"thread_id":30999,"monetization_status":30006},[1151,1028,1022,863,826,820],"s2w3oC2W","backslotaddon","sla8Fndt","BackSlotAddon","Addon for the BackSlot mod which enables double sword on the players back","[![ServerAtelier](https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png)](https://www.serveratelier.com/)\n\n![Headline](https://i.imgur.com/ro1FnvL.png)\n\n\u003Ccenter>\n\n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?color=7289DA&label=DISCORD&logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\">](https://discord.gg/cV4cJyGXqF) \n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://img.shields.io/website?color=7bc466&label=Globox&style=for-the-badge&up_message=Wiki&url=https://globox1997.github.io/wiki/mods/BackSlotAddon/\">](https://globox1997.github.io/wiki/mods/BackSlotAddon/)\n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Globox1997/BackSlotAddon?color=c4667b&style=for-the-badge\">](https://github.com/Globox1997/BackSlotAddon/issues)\n\u003C/center>\n\n\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0Bn3Mh.png\" alt= “Description” width=\"25%\" height=\"auto\">\n\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr/>\n\nSmall [BackSlot](https://modrinth.com/mod/backslot) mod addon which enables the double back sword when the belt slot and back slot has a sword item equipped.\n\nSince 1.17.1 you can now carry shields on your back.\n\n\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKCuHQL.png\" alt= “Misc” width=\"10%\" height=\"auto\">\n\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr />\n\n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"25%\" height=\"auto\">](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api)\n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7weZ8uu.png\" width=\"25%\" height=\"auto\">](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config)\n\n\n\nThis mod is developed for Fabric.  \nThere are no plans to develop a Forge version. \n\n\nModpack Permission:  \nFeel free to use it in any modpacks.\n\n\nBug Report:  \nJust report bugs at the github page.","2023-04-19T17:42:23.750631Z","2024-12-01T16:10:44.374784Z","2023-04-22T17:40:42.791386Z","2023-04-21T14:04:34.829725Z",{"id":30138,"name":30139,"url":3571},1276755,146,[115],[134],[346],[31016,31017,31018,31019,31020,31021,31022,31023],"id3u4TD1","H6sy0gz7","b6o3cf72","2BcMZWZF","niNVq7Dp","RsX8Db4l","zZBL3cuM","jbFSyXlE","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2w3oC2W/0b214ff16008ce8d82986f1d6c02bb6e49cb045c_96.webp","https://github.com/Globox1997/BackSlotAddon/issues","https://github.com/Globox1997/BackSlotAddon","https://globox1997.github.io/wiki/mods/BackSlotAddon/","https://discord.gg/cV4cJyGXqF",[],[],6310166,{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":31033,"id":31034,"slug":31035,"project_type":12,"team":31036,"organization":3571,"title":31037,"description":31038,"body":31039,"body_url":3571,"published":31040,"updated":31041,"approved":31042,"queued":31043,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":31044,"downloads":31045,"followers":30221,"categories":31046,"additional_categories":31047,"loaders":31048,"versions":31049,"icon_url":31051,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":31052,"gallery":31053,"color":31065,"thread_id":31066,"monetization_status":30006},[484,478,465],"s2hdCnSK","pigblade","HIMYuodT","PigBlade","A simple mod that enhances pigs with new details and features, making them more fun and visually appealing while staying true to the original game style","This resource pack transforms all pigs in the game into true symbols of royalty by adding a crown inspired by Technoblade 👑. It is a simple yet iconic change that gives your world a unique and fun touch without altering the original gameplay.\n\nThe pack is fully vanilla, which means you do not need to install any mods, OptiFine, or additional add-ons. Just download it, activate it in the resource pack menu, and all pigs will instantly appear with their new crowned look.\n\nThe texture has been carefully edited directly onto the original pig model, keeping the classic Minecraft pixel art style so it blends perfectly with the rest of the game. It is also very lightweight and does not affect performance, making it ideal for any computer.\n\nThis project also serves as a small tribute to Technoblade, keeping his legacy alive in a simple but meaningful way 🩸👑.\n\nIf you have ever wanted to see pigs rule the world in style, this pack is for you. Enjoy your new pig kingdom.","2026-04-12T00:14:36.104316Z","2026-04-12T00:16:49.401974Z","2026-04-13T06:37:22.132765Z","2026-04-12T00:18:10.669622Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},39,[],[],[377],[31050],"T7JXlTe4","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2hdCnSK/5b990fa117b36d05b3e933d9ddf57205f97f1ad5.png",[],[31054,31060],{"url":31055,"raw_url":31056,"featured":439,"title":31057,"description":31058,"created":31059,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2hdCnSK/images/2805506fbac473b06be7f4b2a22982afd522b114_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2hdCnSK/images/2805506fbac473b06be7f4b2a22982afd522b114.png","cerdito con corona","pig","2026-04-12T00:17:29.474458Z",{"url":31061,"raw_url":31062,"featured":439,"title":31057,"description":31063,"created":31064,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2hdCnSK/images/92d1b31d8f1e0481f4c86359ac036655ecf0ba70_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2hdCnSK/images/92d1b31d8f1e0481f4c86359ac036655ecf0ba70.png","cerdito","2026-04-12T00:17:55.738285Z",12348524,"e6YiRiow",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31068,"id":31069,"slug":31070,"project_type":31,"team":31071,"organization":3571,"title":31072,"description":31073,"body":31074,"body_url":3571,"published":31075,"updated":31076,"approved":31077,"queued":31078,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":31079,"downloads":31080,"followers":30221,"categories":31081,"additional_categories":31082,"loaders":31083,"versions":31084,"icon_url":31090,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":31091,"donation_urls":31092,"gallery":31093,"color":31094,"thread_id":31095,"monetization_status":30006},[2513,2495,2471,2468,2462,2459,2456,2453,2450,2315,2264,2252,2249,2225,2222,2204,2201,2198,2150,2144,2141,2084,2075,2066,1907,1883,1874,1757,1748,1733,1718,1694,1625,1619,1610,1520,1517,1487,1481,1469,1448,1373,1355,1292,1277,1250,1193,1160,1151,1115,1076,1028,1022,989,947,941,869,863,826,820,772,769,739,691,649,640,634,589,583,538],"s3R8R55B","ironwatch","1zgRORpE","Iron Watch","IronWatch is a modular anti-cheat for Paper servers with ProtocolLib integration, per-player state tracking, and configurable thresholds.","IronWatch is a modular anti-cheat for Paper servers with ProtocolLib integration, per-player state tracking, and configurable thresholds. Designed for low false-positives and easy tuning.\n\nFeatures\n- 55+ detections across Combat, Movement, Player\n- Combat: Aim (A–E), Kill Aura (A–F), Reach (A), Auto Clicker (A–B), Hitbox (stubs)\n- Movement: Speed (A–D), Flight (A–E), Jesus (A), Step (A), VClip (A), Strafe (A), Wall Climb (A), Fast Climb (A), Entity Speed (A)\n- Player: Bad Packets (A–D), No Slow (A), Timer (A–D), Inventory (A–B), Invalid (A–C), Ground Spoof (A–C), Scaffold (A)\n- ProtocolLib packet processing (USE_ENTITY, POSITION, POSITION_LOOK, LOOK, ARM_ANIMATION, CLIENT_COMMAND, BLOCK_DIG/PLACE)\n- Violation decay service to reduce false positives\n- Configurable limits/thresholds via `config.yml`\n\nRequirements\n- Paper 1.20.1+ (Java 17)\n- ProtocolLib 4.8.0 (recommended)\n\nInstallation\n- Place `IronWatch-1.0.0.jar` in your server `plugins/` folder\n- Ensure ProtocolLib is installed\n- Start the server to generate `config.yml`\n- Run `/ironwatch` to view version and loaded detections\n\nConfiguration\n```yaml\nviolation:\n  decay_per_second: 0.5\nchecks:\n  flight:\n    air_time_ms: 1500\n  speed:\n    base_limit: 0.35\n    ice_bonus: 0.15\n    liquid_bonus: 0.25\n```\n\nUsage\n- Command: `/ironwatch` shows plugin version and detection count\n- Tuning: adjust `checks.*` values to your server’s movement/combat balance\n- Logs: violations are logged with player name, check key, and current VL","2025-12-10T12:29:29.406081Z","2026-01-25T20:04:55.042043Z","2025-12-18T00:47:15.217280Z","2025-12-10T19:40:39.063215Z",{"id":29973,"name":29974,"url":3571},201,[134,175,303],[],[329,401,405,417],[31085,31086,31087,31088,31089],"vZawwr2m","VDTJBEhj","HnQJ2d6L","vyclgGgf","lIRT4pZq","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3R8R55B/8e263a6add138b79b5c6fceb45c809a002c815db_96.webp","https://discord.gg/nqEAhpatDe",[],[],1914181,"GoKMximx",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31097,"id":31098,"slug":31099,"project_type":34,"team":31100,"organization":3571,"title":31101,"description":31102,"body":31103,"body_url":3571,"published":31104,"updated":31105,"approved":31106,"queued":31107,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":31108,"downloads":31109,"followers":29995,"categories":31110,"additional_categories":31111,"loaders":31112,"versions":31113,"icon_url":31116,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":31117,"gallery":31118,"color":31119,"thread_id":31120,"monetization_status":30006},[820],"s3TwE3hd","cobblemonsuca","HaIHHk68","CobblemonSUCA","Fun modpack for the cobblemon mod!","# A fun modpack to **boost** the avarage cobblemon experience!\nThis instance includes mods like:\n- **Cobblemon** and a lot of addons\n- QOL mods\n- mods featuring structures\n- some Resource pack to have a better experience!\n- And so much more!\n\nWe would like to point out that this modpack was made for a server up to 4 people and is highly recommended to change the mods config for the best experience!\n## We hope you'll have fun playing this modpack and we wish you a nice adventure with your favorite cobblemon!\n### next updates will feature better improvement in gamplay.","2025-07-24T11:21:13.154618Z","2025-07-25T13:16:16.980135Z","2025-07-27T23:41:37.127321Z","2025-07-27T20:46:02.250252Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},73,[30,200,240],[69],[346],[31114,31115],"an8F20lt","rZ7X35Qf","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3TwE3hd/5784d58ce9275a7fa70633009f60e71c125e8f14_96.webp",[],[],4272679,"plJdUAzW",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31122,"id":31123,"slug":31124,"project_type":31,"team":31125,"organization":3571,"title":31126,"description":31127,"body":31128,"body_url":3571,"published":31129,"updated":31130,"approved":31131,"queued":31132,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":31133,"downloads":31134,"followers":29976,"categories":31135,"additional_categories":31136,"loaders":31137,"versions":31138,"icon_url":31140,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":31141,"gallery":31142,"color":31171,"thread_id":31172,"monetization_status":30006},[1022],"s3PpKuta","vruys-sussy-hard-insects","NzYVFxp8","Vruys Sussy Hard Insects","This mod adds a bunch of insects and a boss to make the game more challenging.","This mod adds hostile ants and flies that come in many variations. This mod was created by asdf TacoMaster and Vruys for our Ohiocraft survival world/modpack. Made using MCreator.\n\nTo enjoy the mod to the fullest, we recommend playing with hitboxes turned off!\n\n## Overworld Mobs\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n  \n**Ant**: Basic ant. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. \n  \n![Ant](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dcb9e1f9305a980b7c6683c37fa1a6e4a312685f.png)\n\n**Fly**: Basic fly. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. It can fly.\n\n![Fly](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bcd6b820138315fe0dea3e942ec64901d7f51b1a.png)\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n## Nether Mobs\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\n**Wastes Fire Ant**: Advanced ant. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Nether Wastes biome.\n\n**Crimson Fire Ant**: Advanced ant. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Crimson Forests.\n\n**Warped Fire Ant**: Advanced ant. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Warped Forests.\n\n**Basalt Fire Ant**: Advanced ant. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Basalt Deltas.\n\n**Soul Fire Ant**: Advanced ant. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Soul Sand Valley.\n\n**Firefly**: Advanced fly. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Nether Wastes biome.\n\n**Crimson Firefly**: Advanced fly. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Crimson Forests.\n\n**Warped Firefly**: Advanced fly. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Warped Forests.\n\n**Basalt Firefly**: Advanced fly. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Basalt Deltas.\n\n**Soul Firefly**: Advanced fly. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Inflicts blindness, darkness and super speed when attacking the player. Spawns in the Soul Sand Valley.\n\nThe fire ants and the fireflies have adapted to their surroundings, making them difficult to spot.\n\n![Fire Ant](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ceadc86f2e2e3f19ceaa5a455f9926713d1b60a2.png)\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n## End Mobs\n\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\n**Endermant**: Advanced ant. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Attacks have higher knockback compared to normal ants.\n\n**Dragonfly**: Advanced fly. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Attacks have higher knockback compared to normal ants.\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n## Mobs that spawn in all dimensions\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\n**Nightmare**: Extremely speedy ant. Has 100 health, and deals 1 damage. Truly the speedrunner of all time.\n\n**Infected Ant**: Ranged ant. Has 100 health, and fires a projectile that inflicts slowness, weakness, poison and nausea.\n\n**Infected Fly**: Ranged fly. Has 100 health, and fires a projectile that inflicts slowness, weakness, poison and nausea.\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n## New Weapon and Drops\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\nEach of the naturally spawning ants drop a different \"Shard\". (Except for Crimson and Warped ants. They have the same drop). You can craft all 8 shards together to create the \"Ant Piece\".\n\nSimilarly, each of the naturally spawning flies drop a different \"Fragment\". (Except for Crimson and Warped flies. They have the same drop). You can craft all 8 fragments together to create the \"Fly Piece\".\n\nIf you craft the Ant Piece and the Fly Piece together with a stick, you can create the ultimate weapon: fly swatter. This weapon comes with Bane of Arthropods 20 when crafted, making it an effective weapon against the new threats.\n\n![Fly Swatter Recipe](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/51541ab4ec54a1715219df078a3d73298eb7a5ce.png)\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n## Boss Fight\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\nThe infested garbage bin is a new structure. A mysterious button is located in the middle, which summons the new boss when you interact with it.\n\n![The Infested Garbage Bin](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6c3a0fd6485838bb233f5eb39cf3812f70539b2b.png)\n\n**Ant Tank Boss**: Has 600 health. Unlike the other mobs in this mod, it is not affected by Bane of Arthropods, because the tank is not an insect. It comes with four attacks.\n\n![Ant Tank Boss](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb74e9e6f824418abfc65ceb2dcbd26a3ec73e08.png)\n\nIf you successfully defeat the Ant Tank Boss, you'll be rewarded with a trophy and your very own Rideable Tank!!!\n\n\u003C/details>","2024-04-16T12:12:11.054976Z","2024-04-16T12:13:38.239165Z","2024-04-19T05:02:46.349242Z","2024-04-16T12:36:17.788295Z",{"id":29973,"name":29974,"url":3571},170,[191],[93,115],[354],[31139],"Ltak6JSd","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PpKuta/1883b9ab7d55d0618460c54a7b7db17d41ea7e66_96.webp",[],[31143,31147,31151,31156,31160,31165],{"url":31144,"raw_url":31144,"featured":439,"title":31145,"description":3571,"created":31146,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PpKuta/images/dcb9e1f9305a980b7c6683c37fa1a6e4a312685f.png","Ant","2024-04-16T12:26:46.801004Z",{"url":31148,"raw_url":31148,"featured":439,"title":31149,"description":3571,"created":31150,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PpKuta/images/bcd6b820138315fe0dea3e942ec64901d7f51b1a.png","Fly","2024-04-16T12:27:59.423827Z",{"url":31152,"raw_url":31152,"featured":439,"title":31153,"description":31154,"created":31155,"ordering":30273},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PpKuta/images/ceadc86f2e2e3f19ceaa5a455f9926713d1b60a2.png","Fire Ant","Nether Wastes variant. It is camouflaged with the netherrack.","2024-04-16T12:27:48.940716Z",{"url":31157,"raw_url":31157,"featured":439,"title":31158,"description":3571,"created":31159,"ordering":30928},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PpKuta/images/51541ab4ec54a1715219df078a3d73298eb7a5ce.png","Fly Swatter Recipe","2024-04-16T12:28:13.432099Z",{"url":31161,"raw_url":31162,"featured":439,"title":31163,"description":3571,"created":31164,"ordering":30250},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PpKuta/images/6c3a0fd6485838bb233f5eb39cf3812f70539b2b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PpKuta/images/6c3a0fd6485838bb233f5eb39cf3812f70539b2b.png","The Infested Garbage Bin","2024-04-16T12:28:41.278454Z",{"url":31166,"raw_url":31167,"featured":828,"title":31168,"description":3571,"created":31169,"ordering":31170},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PpKuta/images/141f294253e9afd532d8f795c80e17790eaf5924_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3PpKuta/images/eb74e9e6f824418abfc65ceb2dcbd26a3ec73e08.png","Ant Tank Boss","2024-04-16T12:26:34.399207Z",6,3886632,"1j8w0Xfi",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":31174,"id":31175,"slug":31176,"project_type":12,"team":31177,"organization":3571,"title":31178,"description":31179,"body":31180,"body_url":3571,"published":31181,"updated":31182,"approved":31183,"queued":31184,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":31185,"downloads":31186,"followers":29995,"categories":31187,"additional_categories":31188,"loaders":31189,"versions":31190,"icon_url":31192,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":31193,"donation_urls":31194,"gallery":31195,"color":31216,"thread_id":31217,"monetization_status":30006},[538],"s348Xv60","apfels-hats","gsaWGX9h","Apfels Hats","A simple Resource pack that adds Hats that can be accessed by naming a Carved Pumpkin in an Anvil","keep in mind that this is my first ever RELEASED resource pack\nHats list:\n- 3D Glassses Anvil name: 3D Glasses\n- Chicken Hat Anvil name: Chicken Hat\n\nIm the only person working on this Resource Pack so it will take a bit for more Hats to come. But when they do i will release a new version for it:)","2026-01-11T11:22:33.264202Z","2026-01-11T11:37:14.613402Z","2026-01-22T04:29:04.016544Z","2026-01-18T15:01:10.840524Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},35,[100,148,268],[15,197],[377],[31191],"XxYonkoz","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s348Xv60/061763ded2fe6a4bf2ca279c348aa322d75c5ef7_96.webp","https://discord.gg/hYZEuAe",[],[31196,31201,31206,31211],{"url":31197,"raw_url":31198,"featured":439,"title":31199,"description":3571,"created":31200,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s348Xv60/images/2c7b488c75517caf0d8e34f502738b4b00c6c99d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s348Xv60/images/2c7b488c75517caf0d8e34f502738b4b00c6c99d.png","Chicken Hat on the ground","2026-01-11T11:41:44.984461Z",{"url":31202,"raw_url":31203,"featured":828,"title":31204,"description":3571,"created":31205,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s348Xv60/images/71aedc761265cd77a5055639ec99105cdb01f698_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s348Xv60/images/71aedc761265cd77a5055639ec99105cdb01f698.png","Chicken Hat","2026-01-11T11:40:35.121635Z",{"url":31207,"raw_url":31208,"featured":439,"title":31209,"description":3571,"created":31210,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s348Xv60/images/b7f7c73b492f1cbfa3f073c89af202dfb008634f_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s348Xv60/images/b7f7c73b492f1cbfa3f073c89af202dfb008634f.png","3D Glasses on the ground","2026-01-11T11:42:23.063020Z",{"url":31212,"raw_url":31213,"featured":439,"title":31214,"description":3571,"created":31215,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s348Xv60/images/c60b54065d8c05c88799cb7b5d4d9ccf27d3339b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s348Xv60/images/c60b54065d8c05c88799cb7b5d4d9ccf27d3339b.png","3D Glasses","2026-01-11T11:42:07.021600Z",14917448,"l1VGYQQN",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31219,"id":31220,"slug":31221,"project_type":31,"team":31222,"organization":3571,"title":31223,"description":31224,"body":31225,"body_url":3571,"published":31226,"updated":31227,"approved":31228,"queued":31229,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":31230,"downloads":31231,"followers":31232,"categories":31233,"additional_categories":31234,"loaders":31235,"versions":31236,"icon_url":31248,"issues_url":31249,"source_url":31250,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":31251,"donation_urls":31252,"gallery":31253,"color":31264,"thread_id":31220,"monetization_status":30006},[1610,1469,1448,1355,1277,1250,1151,1022],"s2OXJvtB","finally-farmable-dyes","ozpXrW0v","Finally Farmable Dyes","Grow vanilla flowers that produce essential dyes as crops.","\u003Cp>&nbsp;Requires \u003Cstrong>FORGE\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>The following flowers can now be crafted into seeds and grown as crops:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Lily of the Valley\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Orange Tulip\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Allium\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Blue Orchid\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Dandelion\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Pink Tulip\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>White Tulip\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Cornflower\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Poppy\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Wither Rose\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Azure Bluet\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Oxeye Daisy\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Red Tulip\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Fully grown crops drop 1-4 flowers on harvest.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Now all dyes can be either directly farmed or crafted from those that can be.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\u003Cstrong>FAQ\u003C/strong>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Q: Forge?\u003Cbr />A: Forge.\u003Cbr />\u003Cbr />Q: Can I include your mod in a video?\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>A: As long as you include a link to the mod/modpack (if it happens to be in one), absolutely\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Cp>If anyone wants an easier way to chat or ask questions here's a Discord link: \u003Ca href=\"https://discord.gg/sKwS3c62uM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://discord.gg/sKwS3c62uM\u003C/a>\u003C/p>","2023-04-08T08:14:57.755320Z","2024-03-21T12:05:41.121183Z","2023-04-09T05:23:43.419915Z","2023-04-08T09:11:20.344107Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},8801,13,[100],[],[354,385],[31237,31238,31239,31240,31241,31242,31243,31244,31245,31246,31247],"JfezDLea","ZTf1UfTA","IPO422ki","xQ1fScxp","Gi3yJVXo","XczkvHUp","HVOZwhka","DHu5NpHI","musCkbQF","3BNUVCQ1","ggUKX26E","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OXJvtB/a54d9c65cda04d7629e68eeef4ee2ed02fba499c_96.webp","https://github.com/Unixkitty/finallyfarmabledyes/issues","https://github.com/Unixkitty/finallyfarmabledyes","https://discord.unixkitty.com/",[],[31254,31259],{"url":31255,"raw_url":31256,"featured":828,"title":31257,"description":3571,"created":31258,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OXJvtB/images/9f3b4373d326b20063b8cf1fed0331b09dfcaf47_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OXJvtB/images/0845b768633be157531fcbabf2126f14721210f8.png","Farming","2023-04-08T09:02:25.982017Z",{"url":31260,"raw_url":31261,"featured":439,"title":31262,"description":3571,"created":31263,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OXJvtB/images/fcc7adbb024b9f73e19df60dc6e9b9afe8e0f952_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2OXJvtB/images/fcc7adbb024b9f73e19df60dc6e9b9afe8e0f952.png","Seed crafting","2023-04-08T09:02:00.421966Z",3359588,{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31266,"id":31267,"slug":31268,"project_type":31,"team":31269,"organization":3571,"title":31270,"description":31271,"body":31272,"body_url":3571,"published":31273,"updated":31274,"approved":31275,"queued":31276,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":31277,"downloads":31278,"followers":29976,"categories":31279,"additional_categories":31280,"loaders":31281,"versions":31282,"icon_url":31286,"issues_url":31287,"source_url":31288,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":31289,"gallery":31290,"color":31291,"thread_id":31292,"monetization_status":30006},[2615],"s2Pjx1e7","linearxp-legacy","5Hy2FJfq","LinearXP","Changes the bad RPG-style exponential XP curve to a configurable linear one.","![Gaining XP to showcase linear levels.](https://i.imgur.com/HvGkLR9.gif)\n\u003Cbr>\nAn independent mod for 1.7.10 that changes the bad RPG style exponential XP curve to a configurable linear one. It was made due to a lack of any existing mod that performs similar functions for sub-1.8 [because of the limitations in Forge's event hooking](https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/modification-development/2598616-changing-the-exp-required-to-level-up).\n\nSource code is on GitHub, and any issues should be reported there. Feel free to include it in any modpack =)","2025-03-16T18:11:46.603537Z","2025-03-16T19:58:14.301632Z","2025-03-24T19:30:13.544198Z","2025-03-20T12:30:46.723568Z",{"id":30867,"name":30868,"url":3571},852,[134],[],[354],[31283,31284,31285],"RdmwYNEA","38SDkOXQ","T9iVAzmX","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2Pjx1e7/4852c8d9d8715b037945ef4eb7ad9dd5c5f0c439.webp","https://github.com/hi-skittles/LinearXP-1.7/issues","https://github.com/hi-skittles/LinearXP-1.7",[],[],311556,"q8sTjybX",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31294,"id":31295,"slug":31296,"project_type":31,"team":31297,"organization":3571,"title":31298,"description":31299,"body":31300,"body_url":3571,"published":31301,"updated":31302,"approved":31303,"queued":31304,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":31305,"downloads":31306,"followers":31307,"categories":31308,"additional_categories":31309,"loaders":31310,"versions":31311,"icon_url":31333,"issues_url":31334,"source_url":31335,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":31336,"donation_urls":31337,"gallery":31342,"color":31348,"thread_id":31295,"monetization_status":30006},[2222,2198,2141,2084,2075,2066,1874,1277,1250,1151,1115,1028,1022,826,739],"s3lgCbLg","simple-quarry","Qhj3bjne","Simple Quarry","Adding simple quarry to mine area of blocks.","\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>This mod requires&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hammer-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=247401\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;HammerLib\u003C/a>.\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Ch5>\u003Cstrong>Simple Quarry\u003C/strong> adds:\u003C/h5>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Fueled Quarry\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Powered Quarry\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>WARNING: Don't place 2+ quarries in 1 chunk, they are going to explode!\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>How Fueled Quarry works:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>It uses any fuel to mine.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>1 Coal (or Charcoal) can mine 96 blocks.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Quarry mines only 1 chunk.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>No Upgrades can be applied.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>How Powered Quarry works:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>It uses either RF or fuel to operate.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Provide \u003Cstrong>at least\u003C/strong> 200 RF/tick&nbsp;for it to work.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Powered quarry also mines only 1 chunk.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Can hold up to 5 Upgrades\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>Both Quarrys will output the collected item into an adjacent inventory (i.e. Chest).\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Otherwise they will be dropped on the ground.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Quarry Recipes\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"spoiler\">\n\u003Cp>Fueled Quarry recipe:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/31iieit.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"154\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Default Powered Quarry recipe:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/rUPL2VU.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"155\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Easy Powered Quarry recipe:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/mlXkhli.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"0\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Use the \u003Cstrong>config file\u003C/strong> to choose between the recipes.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Quarry GUIs\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"spoiler\">\n\u003Cp>Fueled Quarry GUI\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/GUFIWoN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"302\" />&nbsp;\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/G7uH2U1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"251\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Powered Quarry GUI\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/VhNg4rk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"300\" />&nbsp;\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/QAm7o3O.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"256\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Upgrades\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"spoiler\">\n\u003Cp>With Version \"9r\" we implemented a new Upgrade System for the Powered Quarry!\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/ZrgATHw.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/ztCFTOo.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"401\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/nAQjpcK.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"391\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/xjnYR3N.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"403\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/oIPdx4t.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"374\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/5KQq2sc.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"380\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/5rIXXHD.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"898\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://imgur.com/ZoBXibV.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"890\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch5>\u003Cstrong>Special thanks:\u003C/strong>\u003C/h5>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli style=\"text-align: left;\">\u003Cstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Ircmaan\">\u003Cimg src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/Ircmaan/avatar\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;Ircmaan\u003C/a>&nbsp;\u003C/strong>for the idea and motivation.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"text-align: left;\">\u003Ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/EndermanWhoSearchTheBeast\">\u003Cstrong>\u003Cimg src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/EndermanWhoSearchTheBeast/avatar\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp; EndermanWhoSearchTheBeast\u003C/strong>\u003C/a> for the sprites.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" />\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp style=\"text-align: left;\">\u003Cstrong>Permissions:\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\u003Cli style=\"text-align: left;\">\u003Cstrong>You&nbsp;can use this mod in your modpack.\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"text-align: left;\">\u003Cstrong>You are not allowed to re-publish this mod to other sites without providing a CurseForge download link and my permission (PM to \u003Ca href=\"https://me.zeith.gay/\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://dccg.herokuapp.com/discord/fetchAvatar/376091478142746625\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;Zeitheron\u003C/a>, or via Discord)\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli style=\"text-align: left;\">\u003Cstrong>You are not allowed to include this (or any other mods of DragonForge team) in your own mod. Building addons, however, is allowed, but a friendly PM would be good.\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Note:\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>The only supported version of minecraft is the latest one that this mod exists for. DO NOT ASK TO DOWNGRADE!\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\">\u003Ca class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"https://ds.zeith.org/dev\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\" />\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\">\u003Cstrong>Want to discuss anything? Need help with APIs?\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\">\u003Cstrong>Join the discord server and follow Zeitheron on \u003Ca href=\"http://bit.ly/ZeithTwitter\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />Twitter\u003C/a>!\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\">\u003Cstrong>If you would like to support my work, you can become a patron via \u003Ca href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Patreon\u003C/a>.\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>","2023-05-16T13:46:05.211248Z","2025-03-05T06:19:11.412148Z","2023-05-18T21:13:54.621869Z","2023-05-16T13:55:31.963748Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},10674,12,[288,303],[],[354,385],[31312,31313,31314,