ts","Z9C9cLK4","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2jDv8d4/18a91bed6d0c55811704413f1f9a4cfcbbe4e4bb.png",[],[31990,31993,31997,32001],{"url":31991,"raw_url":31991,"featured":439,"title":31346,"description":3571,"created":31992,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2jDv8d4/images/18a91bed6d0c55811704413f1f9a4cfcbbe4e4bb.png","2026-04-21T09:27:32.393715Z",{"url":31994,"raw_url":31994,"featured":439,"title":31995,"description":3571,"created":31996,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2jDv8d4/images/bd1fbc05e584152a7b7a76c7123b15ed28ce92fd.png","Showcase with Unique Dark","2026-04-21T09:53:59.957144Z",{"url":31998,"raw_url":31998,"featured":828,"title":31999,"description":3571,"created":32000,"ordering":30273},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2jDv8d4/images/d081f18634b0e15ae72df8ef5092f81947036023.png","Modded","2026-04-21T09:54:05.261140Z",{"url":32002,"raw_url":32003,"featured":439,"title":32004,"description":3571,"created":32005,"ordering":30928},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2jDv8d4/images/63395853b869867151c839686113dbf562202f31_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2jDv8d4/images/63395853b869867151c839686113dbf562202f31.png","Others","2026-04-21T09:55:13.265188Z",1315860,"HFEEQysf",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":32009,"id":32010,"slug":32011,"project_type":31,"team":32012,"organization":3571,"title":32013,"description":32014,"body":32015,"body_url":3571,"published":32016,"updated":32017,"approved":32018,"queued":32019,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32020,"downloads":32021,"followers":29995,"categories":32022,"additional_categories":32023,"loaders":32024,"versions":32025,"icon_url":32027,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":32028,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32029,"gallery":32030,"color":32031,"thread_id":32032,"monetization_status":30006},[1448],"s3WXQrmg","nohurtcamforge","2863bV6Y","NoHurtCamForge","This mod removes camera shake when the player takes damage. \nЭтот мод убирает тряску камеры при получении урона.","# EN\n## NoHurtCam\nRemoves camera shake when taking damage.\n\nLightweight client-side mod. No more screen wobble — just smooth gameplay.\n\nFeatures:\n\n✅ No camera shake on hit\n\n✅ Forge 1.16.5\n\n### Author: command8913\nGitHub: https://github.com/command8913/NoHurtCum-Forge\n\n# RU\n## NoHurtCam\nУбирает тряску камеры при получении урона.\n\nЛёгкий клиентский мод. Никакого дрожания экрана — только плавная игра.\n\nОсобенности:\n\n✅ Нет тряски при ударе\n\n✅ Forge 1.16.5\n\n### Автор: command8913\nGitHub: https://github.com/command8913/NoHurtCum-Forge","2026-05-12T22:03:29.779654Z","2026-05-12T22:05:47.613317Z","2026-05-16T22:30:27.217859Z","2026-05-12T22:13:10.322136Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},95,[115,211,303],[134],[354],[32026],"6zcrolli","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3WXQrmg/e33d44e454ffc44c433aa996f87a97b784c4658c.png","https://github.com/command8913/NoHurtCam-Forge",[],[],986895,"mPFh8EVw",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":32034,"id":32035,"slug":32036,"project_type":12,"team":32037,"organization":3571,"title":32038,"description":32039,"body":32040,"body_url":3571,"published":32041,"updated":32042,"approved":32043,"queued":32044,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32045,"downloads":32047,"followers":29995,"categories":32048,"additional_categories":32049,"loaders":32050,"versions":32051,"icon_url":32055,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32056,"gallery":32057,"color":32085,"thread_id":32086,"monetization_status":30006},[589,583,538],"s3MqdfLx","osmium-resourcepack","gslVIMJR","Osmium Resourcepack","Dark red PvP resource pack for Minecraft 1.21.11 with a clean Crystal PvP style and custom GUI based on PvP Zegarn by the original creator.","# 📦 Osmium Red Resource Pack\n\nOsmium Red is a dark red PvP resource pack for Minecraft Java Edition 1.21.11, designed for Crystal PvP and competitive gameplay. The pack combines a modern black/red aesthetic with clean textures, smooth GUI elements, and optimized visuals to create a stylish but practical PvP experience.\n\nThe goal of this pack is to keep Minecraft looking dark, clean, and aggressive without ruining visibility during fights. Many textures were redesigned to fit a premium PvP style inspired by modern clients and competitive Crystal PvP packs.\n\n## ✨ Features\n\n* Dark red & black themed textures\n* Custom PvP GUI\n* Clean hotbar & inventory\n* Crystal PvP styled items\n* Smooth crosshair & HUD\n* Better visibility during combat\n* Optimized for fast gameplay\n* Minimalistic modern design\n* Minecraft 1.21.11 support\n\n## 🎮 Recommended For\n\n* Crystal PvP\n* SMP PvP\n* Lifesteal servers\n* Competitive gameplay\n* Dark themed client setups\n\n## ❤️ Credits\n\nThis resource pack is partially based on / inspired by PvP Zegarn by the original creator.\n\n🔗 https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/pvp-zegarn\n\nPlease support the original creator.\n\n## ⚠ Important\n\n* Made for Minecraft Java Edition 1.21.11\n* Best used with PvP clients\n* Some textures may be modified or inspired by existing PvP packs\n* Do not redistribute without permission\n","2026-05-19T14:21:47.443518Z","2026-05-22T14:14:55.405730Z","2026-05-26T02:09:57.956632Z","2026-05-22T09:28:25.558570Z",{"id":30925,"name":30926,"url":32046},"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",36,[77,139,194],[15,57,115,148,292],[377],[32052,32053,32054],"2ugq2Zgl","oxlTaaeM","aXKwXCqT","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3MqdfLx/bc55ca0fb9e3f7e3d55b21ac8b8c1f4d47ea8951_96.webp",[],[32058,32064,32070,32075,32081],{"url":32059,"raw_url":32060,"featured":828,"title":32061,"description":32062,"created":32063,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3MqdfLx/images/7bd2cc26872d75432d645e6c08475fa6a4eef24f_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3MqdfLx/images/7bd2cc26872d75432d645e6c08475fa6a4eef24f.png","Main Menu","Custom dark red main menu and GUI design featured in Osmium Red for Minecraft 1.21.11.","2026-05-27T17:49:16.784654Z",{"url":32065,"raw_url":32066,"featured":439,"title":32067,"description":32068,"created":32069,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3MqdfLx/images/942a30003b189e1740ceb9f19476a645117f338a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3MqdfLx/images/942a30003b189e1740ceb9f19476a645117f338a.png","PvP Showcase","Showcase of the dark red PvP textures and custom GUI included in Osmium Red.","2026-05-19T14:50:34.169726Z",{"url":32071,"raw_url":32071,"featured":439,"title":32072,"description":32073,"created":32074,"ordering":30273},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3MqdfLx/images/1e35a4735b48fb4f576274ed74ba3cc88ecd2ea2.png","Custom Inventory GUI","Preview of the custom dark themed inventory and GUI textures included in Osmium Red.","2026-05-19T14:54:03.918068Z",{"url":32076,"raw_url":32077,"featured":439,"title":32078,"description":32079,"created":32080,"ordering":30928},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3MqdfLx/images/419068d0d6adce1fd19db53176efd3bec293ace1_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3MqdfLx/images/419068d0d6adce1fd19db53176efd3bec293ace1.png","Totem Showcase","Custom dark red Totem of Undying from Osmium Red.\n","2026-05-19T15:18:45.514164Z",{"url":32082,"raw_url":32082,"featured":439,"title":32083,"description":32079,"created":32084,"ordering":31170},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3MqdfLx/images/37a4dee9f1164f794adce3ad87480fb201076ab4.png","Totem Showcase 2","2026-05-19T15:19:08.960704Z",1774608,"56jFxToC",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32088,"id":32089,"slug":32090,"project_type":34,"team":32091,"organization":3571,"title":32092,"description":32093,"body":32094,"body_url":3571,"published":32095,"updated":32096,"approved":32097,"queued":32098,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32099,"downloads":32100,"followers":30221,"categories":32101,"additional_categories":32102,"loaders":32103,"versions":32104,"icon_url":32112,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":32113,"donation_urls":32114,"gallery":32115,"color":30967,"thread_id":32134,"monetization_status":30006},[1022],"s2SLlIRA","mineblabla","EMPJiU8y","MineBlaBla","Modpack originally made for the Bla Bla Community server, an adventure/farming focused pack with some building.","Whether you're planting your first crops, raising animals, exploring ancient ruins, or cooking a feast for your crew, this pack offers everything you need to build a beautiful, immersive, and rewarding Minecraft experience. Explore the world of Minecraft 1.20.1 with a modpack designed just for survival players seeking a fluid and streamlined experience. This modpack has been carefully curated to retain the challenging nature of survival, while also adding modules focused on performance optimization, ensuring smooth gameplay even in the most stressful scenarios. Immerse yourself in thrilling adventures without fear of lag, and experience how survival can be even more rewarding in a world that responds promptly to your orders.\n\nThis isn’t a typical tech-focused modpack.\nHere, life is slower.\nMore rewarding.\nMore grounded.\n\nThis modpack is designed for players who wish to participate in the Brazilian server \"Bla Bla.\" With a variety of optimizations and customizations configured by default, it aims to make it easier for new players to join the server.\n\nWho should use this modpack? While everyone is welcome to use and suggest changes or additions to the modpack, it will always focus on improving the experience for players on the specific server it was created for. Although it works perfectly well in singleplayer mode, some options may have been disabled to optimize the multiplayer experience, making it less ideal for solo play.\n\nThe modpack is officially maintained and updated by the in-game server moderators, with all updates and changes announced on the appropriate Discord channels as well as in changelogs on platforms like Modrinth.\n\nSit back and Relax!","2025-08-12T04:31:37.428651Z","2025-09-17T05:02:17.087674Z","2025-08-26T17:07:46.554538Z","2025-08-18T05:20:25.532063Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},261,[30,153,200],[],[354],[32105,32106,32107,32108,32109,32110,32111],"sgL4RRhP","bw3avlwf","m4eUtU8y","N1zG5ZWp","mN5ammT2","R8xbhbRb","gsYHaStu","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2SLlIRA/177ac7389271b6e45e577592e3379700a8691829_96.webp","https://discord.gg/RxdcBWT2",[],[32116,32122,32128],{"url":32117,"raw_url":32118,"featured":439,"title":32119,"description":32120,"created":32121,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2SLlIRA/images/1490478da12c025791ecfd8680d9898545903083_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2SLlIRA/images/1490478da12c025791ecfd8680d9898545903083.jpeg","Criadores","Os grandes criadores deste mundo.","2025-08-12T04:46:09.329595Z",{"url":32123,"raw_url":32124,"featured":828,"title":32125,"description":32126,"created":32127,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2SLlIRA/images/1d0247eae04f51c2d0a1028b797c05ebd232e8ad_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2SLlIRA/images/1d0247eae04f51c2d0a1028b797c05ebd232e8ad.jpeg","Sente e Relaxe","Aproveite esse imenso mundo de exploração","2025-08-12T04:48:22.242591Z",{"url":32129,"raw_url":32130,"featured":439,"title":32131,"description":32132,"created":32133,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2SLlIRA/images/7dd7e5b01b6f1c715fba415a480237af91487a74_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2SLlIRA/images/7dd7e5b01b6f1c715fba415a480237af91487a74.jpeg","ADM's","Os clássicos ai","2025-08-12T04:41:50.264872Z","wLVlUirG",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32136,"id":32137,"slug":32138,"project_type":31,"team":32139,"organization":3571,"title":32140,"description":32141,"body":32142,"body_url":3571,"published":32143,"updated":32144,"approved":32145,"queued":32146,"status":29948,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32147,"downloads":32149,"followers":32150,"categories":32151,"additional_categories":32152,"loaders":32153,"versions":32154,"icon_url":32164,"issues_url":32165,"source_url":32166,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32167,"gallery":32168,"color":32172,"thread_id":32173,"monetization_status":30006},[1028,1022,989,947,941,826,820,772,769,739,691,649,640,583,538],"s2iyYw92","potionmod","h4x8TIzG","Potion Mod","PotionMod adds new potions to minecraft using vanilla effects.","## \u003Cp align=\"center\">Potion Mod\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Cp align=\"center\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.modrinth.com%2Fv2%2Fproject%2Fpotionmod&query=downloads&style=flat-square&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=downloads&labelColor=0a0a0a&color=0a0a0a\" alt=\"\">\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp align=\"center\">PotionMod is a Fabric mod for Minecraft that adds new potions using vanilla effects.\u003C/p>\n\n## Support for versions \u003C1.20?\nSupport for versions below 1.20 will likely not be released.\n\n## Features [EN]\n\nRealized potions:\n\n* Blindness potion\n* Darkness potion\n* Mining Fatigue potion\n* Luck potion\n* Unluck potion\n* Haste potion\n* Hero of Village potion\n\nAlso added custom recipes for each potion.\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Recipes\u003C/summary>\n  \n- Flint + Awkward Potion -> Blindness Potion\n  \n- Crying Obsidian + Awkward Potion -> Mining Fatigue potion\n\n- Sculk Shrieker + Awkward Potion -> Darkness Potion\n\n- Obsidian + Awkward Potion -> Haste Potion\n\n- Blue Orchid + Thick Potion -> Luck Potion\n\n- Wither Rose + Thick Potion -> Unluck Potion\n\n- Totem of Undying + Thick Potion -> Hero of Village Potion\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Languages\u003C/summary>\n\n- English\n\n- Russian\n\n- [Suggest translation](https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod/issues/1)\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n\n## Installation\n\n1. **Install Fabric**:\n    - Download and install the [Fabric Installer](https://fabricmc.net/use/).\n    - Run the installer and select your current version of Minecraft.\n\n2. **Install Fabric API**:\n    - Download the latest version of [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) for your Minecraft version and place it in your Minecraft mods folder.\n\n3. **Download PotionMod**:\n    - Download the latest release of PotionMod from the [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/potionmod/versions).\n    - Place the downloaded .jar file into your Minecraft mods folder.\n\n## License\nThis project is licensed under the MIT License - see the [LICENSE](https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod/blob/main/LICENSE) file for details.\n\nYou can view the entire source code on my [GitHub](https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod)\n\nDeveloper: Fantikk ([Fantoooc](https://github.com/Fantoooc))\n\n## Support\nFor support or issues, please open an issue on the [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod/issues) page.\n\n---\n\n## Поддержка версий \u003C1.20?\nДобавление поддержки для версий ниже 1.20 не планируется.\n\n## Функции [RU]\n\nДобавляемые зелья:\n\n* Зелье Слепоты\n* Зелье Тьмы\n* Зелье Утомления\n* Зелье Удачи\n* Зелье Неудачи\n* Зелье Спешки\n* Зелье Героя Деревни\n\nТакже были добавлены кастомные рецепты для каждого зелья.\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Рецепты\u003C/summary>\n  \n- Кремень + Мутное Зелье -> Зелье Слепоты\n  \n- Плачущий Обсидиан + Мутное Зелье -> Зелье Утомления\n\n- Скалк Крикун + Мутное Зелье -> Зелье Тьмы\n\n- Обсидиан + Мутное Зелье -> Зелье Спешки\n\n- Синяя Орхидея + Густое Зелье -> Зелье Удачи\n\n- Роза Визера + Густое Зелье -> Зелье Неудачи\n\n- Тотем Бессмертия + Густое Зелье -> Зелье Героя Деревни\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Языки\u003C/summary>\n\n- English\n\n- Русский\n\n- [Предложить Перевод](https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod/issues/1)\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n\n## Установка\n\n1. **Установка Fabric**:\n    - Скачайте и установите [Установщик Fabric](https://fabricmc.net/use/).\n    - Запустите установщик и выберите вашу версию Minecraft.\n\n2. **Установка Fabric API**:\n    - Скачайте последнюю версию [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) для вашей версии Minecraft и поместите ее в папку модов.\n\n3. **Скачивание PotionMod**:\n    - .Скачайте последнюю версию PotionMod с [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/potionmod/versions) \n    - Переместите скачанный файл мода в папку модов.\n\n## Лицензия\nЭтот проект лицензирован по лицензии MIT -  [LICENSE](https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod/blob/main/LICENSE).\n\nВесь исходный код мода доступен на моем [GitHub](https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod).\n\nРазработчик: Fantikk ([Fantoooc](https://github.com/Fantoooc))\n\n## Поддержка\nЕсли у вас возникли проблемы, создайте обращение на странице [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod/issues).\n\n","2024-08-05T19:21:01.685921Z","2025-12-15T07:02:26.377840Z","2024-08-08T22:27:29.123014Z","2024-08-07T21:33:05.746120Z",{"id":29973,"name":29974,"url":32148},"https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod/blob/main/LICENSE",4429,17,[131,303],[30,134],[346],[32155,32156,32157,32158,32159,32160,32161,32162,32163],"SiIRadsJ","Hf5lP6D8","6P40zT7u","QMQIzvn2","KRC9kseP","a9S2Rtsl","UuNAHIv3","kw1x9Zx5","zOXwbM5y","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2iyYw92/10077eaff136109e3fbb6ad81f271c95fbc1a1a3.gif","https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod/issues","https://github.com/Fantoooc/PotionMod",[],[32169],{"url":32170,"raw_url":32170,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":32171,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2iyYw92/images/d3f579579274796c81c14246dd33c36d1eccfdf4.png","2024-08-05T19:45:50.873467Z",1711389,"Ep3WJw8N",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":32175,"id":32176,"slug":32177,"project_type":12,"team":32178,"organization":3571,"title":32177,"description":32179,"body":32180,"body_url":3571,"published":32181,"updated":32182,"approved":32183,"queued":32184,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32185,"downloads":32186,"followers":30273,"categories":32187,"additional_categories":32188,"loaders":32189,"versions":32190,"icon_url":32193,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32194,"gallery":32195,"color":32214,"thread_id":32176,"monetization_status":30006},[1028,1022,989,947,941],"s3O2LsaZ","beerpack","FsvPVwSB","adds beer in minecraft!","this resource pack adds beer in Minecraft.\n\nnow honey bottle is replaced with glass of beer.","2023-07-23T12:44:32.552502Z","2023-12-30T14:58:54.346987Z","2023-07-27T04:29:47.049113Z","2023-07-25T14:00:21.559206Z",{"id":29973,"name":29974,"url":3571},776,[15,93,148],[],[377],[32191,32192],"I1XblAcg","aqzGz1Ux","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3O2LsaZ/09bc2c7a168e09c2234a311490ed769045cfc58e.png",[],[32196,32200,32206,32210],{"url":32197,"raw_url":32197,"featured":439,"title":32198,"description":3571,"created":32199,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3O2LsaZ/images/4a03976a6da977299bfac10e34dc608ef25bc2ec.png","beer","2023-07-25T14:00:01.209346Z",{"url":32201,"raw_url":32202,"featured":439,"title":32203,"description":32204,"created":32205,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3O2LsaZ/images/7ba595fd3362e8937c126bb4ff796e5b750efa46_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3O2LsaZ/images/7ba595fd3362e8937c126bb4ff796e5b750efa46.png","a glass of beer in the wild","shaders: kappa\nhttps://modrinth.com/shader/kappa-shader","2023-12-30T15:34:23.198311Z",{"url":32207,"raw_url":32208,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":32204,"created":32209,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3O2LsaZ/images/86a18f7626a0f9e9e0e23a1731c85ff8a8ea508a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3O2LsaZ/images/86a18f7626a0f9e9e0e23a1731c85ff8a8ea508a.png","2023-12-30T15:33:08.224550Z",{"url":32211,"raw_url":32211,"featured":439,"title":32212,"description":3571,"created":32213,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3O2LsaZ/images/94cbf9b7002c83d14d194380b3dd4095277d7af3.gif","animated beer","2023-07-25T14:00:18.872539Z",16036948,{"client_side":29959,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32216,"id":32217,"slug":32218,"project_type":31,"team":32219,"organization":3571,"title":32220,"description":32221,"body":32222,"body_url":3571,"published":32223,"updated":32224,"approved":32225,"queued":32226,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32227,"downloads":32228,"followers":29995,"categories":32229,"additional_categories":32230,"loaders":32231,"versions":32232,"icon_url":32234,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32235,"gallery":32236,"color":32265,"thread_id":32266,"monetization_status":30006},[1022],"s2UFBtxL","hmag-recipes-for-nff","S20cux2p","HMAG Recipes For NFF","Adds several crafting recipes for materials from HMAG.","Does what it says in the summary. I threw this together because I wanted to befriend the mobs via NFF:Girls without having to grind a bajillion slime girls (ayo what) just to befriend one.\n\nIt's just a datapack so if you want it to apply to all worlds I recommend [Global Packs](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/globalpacks) by JTK222.","2025-09-26T20:04:29.947809Z","2025-09-27T23:51:44.349747Z","2025-09-27T09:13:51.220554Z","2025-09-26T20:26:15.034025Z",{"id":30564,"name":30565,"url":3571},19,[131,134,303],[],[342],[32233],"oZYeDFg4","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2UFBtxL/d8102292bddd574d2d220a47321ef01e64d9a53c_96.webp",[],[32237,32241,32245,32249,32253,32257,32261],{"url":32238,"raw_url":32238,"featured":439,"title":32239,"description":3571,"created":32240,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2UFBtxL/images/05b097572c0e51ba0fd1c06604467fab775c8c2d.png","Burning Core Recipe","2025-09-26T20:21:27.574568Z",{"url":32242,"raw_url":32242,"featured":439,"title":32243,"description":3571,"created":32244,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2UFBtxL/images/182f93e99dfe17a0a52fb14e8bcb6ec2d492c2a4.png","Ender Plasm Recipe","2025-09-26T20:22:03.230974Z",{"url":32246,"raw_url":32246,"featured":439,"title":32247,"description":3571,"created":32248,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2UFBtxL/images/1a6daa9293d0713be4d3a65e809a7890f39cb4aa.png","Evil Crystal Fragment Recipe","2025-09-27T23:55:28.517428Z",{"url":32250,"raw_url":32250,"featured":828,"title":32251,"description":3571,"created":32252,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2UFBtxL/images/202aff02ed701cc9769007f4a2bc5a53e76d6038.png","Cubic Nucleus Recipe","2025-09-26T20:21:43.047495Z",{"url":32254,"raw_url":32254,"featured":439,"title":32255,"description":3571,"created":32256,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2UFBtxL/images/2eb292cd314ad46c2f0aabf722b7b9adc5fbe346.png","Necrofiber Recipe","2025-09-26T20:22:22.953172Z",{"url":32258,"raw_url":32258,"featured":439,"title":32259,"description":3571,"created":32260,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2UFBtxL/images/8404d472a132c7aba03fb10acfb7fee06c95d0a1.png","Lightning Particle Recipe","2025-09-26T20:22:39.045250Z",{"url":32262,"raw_url":32262,"featured":439,"title":32263,"description":3571,"created":32264,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2UFBtxL/images/a9d87c790768afffc25185dab1031cc86a75c1bf.png","Lich Cloth Recipe","2025-09-26T20:21:53.525845Z",12294039,"U4O2dw0q",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":32268,"id":32269,"slug":32270,"project_type":12,"team":32271,"organization":3571,"title":32272,"description":32273,"body":32274,"body_url":3571,"published":32275,"updated":32276,"approved":32277,"queued":32278,"status":29947,"requested_status":29950,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32279,"downloads":32280,"followers":30073,"categories":32281,"additional_categories":32282,"loaders":32283,"versions":32284,"icon_url":32288,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":32289,"donation_urls":32290,"gallery":32293,"color":32325,"thread_id":32326,"monetization_status":30006},[1028,1022,989,947,941],"s3EyE8ms","vn4s-deep-dark-revamp","m1oXHOLm","VN4's Deep Dark Revamp","This pack completely overhauls Minecraft's Sculk while trying to keep the Vanilla Style.","![Vn4 Presents](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/78f6ab45cfab60dceefdb9b8be5507383e19b622.png)\n![DDR](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/22cb3ed693fa5f2016602e9f7d8fa3c4a9b4af36.png)\n#\nThis pack completely overhauls Minecraft's Sculk while trying to keep the Vanilla Style.\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Includes:\u003C/summary>\n  \n- ### Drastic changes to all sculk blocks.\n  ![Blocks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f0ed960e0a4eb9661e9f916d655db5277811279c.png)\n- ### Several new Warden variants and their respective sub-variants.\n  ![Wardens](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/64b5599b3b4f58f0f6072d1299bb8b2381108f9e.png)\n- ### Emissive textures.\n  ![Emissives](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9eb8e37d968f53c2c2562030df62891e1d0e9ffc.png)\n- ### Deepslate Chests.\n  ![Chests](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3cf0b8e6b2116e85dd8428a184576c2ea00be6b1.png)\n\u003C/details>\n\n![requirements](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6fc9f511dc95fdeb95f153ee45915f317eb37f4e.png)\n\n[![EMF](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb01abc06c2415e8eaea7528fe4f2f38ffbbe509.png)](https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features)\n\n[![ETF](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0d643b3086fd4226afc44b023e7a44d8f14c9b2.png)](https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures)\n\n[![Continuity](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/628b1c3e43fc531666f74a9f26342f542b3beb75.png)](https://modrinth.com/mod/continuity)\n\n# Or alternatively.\n\n# [![Optifine](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fd90adff19b0fed620cc67a3ae581224bddc0422.png)](https://optifine.net/home)\n\n## Load Order for it to work correctly:\n\n# ![Load Order](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab64742864f010cabfc5ec4da5c2f1b6cf03d5d1.png)\n\n[![Discord](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1ef49a78ddbb4f9f10bac901ca1664b9d58bf51.png)](https://discord.gg/pg4MhpU44F)","2024-03-09T15:02:00.024993Z","2024-03-19T18:21:22.571055Z","2024-03-11T07:16:40.466976Z","2024-03-09T16:10:38.745606Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},3770,[15,292,307],[57,110],[377],[32285,32286,32287],"as9rCA6Z","cpzaEpAc","Y1wTt5tM","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/ab9ae515cc32baea93f83f7a69193f42e685a043_96.webp","https://discord.gg/pg4MhpU44F",[32291],{"id":3128,"platform":3129,"url":32292},"https://ko-fi.com/villagern4",[32294,32299,32305,32310,32315,32320],{"url":32295,"raw_url":32296,"featured":828,"title":32297,"description":3571,"created":32298,"ordering":30221},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/9052a68c52953d0e1130031b41a71b087945beca_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/6a7a5aed75afb038845f28864b5c11d039ab939b.png","Title Card","2024-03-10T19:08:47.457954Z",{"url":32300,"raw_url":32301,"featured":439,"title":32302,"description":32303,"created":32304,"ordering":29976},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/a1b304e0841213c49e7dcb65b7ffbb5dfc84f577_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/a1b304e0841213c49e7dcb65b7ffbb5dfc84f577.png","Ancient City","Screenshot taken with the pack on.","2024-03-10T18:45:40.565078Z",{"url":32306,"raw_url":32307,"featured":439,"title":32308,"description":32303,"created":32309,"ordering":30273},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/79b46927775035965ac55c69b0fc57fff26522ca_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/79b46927775035965ac55c69b0fc57fff26522ca.png","Deep Dark","2024-03-10T18:46:03.374385Z",{"url":32311,"raw_url":32312,"featured":439,"title":32313,"description":32303,"created":32314,"ordering":30928},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/36ef9c9e29a14ce582df665116d9c6c5f50ac232_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/36ef9c9e29a14ce582df665116d9c6c5f50ac232.png","An Armored Warden","2024-03-10T18:46:22.417741Z",{"url":32316,"raw_url":32317,"featured":439,"title":32318,"description":32303,"created":32319,"ordering":30250},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/c5f1d552a3767f784b9703204349567b7e16afca_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/c5f1d552a3767f784b9703204349567b7e16afca.png","Full Brightness - A Different Cave","2024-03-11T17:58:45.052340Z",{"url":32321,"raw_url":32322,"featured":439,"title":32323,"description":32303,"created":32324,"ordering":31170},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/53a9c10f77882cd4faa8e860bb864ad07aca3327_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3EyE8ms/images/53a9c10f77882cd4faa8e860bb864ad07aca3327.png","Full Brightness - A Hollowed Warden","2024-03-11T17:59:28.427125Z",593946,"rxeGUxuK",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":32328,"id":32329,"slug":32330,"project_type":34,"team":32331,"organization":3571,"title":32332,"description":32333,"body":32334,"body_url":3571,"published":32335,"updated":32336,"approved":32337,"queued":32338,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32339,"downloads":32340,"followers":29995,"categories":32341,"additional_categories":32342,"loaders":32343,"versions":32344,"icon_url":32346,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32347,"gallery":32348,"color":32349,"thread_id":32350,"monetization_status":30006},[538],"s2ssJFTc","galaxies-mods","mzVcD0UB","Galaxie's Modpack","A comprehensive optimization suite for peak performance, seamlessly integrated with essential competitive PVP mods for an enhanced, latency-reduced experience. Stop lag, win fights.","**Galaxie's Modpack** is a precision-engineered optimization suite designed for players who refuse to compromise on performance. Whether you are playing on a high-end gaming rig or a budget laptop, this pack focuses on maximizing your frame rate (FPS) and minimizing input latency to give you a competitive edge in every fight.\n\n**⚡ Peak Performance**\nWe have integrated the industry-standard optimization mods, including **Sodium, Lithium**, and **FerriteCore**. These mods work together to rewrite Minecraft’s rendering engine and optimize server-side logic, ensuring a buttery-smooth experience even in crowded PVP lobbies or complex environments.\n\n**⚔️ Competitive PVP Features**\nBeyond just speed, this pack includes essential tools for the modern combatant:\n\n- **Enhanced HUD:** Keep track of your armor durability and active status effects without cluttering your screen.\n\n- **Visual Clarity:** Optimized brightness and particle settings to help you track opponents through the chaos.\n \n- **Input Optimization:** Reduced \"ghost swings\" and improved mouse input response for precise hit detection.\n\n**🛠️ Lightweight & Reliable**\nUnlike bulky \"all-in-one\" packs, this modpack stays lightweight. We only include mods that serve a purpose—keeping your game stable, your frames high, and your focus on the win.","2026-05-08T17:41:56.673164Z","2026-05-08T17:45:04.553252Z","2026-05-23T19:54:26.235143Z","2026-05-08T17:46:14.085265Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},11,[77,162,211],[],[346],[32345],"uZLG70PJ","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2ssJFTc/5977591a4b32c09229fce47e90955cf998ecaba3_96.webp",[],[],3942494,"nRinoCCr",{"client_side":29959,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32352,"id":32353,"slug":32354,"project_type":31,"team":32355,"organization":32356,"title":32357,"description":32358,"body":32359,"body_url":3571,"published":32360,"updated":32361,"approved":32362,"queued":32363,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32364,"downloads":32367,"followers":29975,"categories":32368,"additional_categories":32369,"loaders":32370,"versions":32371,"icon_url":32387,"issues_url":32388,"source_url":32389,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":32390,"donation_urls":32391,"gallery":32392,"color":32398,"thread_id":32399,"monetization_status":30006},[772,769,739,736,733,730,727,724,721,718,715,712,709,706,703,700,697,694,691,688,685,682,679,676,673,670,667,664,661,658,655,652,649,646,643,640,637,634,631,628,625,622,619,616,613,610,607,604,589,583,562,559,556,553,550,547,544,538,484,478,475,472,465,462],"s2v9fu7P","sword_blocking","54ylwCOI","VyMl879s","Sword Blocking","Adds the old sword blocking back so you can say hello and It is completely server-sided!!","# What this datapack/mod adds\nThis datapack/mod will let you block with swords like it was in 1.8 but with all the other 1.9 features. You can explore the world and say hello by waggling your sword at people.\n# Note\nonce added to world it cannot be reversed\n# Report bugs here\n[My Discord Server](https://discord.gg/bDhK6ZK6Mc)","2025-01-23T02:46:02.789298Z","2026-04-11T18:48:58.678053Z","2025-01-26T00:43:31.264868Z","2025-01-23T03:03:25.767016Z",{"id":32365,"name":10,"url":32366},"LicenseRef-CSL-1.0","https://github.com/Charken-Inc/Datapacks/blob/main/LICENSE",8898,[115,134,275],[303],[329,342,346,350,354,385,401,405,409,417],[32372,32373,32374,32375,32376,32377,32378,32379,32380,32381,32382,32383,32384,32385,32386],"cFAEccw3","n9nwPcK3","aUL90hxq","d7GDSmtg","HpkGylel","4nYMmtEX","cVLAUQft","XgikjcKa","10rq4e97","vWResbic","CoCRaYRg","pbXPHkFY","pbRsQwCo","UccXS3jo","AyTJXcyX","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2v9fu7P/8296aba3bcf326c52a61e04dfd832041c1f3d31d_96.webp","https://github.com/Charken-Inc/Datapacks/issues","https://github.com/Charken-Inc/Datapacks","https://discord.gg/bDhK6ZK6Mc",[],[32393],{"url":32394,"raw_url":32394,"featured":439,"title":32395,"description":32396,"created":32397,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2v9fu7P/images/8296aba3bcf326c52a61e04dfd832041c1f3d31d.webp","A completely server side experience","This is a datapack so all players on the world it is on can do this","2025-01-23T02:59:15.792310Z",5006924,"2GZWRsvU",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32401,"id":32402,"slug":32403,"project_type":31,"team":32404,"organization":3571,"title":32405,"description":32406,"body":32407,"body_url":3571,"published":32408,"updated":32409,"approved":32410,"queued":32411,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32412,"downloads":32413,"followers":30204,"categories":32414,"additional_categories":32415,"loaders":32416,"versions":32417,"icon_url":32419,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":32420,"donation_urls":32421,"gallery":32422,"color":32428,"thread_id":32429,"monetization_status":30006},[1448],"s3c1Pn26","portalmodadditions","me69RPOs","PortalMod: Additions","An addon that adds decorative blocks and greater functionality to the portalmod mod.","An addon mod for the PortalMod project that adds new blocks, such as the Chamber Icon with several variations, Cores (two variants)\n- Core V1 - 4 Variants\n- Core V2 - 10 Variants\n- that follow the player\n\n\n Additionally, a gel dropper has been added, allowing you to create even more unique challenges for you and your friends","2026-04-26T14:29:55.504530Z","2026-04-26T14:43:17.649136Z","2026-05-02T10:19:53.292734Z","2026-04-26T14:57:00.510609Z",{"id":29973,"name":29974,"url":3571},801,[100,288],[30,303],[354],[32418],"UVF9xHsY","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3c1Pn26/fa598ace8ccd75f37c4e5f15751abf6ba7df0512_96.webp","https://discord.gg/9Qp3nytbSs",[],[32423],{"url":32424,"raw_url":32425,"featured":828,"title":32426,"description":3571,"created":32427,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3c1Pn26/images/4758150d9d752cc77afd255155781bf4d81d04eb_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3c1Pn26/images/4758150d9d752cc77afd255155781bf4d81d04eb.png","All mod items and blocks(For now)","2026-04-26T14:56:53.588066Z",8349518,"enTTolOH",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32431,"id":32432,"slug":32433,"project_type":31,"team":32434,"organization":3571,"title":32435,"description":32436,"body":32437,"body_url":3571,"published":32438,"updated":32439,"approved":32440,"queued":32441,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32442,"downloads":30073,"followers":29976,"categories":32445,"additional_categories":32446,"loaders":32447,"versions":32448,"icon_url":32451,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32452,"gallery":32453,"color":32457,"thread_id":32458,"monetization_status":30006},[826,820,772,769,739,691,649,640,634],"s2Y2oS0k","hollowing","515yAluH","Hollowing","A simple plugin that can control spread plant(bamboo) grow","## Description​​\nPrecisely controls bamboo diffusion growth behavior and manages bamboo hollowing operations.\nno dependencies​​\n\n## Features​\n### Usage\n- Players can use shears on bamboo to hollowing.\n- Removes growth restrictions when marked bamboo is broken.\n  \n### Data Persistence​​\n- Automatically saves hollowing locations to bamboo.yml,simple to manage\n- Supports hot-reloading configurations without server restart\n- All data is stored in YAML files for simple and convenient management.\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/NyR0XLEDLEU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\n\n","2025-07-31T16:08:21.892741Z","2025-08-04T09:07:25.208272Z","2025-08-07T01:10:07.417348Z","2025-08-04T09:01:16.401785Z",{"id":32443,"name":32444,"url":3571},"ISC","ISC License",[134],[],[329,401,405,417],[32449,32450],"VMPoKSmR","N55d9RxN","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2Y2oS0k/2d60c349abe112357a6696a4f7ea1a3e4f5303d1.png",[],[32454],{"url":32455,"raw_url":32455,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":32456,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2Y2oS0k/images/fb3339998bbf25db64f00cf7e1c362cd4814aa63.jpeg","2025-07-31T16:46:43.725835Z",6266145,"UJ3GxX0M",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":32460,"id":32461,"slug":32462,"project_type":12,"team":32463,"organization":3571,"title":32464,"description":32465,"body":32466,"body_url":3571,"published":32467,"updated":32468,"approved":32469,"queued":32470,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32471,"downloads":32472,"followers":30250,"categories":32473,"additional_categories":32474,"loaders":32475,"versions":32476,"icon_url":32478,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32479,"gallery":32480,"color":32486,"thread_id":32487,"monetization_status":30006},[820],"s3DaQrW8","mace-pvp-+","gAz72odC","Mace PvP +","The ultimate texture pack for mace pvp in minecraft.","💎 MACE PvP + | The Ultimate 1.21 Competitive PackTitle: MACE PvP + | CIT Custom Maces, Animated Items, & Low ShieldDescription:MACE PvP + is the ultimate $1.21$ resource pack built for competitive dominance! It combines top-tier PvP optimization with necessary aesthetic mods for a superior combat experience.⚔️ Core Competitive Edge:Low Side Shield: The shield model is lowered and positioned to the side, ensuring maximum visibility during blocking so you never lose sight of your opponent.Clean Crystal: Features a simplified, low-distraction texture for the End Crystal, making it easier to aim at and reducing screen clutter during critical crystal PvP fights.Low-Fire & Clean Particles: Essential optimizations for smooth FPS and minimal screen obstruction.✨ Animated & Custom Features (Requires CIT Resewn):The + in our name is for premium content unlocked via the CIT Resewn mod:🔨 CIT Custom Maces: Unique, high-detail textures for the Mace, giving the 1.21 power weapon the look it deserves.✨ Animated Totem: A mesmerizing, fluid animation for the Totem of Undying.💨 Animated Wind Charge: A dynamic texture for the Wind Charge item, enhancing its look in your inventory.⚠️ NOTE: You MUST have the CIT Resewn mod installed to activate the custom Mace textures.","2025-11-19T01:04:19.110588Z","2025-11-30T03:28:20.461398Z","2025-12-01T10:34:07.351345Z","2025-11-30T03:28:54.859685Z",{"id":30021,"name":10,"url":3571},5899,[15,77,268],[115,300],[377],[32477],"Dyw6u6Go","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3DaQrW8/5be1d3c8f73a1440de74f5b2027e9a772bb5d92c_96.webp",[],[32481],{"url":32482,"raw_url":32483,"featured":439,"title":32484,"description":3571,"created":32485,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3DaQrW8/images/853fe6f7658c0f7984a8e0fa7e1fb90385915832_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3DaQrW8/images/853fe6f7658c0f7984a8e0fa7e1fb90385915832.png","Density and Breach Mace Texture","2025-11-19T13:20:16.965571Z",6052956,"HnZ3oSye",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32489,"id":32490,"slug":32491,"project_type":34,"team":32492,"organization":3571,"title":32493,"description":32494,"body":32495,"body_url":3571,"published":32496,"updated":32497,"approved":32498,"queued":32499,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32500,"downloads":32501,"followers":30221,"categories":32502,"additional_categories":32503,"loaders":32504,"versions":32505,"icon_url":32507,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32508,"gallery":32509,"color":32530,"thread_id":32531,"monetization_status":30006},[820],"s2M0I4I2","builders-zen","uHhfdi1F","Builder's Zen","A relaxing building-focused Minecraft experience designed for creative and peaceful construction.","# 🧱 Builder’s Zen\n\n### A Minecraft Modpack for Creative, Relaxed Building\n\nBuilder’s Zen is all about crafting your ideal world at your own pace — whether you’re decorating a cozy cottage, designing a modern base, or building massive landscapes. This pack focuses on smooth performance, creative freedom, realism, and atmosphere — giving builders the perfect environment to create and unwind.\n\n### 🎨 Enhance Your Building\n\n- Macaw’s Mods (Doors, Windows, Trapdoors, Fences, Stairs) – Huge variety of architectural blocks to give your builds personality and style.\n\n- Yuushya Townscape – Adds intricate urban and traditional details for creative town or city building.\n\n- Diagonal Fences, Walls, and Windows – Build more naturally with smoother angles and transitions.\n\n- WorldEdit – Essential for efficient building, terraforming, and large-scale design work.\n\n### 🏡 Decorate and Customize\n\n- Paladin’s Furniture, Another Furniture, and [Let’s Do] Furniture – Dozens of furniture pieces and decorations for realistic interiors.\n\n- Lucky’s Cozy Home: Refurnished and Dusty Decorations – Add warmth and charm with cozy or rustic decor.\n\n- [Let’s Do] Beachparty – Perfect for creating relaxing outdoor or seaside scenes.\n\n- Backported Shelves and Storage Delight – Neat storage and display options for clutter-free interiors.\n\n### ⚙️ Improve Efficiency\n\n- Just Enough Items (JEI) – Quickly browse recipes and plan your builds without breaking flow.\n\n- Inventory Profiles Next – Organize your items instantly and keep your building tools tidy.\n\n- WorldEdit – (Again, because it’s that essential!) Mass editing and copying for efficient construction.\n\n### 🌿 Realism & Immersion\n\n- Iris Shaders + Complementary Shaders (Reimagined/Unbound) – Stunning lighting and reflection for a serene, beautiful world.\n\n- Better Leaves & Fast Better Grass – More natural-looking foliage and terrain for scenic builds.\n\n- Presence Footsteps & Sound Physics Remastered – Realistic, immersive sound design.\n  \n- Fresh Animations + Not Enough Animations + 3D Skin Layers – Brings your world and characters to life.\n\nLambDynamicLights – Realistic lighting that reacts to torches, lanterns, and more.\n\n### 💬 Atmosphere & Aesthetic Details\n\n- Shrimp’s Immersive Interfaces – Clean, modern UI for better focus and less clutter.\n\n- GUI Experience+ – Subtle visual improvements to menus and interfaces.\n\n- Exposure – In-game camera for creative screenshots and portfolio-worthy builds.\n\n### 🌎 Goal of the Modpack\n\nBuilder’s Zen is designed to help players find peace in creation. It strips away stress and grind, focusing on building, creativity, and immersion. Whether you’re designing in survival or using creative mode, this pack is your relaxing escape — a space where building feels as calming as it looks.","2025-11-07T06:31:19.874116Z","2025-11-07T06:35:45.563778Z","2025-11-07T16:28:57.310786Z","2025-11-07T06:57:25.272637Z",{"id":30564,"name":30565,"url":3571},67,[30,153,200],[],[346],[32506],"6RCqFlJu","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/683e57232c68a5fa6c5ef0a78ac62ae3c8c19398_96.webp",[],[32510,32514,32518,32522,32526],{"url":32511,"raw_url":32512,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":32513,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/0136efb6abb532d1b253313d7d6ccb5732c1d0b2_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/0136efb6abb532d1b253313d7d6ccb5732c1d0b2.png","2025-11-07T08:40:54.903386Z",{"url":32515,"raw_url":32516,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":32517,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/6b2435b13fd6aa1402470360f20af5efc6d055ba_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/6b2435b13fd6aa1402470360f20af5efc6d055ba.png","2025-11-07T08:41:46.228821Z",{"url":32519,"raw_url":32520,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":32521,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/8e7e8b724875617dd5bbb8330b18b497d3d5d211_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/8e7e8b724875617dd5bbb8330b18b497d3d5d211.png","2025-11-07T08:41:33.890387Z",{"url":32523,"raw_url":32524,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":32525,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/9c7ce14bd3b320f64e9e604b9b127915a9341752_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/9c7ce14bd3b320f64e9e604b9b127915a9341752.png","2025-11-07T08:40:33.082632Z",{"url":32527,"raw_url":32528,"featured":439,"title":3571,"description":3571,"created":32529,"ordering":29995},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/cc1e61d5a0660bf2ad68bcafd88ab2c146c526cd_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2M0I4I2/images/cc1e61d5a0660bf2ad68bcafd88ab2c146c526cd.png","2025-11-07T08:41:07.388838Z",4879180,"7I3OcncU",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":30008,"game_versions":32533,"id":32534,"slug":32535,"project_type":31,"team":32536,"organization":3571,"title":32537,"description":32538,"body":32539,"body_url":3571,"published":32540,"updated":32541,"approved":32542,"queued":32543,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32544,"downloads":32545,"followers":30221,"categories":32546,"additional_categories":32547,"loaders":32548,"versions":32549,"icon_url":32553,"issues_url":32554,"source_url":32555,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":32556,"donation_urls":32557,"gallery":32562,"color":32563,"thread_id":32564,"monetization_status":30006},[583,538,484],"s3Jo1jiI","elytracancel","l71K4mr4","ElytraCancel","Client side mod to cancel elytra flight with a keybind.","This mod adds a simple but incredibly useful feature for Elytra users: the ability to cancel your flight at any moment with a customizable keybind. By default, the key is set to Mouse Button 4, but you can change it to whatever works best for your setup.\n\nNormally in vanilla Minecraft, once you start gliding with an Elytra, you have very limited control over stopping midair. This can be frustrating when you want to quickly drop straight down, land precisely, or avoid overshooting your destination. With this mod, you can instantly halt your flight with a single keypress, giving you much more control over your aerial movement.\n\nWhen the key is pressed, your Elytra flight ends immediately, allowing gravity to take over so you can fall, land, or re-engage your glide however you choose. It’s perfect for maneuvering around tight spaces, performing precise landings, or improving your mobility during exploration, PvP, or parkour.\n\nThis mod is fully client-side, meaning it works on any server without requiring installation on the server side. As long as you have the mod installed on your client, the keybind functionality will work in both singleplayer and multiplayer worlds.\n\n---\n[\u003Cimg alt=\"discord-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\">](https://discord.com/invite/jpFJG8dujR)\n[\u003Cimg alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\">](https://ko-fi.com/kasetoatz)\n[\u003Cimg alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\">](https://paypal.me/KaasToast)\n\nLooking for a fun place to play Minecraft and try out some of my mods? Come hang out on the El Basurero SMP!\n\n- **IP:** `play.ebsmp.com`\n- **Recommended Version:** 1.21.11 (other versions work too!)\n- **Bedrock Edition:** Supported\n- **Bonus:** Test out most of my server-side mods live in-game!","2025-12-03T20:42:56.365797Z","2026-04-01T16:15:52.409655Z","2025-12-13T06:43:43.288444Z","2025-12-09T08:10:35.592050Z",{"id":29973,"name":29974,"url":3571},827,[],[],[346],[32550,32551,32552],"3XuhXtuk","V7qAkd9R","s9ovTLbt","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3Jo1jiI/1e9cd828b5f5964ee2a98a6cb8c29238026b5cf8_96.webp","https://git.kasetoatz.com/KaseToatz/ElytraCancel/issues","https://git.kasetoatz.com/KaseToatz/ElytraCancel","https://discord.com/invite/jpFJG8dujR",[32558,32560],{"id":3122,"platform":30578,"url":32559},"https://paypal.me/KaasToast",{"id":3128,"platform":3129,"url":32561},"https://ko-fi.com/kasetoatz",[],6587997,"v2Adce3V",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32566,"id":32567,"slug":32568,"project_type":31,"team":32569,"organization":3571,"title":32570,"description":32571,"body":32572,"body_url":3571,"published":32573,"updated":32574,"approved":32575,"queued":32576,"status":29947,"requested_status":29949,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32577,"downloads":32580,"followers":29976,"categories":32581,"additional_categories":32582,"loaders":32583,"versions":32584,"icon_url":32606,"issues_url":32607,"source_url":32608,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32609,"gallery":32610,"color":32611,"thread_id":32612,"monetization_status":30006},[583,538,484,478,465],"s2RXyQ1L","super-duper-mod","sAb86n2k","gurkan's super duper mod","a mod with random additions that I find neat","# gurkan's super duper mod\n\nthis is a mod _mainly intended_ for a private minecraft server that i'm running, but people might like it so i'm publishing it anyways\n\nthis mod adds the following:\n- ~~a silence mobs name tag (configurable), ported from [VanillaTweaks](https://vanillatweaks.net/) (since 0.2.0, removed in 0.6.0)~~\n- a silencer stick (since 0.6.0)\n- leashable villagers (since 0.3.0)\n- disables crop trampling when you have feather falling (or the slow falling effect) (since 0.3.0)\n\n## credits\nVanilla Tweaks: https://vanillatweaks.net/ (only applies for versions under 0.6.0)","2025-10-21T14:17:15.640751Z","2026-05-27T20:10:17.113758Z","2025-10-27T04:46:52.650180Z","2025-10-24T07:19:41.301826Z",{"id":32578,"name":32579,"url":3571},"MPL-2.0","Mozilla Public License 2.0",761,[],[],[346],[32585,32586,32587,32588,32589,32590,32591,32592,32593,32594,32595,32596,32597,32598,32599,32600,32601,32602,32603,32604,32605],"QfDLxOul","1ms8oUgh","BuJBcaZu","FnJNWggI","XZfbXgGq","U9sRmo8f","YRORhjiu","Hn1RXmNd","8nTVNuxK","sdf0S3n4","OpNRuQ9i","BsXRCxED","FTOQPatq","yZJxX3UB","79LhAKFY","JXY6HSeo","3OwcJHoE","t7jElngL","gBnW2csb","lBzAuw8F","8bZyo54i","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s2RXyQ1L/6eb0710421ea235a0b3c26d5661446ab18c3e847_96.webp","https://github.com/thatgurkangurk/superdupermod/issues","https://github.com/thatgurkangurk/superdupermod",[],[],14136225,"XYvpxOoq",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32614,"id":32615,"slug":32616,"project_type":31,"team":32617,"organization":3571,"title":32618,"description":32619,"body":32620,"body_url":3571,"published":32621,"updated":32622,"approved":32621,"queued":3571,"status":29947,"requested_status":3571,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32623,"downloads":32624,"followers":32625,"categories":32626,"additional_categories":32627,"loaders":32628,"versions":32629,"icon_url":32633,"issues_url":32634,"source_url":32635,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":32636,"donation_urls":32637,"gallery":32640,"color":32641,"thread_id":32615,"monetization_status":30006},[1193,1028],"s3OAIWE7","dimensional-anchor","LWmjaxrO","Dimensional Anchor","A mod that gives teleportation functionality to Lodestones","\u003Ch1>In the world of Minecraft...\u003C/h1>\n\u003Cp>Adventurers seek out powerful artifacts and magical items to aid them on their quests. One such item is the Lodestone, a rare and expensive block that only the most skilled artisans can craft, making use of one of the rarest ingots in the world. And for what? To make compasses point towards it. As you can imagine, many adventurers find the Lodestone to be a useless trinket, a symbol of the excesses of the wealthy.\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Ch2>But fear not, for a new artifact has been discovered: the Dimensional Anchor.\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>With this powerful artifact installed, the Lodestone becomes much more than a mere decorative item. It becomes a gateway to another dimension, a beacon of hope for those seeking to teleport across great distances.\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Ch3>To use the Dimensional Anchor, adventurers must first link their compass to a Lodestone by right-clicking on it.\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Then, with the linked compass in hand, they must charge it up by holding down the right mouse button. The power required to teleport varies depending on the distance and dimension, so adventurers must be careful not to overtax their reserves of experience points.\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Ch4>Costs:\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cul>\n  \u003Cli>If both the player and the Lodestone are in the same dimension, teleportation costs 5 levels of experience points (configurable).\u003C/li>\n  \u003Cli>If the player and the Lodestone are in different dimensions, teleportation costs 30 levels of experience points (configurable).\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\n\u003Ch4>Risks:\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cul>\n  \u003Cli>Attempting to teleport without enough experience points can result in one of the following penalties:\n    \u003Cul>\n      \u003Cli>Taking 1-5 points of damage and being teleported normally.\u003C/li>\n      \u003Cli>Having the compass break and nothing happening.\u003C/li>\n      \u003Cli>Being teleported to a random valid location within a 50-block radius around the Lodestone in any dimension, losing all experience points.\u003C/li>\n    \u003C/ul>\n  \u003C/li>\n  \u003Cli>If the player and the Lodestone are in different dimensions, the risks are greater and the player will certainly take 5-10 points of damage, the compass will break, and then it will randomly suffer one of these extra effects:\n    \u003Cul>\n      \u003Cli>Nothing happens.\u003C/li>\n      \u003Cli>The player gets teleported to a random location in the same dimension.\u003C/li>\n      \u003Cli>The player gets teleported to a random dimension in the same coordinates.\u003C/li>\n      \u003Cli>The player gets teleported to a random dimension and coordinates.\u003C/li>\n    \u003C/ul>\n  \u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\n\u003Cp>Note: If installed on the client, there will be a decreasing field of view (FOV) effect displayed when charging up the Lodestone compass. And while there are no plans for a Forge version, mod developers interested in making a Forge version can send a direct message to the creator.\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Ch3>Note for Modpack Makers\u003C/h3>\n\n\u003Cp>You're free to use our mods in your Modpacks so long the download is redirected either to here or CurseForge. No credit is necessary, although appreciated! \n\n\nThanks for using our mods! ","2022-06-25T18:21:58.553819Z","2023-06-10T04:33:38.842554Z",{"id":29973,"name":29974,"url":3571},507,9,[171,297,303],[30],[346],[32630,32631,32632],"G1FS1y8s","PQGtxUJm","P9u1SaCz","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s3OAIWE7/09eb787e919b0c30d2efda5c18ae450c2033bec6_96.webp","https://github.com/OverlordsIII/DimensionalAnchor/issues","https://github.com/OverlordsIII/DimensionalAnchor","https://discord.gg/CnYTQ85mE2",[32638],{"id":3128,"platform":3129,"url":32639},"https://ko-fi.com/yando",[],1742483,{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32643,"id":32644,"slug":32645,"project_type":31,"team":32646,"organization":3571,"title":32647,"description":32648,"body":32649,"body_url":3571,"published":32650,"updated":32651,"approved":32652,"queued":32653,"status":29947,"requested_status":29947,"moderator_message":3571,"license":32654,"downloads":32655,"followers":30221,"categories":32656,"additional_categories":32657,"loaders":32658,"versions":32659,"icon_url":3571,"issues_url":3571,"source_url":3571,"wiki_url":3571,"discord_url":3571,"donation_urls":32668,"gallery":32669,"color":3571,"thread_id":32670,"monetization_status":30006},[1022],"s2kPgRFk","the-hidden-global","Qp7zQxzW","THE HIDDEN GLOBAL (Discounted)","This Project Adds Entitys Like Null","__**Read Please!**__\n\nThis Mod Is Gonna Be Lost!\nNew Version In[curseforge.com](https://old.curseforge.com/)\n\nThis Mod Has A Lot Of Loud Noises And Can Ban You So Please Stay Safe\n\n[![YouTube](https://img.shields.io/badge/Visit-My%20YouTube-red?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube)](https://www.youtube.com/@LicoLeafy)\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nWhat Does Adds This Mod?:\n\nThis Mod Adds Scary Things Like Entitys Ban Kicks And More\n\nWhy Would A User Want To Download It?:\n\nBecause Its Scary!\n\nWhen I Open Minecraft This Mod Crashes?:\n\nIf You Using Some Mods It Can Crash So I Recommend Using Without Some Mods\n\nI Have Problem I Cant Get Unbanned?:\n\nWe Trying To Fix It And I Think Set FPS To 10 / 20 To Get Unbanned But One Entity Can Kick Us\n\nWhat Features Does It Have?:\n\nThis Mod Addes Features Like Baning Or Kick Players So Pls Stay Safe When You See Entitys\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n**✅ Features:**\n1. Baning Players\n2. Kicking Players\n3. Events Like Showing Text RUN!\n4. Entitys Chase Players\n\nPlease Use Texture Pack:\n[Nostalgic Texture Pack](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/golden-days)\n\nVideos:\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/z3eKQG-zCjQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/th-6CIrLAkc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\nImages:\n\n![Null](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c30aba33fbeaf9c56f1f98e19877f48cd2c2dd64_0.webp)\n\n\nI want make this mod to be cool and scary","2026-01-18T08:42:26.335244Z","2026-04-23T09:00:24.762232Z","2026-02-05T07:07:14.297198Z","2026-02-04T08:58:38.267279Z",{"id":29973,"name":29974,"url":3571},177,[93,134,191],[],[354],[32660,32661,32662,32663,32664,32665,32666,32667],"TG38qGYU","fkrsBVds","SqQfA9eN","Z0ic5zBK","dQorN5Ut","bg0OfLtL","RPLiNK7t","hfFAqysH",[],[],"3RzMEShD",{"hits":32672,"offset":29995,"limit":30273,"total_hits":32736},[32673,32691,32717],{"project_id":32674,"project_type":31,"slug":326